{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1530141-god-s-away-on-business-mta2e-seer-chronicle-occ","id":1530141,"title":"God(s) Away on Business [MtA2E Seer Chronicle OCC]","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play","Play by Post"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-02-07T00:53:34-08:00","id":1530141,"title":"God(s) Away on Business [MtA2E Seer Chronicle OCC]","content":"<b>God(s) Away on Business<br /> A Mage the Awakening 2E, Seers of the Throne Chronicle</b><br /> <br /> <i>\u201cThere's leak, there's a leak, in the boiler room<br /> The poor, the lame, the blind<br /> Who are the ones that we kept in charge?<br /> Killers, thieves, and lawyers\u201d<br /> Tom Waits, \u201cGod\u2019s Away on Business\u201d</i><br /> <br /> This is a chronicle set in the world of Mage the Awakening, Second Edition focused on a group of Seers of the Throne, will workers who have dedicated their lives to the service of the Exarchs, the secret chiefs of the cosmos.<br /> <br /> This group, or pylon, are based in London, UK and are mostly in the service of the Ministry of Mammon, which dedicates itself to the service of the Exarch of the Arcanum of Matter, commonly known as the Chancellor. The Queen of Numbers controls the sleeping world through the concept of ownership, property, and economics based on scarcity. Everything has a price. Everything can be bought or sold, including human souls. And as all Seers believe\u2026Magic is payment.<br /> <br /> Most of humanity, known as sleepers, think that the world they live in, of cups of tea, tube stations, and the morning news on the telly, is real. A select, chosen few have awakened and know that the phenomenal world is the symbolic manifestation of a higher realm, the Supernal. Some of the Awakened view this world as a lie, and like spoiled, ungrateful children on Christmas morning they tear through the wrapping papers of mystery to get at the truths within, fiddle about with and sometimes break their new toys, and then whine and complain that they are bored and want something else. Others, a very special few, are the dutiful, grateful servants of the rightful rulers of the Supernal, the Exarchs. They view the precious mysteries they have been granted sight of as messages from the Exarchs, precious gifts and tools to help the Seer guide and direct sleepers, shape the phenomenal world according to the Exarch\u2019s will, and aide them on their journey ever higher towards assentation, towards the Supernal, where they may join their masters as faithful servants, justly rewarded, paid in full, for their lives below.<br /> <br /> London is one of the world\u2019s great cities. It is the capital and largest city of the United Kingdom, and has a population of roughly eight million people. While there is some evidence that humans have inhabited the area since the second millennium before the common era, the City of London was first established by the Romans in 47 CE. Once the outer frontier of their empire, London became the center of its own mighty empire in the 18th and 19th centuries, an empire that has since dwindled. While the British no longer rule over the world through the power of their mighty navy and many colonies, London remains a powerful economic and cultural force, in Europe and around the globe.<br /> <br /> This chronicle is set beginning in 2016 when the political and economic hegemony of the European Union was threatened by the proposed withdrawal of the United Kingdom, an agreement that was hoped would boost the power of the UK and the British economy and halt the \u201cEuropeanization\u201d of the island nation. Culturally this manifested as a contest between those who felt that British identity was being threatened by immigrants and foreign influence and those who feared that a more isolated Britain would become a more authoritarian, illiberal, and even fascist Britain.<br /> <br /> The Awakened know that hidden within the visible world are invisible realms of Mind and Shadow. The world of Spirit, known in the United Kingdoms as \u201cThe Other\u201d is very ancient and filled with wounds and scars as human and inhuman inhabitants add layer after layer of emotional resonance upon the ephemeral landscape. The world of the Mind, the Astral realm, shaped by the collective unconscious of humanity and other entities, both reflects and influences the sense of identity, meaning, and purpose that fill sleepers' heads. The high tension in the hearts and minds of the UK\u2019s peoples was bound to cause change and even conflict in these invisible realms.<br /> <br /> Some Seers see a sign in the shifting alliances of the sleepers of a larger snag in the great tapestry. Could there be some kind of conflict between the wills of the current Archgenitors, The Eye, The Unity, The General and the Father and the other Exarchs, such the Chancellor or the Prophet? Or is something even stranger going on? This intuition on the part of some Seers has led to a feeling of mistrust between different ministries, beyond the normal antagonism expressed by those competing to prove themselves worthy to move higher up the Iron Pyramid.<br /> <br /> Settled on both banks of the Thames river, London is known for such landmarks as the Tower Bridge, Trafalgar Square and Nelson\u2019s Column, the Houses of Parliament and Big Ben, and a large observation wheel known as the Eye of London. The most recent major addition to the city skyline is a pyramid shaped tower of iron and glass on the south bank, which has come to be known by Londoners as the Spire. This mixed-use development supertall skyscraper was designed by an Italian architect who claims that the plans for the building came to him in a dream, and it is managed by a firm headed by the eccentric aristocrat Lord Roland. A corporation owned by the Kingdom of Jordan also has considerable shareholdings in the building. The Spire is one the tallest structures in Europe, after similar buildings in Poland and Russia, and is the second tallest in England, after the Yorkshire Radio Transmission Station tower.<br /> The Spire houses several corporate headquarters for powerful companies, including energy, high tech, food and beverage, and fashion industries, a prominent media company, and a multinational law firm. It also has a five star hotel and restaurant, The Periya Vellai Hotel, and privately owned apartments, home to some of the wealthiest residents of London. The Spire is a state-of-the-art facility, very energy efficient, with some of the fastest elevators in the world that can take one to the high observation deck and cocktail bar. The Spire has an extremely high-tech security system, and Winterhold Bank, a multinational financial institution based in Switzerland, WBS for short, has a vault there that their experts claim is impenetrable.<br /> <br /> One of the Spire\u2019s newest tenants is the Wellington School of Business, a small university that also sponsors free academy schools for 14-18 age group students throughout the city. Despite complaints from the old government education establishment, these schools promise a brighter future for many of the most underprivileged students in London as it seeks to mold the \u201cbrightest minds of the future\u201d.<br /> <br /> London has become an increasingly expensive place to live. The center of the city has been taken over by the rich and powerful, and the less fortunate are slowly being pushed out. On the other side of Southwark from the Spire, the borough council has recently decided that one of its large council estates, low income housing built for the poor in the \u201cbrutalist\u201d style after the war, is in need of renovation. Lord Roland\u2019s real estate development firm and their Jordanian backers are being considered for the role of creating a new estate for \u201cmodern and upwardly mobile\u201d Londoners. They await a decision from the borough council.<br /> <br /> <b>*Disclaimer*</b><br /> <b>This is a fictional game. While some of the places and people depicted by the Storyteller are fictionalized versions of real life people and places, no disrespect is intended towards them. We do not mean to imply that London is controlled by evil wizards, as far as we know.</b><br /> <br /> <b>*2nd Disclaimer*</b><br /> <b>The Storyteller is not from the UK, and has never lived there. We intend to provide as much verisimilitude as we can, but some inaccuracies may occur in the depiction of British society, politics, and culture. Again, no disrespect is intended.</b>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27436,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","user":"CalvinSiler","date":". 05-02-2024, 05:04 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-07T01:21:42-08:00","id":1530143,"title":"","content":"This is the OCC, Out-of-Character, thread for the game. It is for Storyteller/Player interaction, instructions, questions, information, and dice rolls. I'll set up an In-Character thread for character interactions in a little bit.<br /> <br /> So far, based on the description above we have a few story elements going on:<br /> <br /> 1. Winterhold Banking Services, a Swiss based multinational financial institution<br /> 2. Roland Property Group, a real estate development firm currently backed by Jordanian money (opportunity?). Owners of the Spire and potential developers of the Walworth Estate.<br /> 3. Southwark London Borough Council, a 63 member governing body for South Central London controlled by Labor Party. The last election prior to the start of this game was 2012 (an auspicious year!)<br /> 4. Wellingtion School of Business, backers of several year 7 -11 free schools, including one near Walworth Estate, Thatcher Academy.<br /> 5. And of course all of these...ehem... businesses need data and information. At a price.<br /> <br /> Does everyone want to briefly introduce your characters and how they connect to this world?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-07T08:55:24-08:00","id":1530167,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-size:18px\"><b>Mekhane</b></span><br /> <b>Name:</b> Alexis Levidis<br /> <b>Age:</b> 30<br /> <b>Height: </b>1.8m<br /> <b>Eyes:</b> Brown<br /> <b>Hair:</b> Black<br /> <b>Path:</b> Obrimos<br /> <span style=\"color:#252c2f\"><b>Legacy (eventually):</b></span><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1526287-the-argus-protocol-an-obrimos-legacy-of-counterintelligence-agents\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\"><u>Argus Protocol</u></span></a><br /> <b>Immediate Nimbus:</b> Data streams appear before one\u2019s eyes and important items are highlighted digitally (+1 Wits).<br /> <b>Signature Nimbus:</b> The feeling of being disconnected from current events, of missing something important.<br /> <b>Long Term Nimbus: </b>People become more interested in studying technology and become early adopters of new ones.<br /> <b>Dedicated Magical Tools:</b> His Shadow Name and his sunglasses, which have High Speech sigils for \u201cknowledge\u201d engraved in steel in one temple and one for \u201cindustry\u201d engraved in gold in the other.<br /> <b>Concept:</b> Information Broker<br /> <br /> <b>Background</b><br /> <br /> A second generation Greek immigrant, Alexis always had a passion for technology from an early age, taking programming classes, joining the robotics club, learning about digital forensics, entering hackathons and more. It was no surprise to his friends and family when, years later, he was contracted as a researcher at Walsingham Infosec. Calling on every professional contact he had, he assembled a team for the most ambitious project yet: a subcutaneous implant that provides an interface with a paired security system. Initial tests using wireless EEG sensors and AR goggles showed promising results, with custom software refining the level of precision users could achieve and miniaturization of hardware well under way.<br /> <br /> <b>The Awakening</b><br /> <br /> After 4 years of development, the first prototype was ready to be shown to potential investors, only for the project to be suddenly canceled. Before the team could make a presentation appealing to the executives, the lab was emptied overnight. He was told the project was sold to private investors, the team would receive a bonus and be reassigned and all data on the project would be redacted. The invention would have revolutionized security and perhaps earned the team a technology award, having it capriciously spirited away did not sit well with him, so he began to investigate.<br /> <br /> Hidden in the company's database, he learned the hardware would be sent to a shipping company, which would handle the rest. Entering it at night and looking around, he was drawn to a reproduction of an Antikythera mechanism. Working on instinct, he set it to the date the project was stolen, causing it to shift and turn, like a Japanese puzzle box solving itself. A camera lens appeared, his vision blurring as its flash went off.<br /> <br /> When his vision returned, he saw some kind of factory. Data flowed freely in the air, tangible, making frames for clockwork machines to be built as the pieces were moving, magnetized as if to assemble by their own free will into impossible latticework. As incredible as it all was, something felt amiss, the factory felt outdated.<br /> <br /> Moving deeper into the complex, he was able to follow his data to a command center, a giant combination of golden pipes and alpha channel tvs, with a keyboard and command prompt at its center. The monitors showed beings of kinetic energy and data, animated bioorganic circuit humanoids and many more trying to invade the factory. All moving at the rhythm of a console, which flashed and whirled like a beating heart.<br /> <br /> Whatever the thing was, Alexis instinctively felt it breaching the factory was catastrophic. The machines were fighting it back, but it was all done by the AI running the command console. It was slow, inefficient, the data processing and transmission done one line at a time. It was then he noticed his prototype at the base of the keyboard and he knew what he had to do.<br /> <br /> Working quickly, he grasped the data for his software and the data for the driver of the system, using them as pieces to complete the prototype. Installing the implant in the back of his neck, it quickly began interfacing with the AI. Occult laws and system information flooded into his mind, allowing him to start streamlining the factory's data flow and processing. Between the shared consensus with the AI, the robots routed the invaders, the console and its remaining troops digitized away in retreat. Before he could question further, he too was digitized away.<br /> <br /> Now back at the shipping company, he saw the statue was gone. When he called his team to follow up on the investigation, no one knew him, none of his professional contacts knew him, not even his family remembered he worked for Walsingham. His mind was still full of methods to remain supernaturally discrete and a name echoed in his mind: Mekhane.<br /> <br /> In the following months Alexis found a new job in another tech firm, but he never stopped looking into the incident. He could still access the implant, but doctors found nothing where it was supposed to be.<br /> <br /> Eventually his questions about technological mysteries lead him to an agent of Mammon. She argued that if he wanted to prevent his research from being used by bigger fish, he needed to have personal power, resources, both mundane and supernatural. Mekhane agreed and promptly joined the Seers. Upon completing his training, he decided to focus on the most valuable commodity of all: data. Those that had the most data could navigate the most difficult situations, seize opportunities and make a tidy profit.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 02-07-2024, 12:32 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-07T12:15:41-08:00","id":1530190,"title":"","content":"Great! Go ahead and take a beat for posting your character description.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-10T03:39:39-08:00","id":1530431,"title":"","content":"Anyone else?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-10T22:33:47-08:00","id":1530533,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b>Mother Time</b></span><br /> <b>True Name:</b> Bridgitte Timothy<br /> <b>Age:</b> 44<br /> <b>Height:</b> 5'2&quot;<br /> <b>Weight:</b> 140 lbs<br /> <b>Hair:</b> Dark Brown<br /> <b>Eyes:</b> Brown (+Glasses)<br /> <u><b>Path:</b></u> Acanthus<br /> <u><b>Legacy:</b></u> None (Currently)<br /> <b>Long-Term Nimbus:</b> People connected to Mother Time tend to meet up with each other at times with matching numbers (i.e. 7:07 AM, 11:11 PM, etc.)<br /> <b>Immediate Nimbus:</b> The senses accelerate, causing the outside world to slow down to a crawl (+1 Wits)<br /> <b>Signature Nimbus:</b> Anything that comes in contact with the Mage's magic seems to move slower, even though it arrives at its destination at the same speed. A car still moves 60 MPH, it just appears to move there at 30-45 before its suddenly there.<br /> <b>Dedicated Tool:</b> A silver pocket watch with the engraving &quot;Time Flies and Flees.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>Background:</b> Raised with the expectations of a &quot;gifted child,&quot; Bridgitte from a young age felt that she was destined to become something great. And for a time, this held true, her grades were exceptional, school was easy, it seemed like great things would come to her in the future. She graduated at the top of her class in secondary school, went to Oxford on a scholarship... and it all came tumbling down. There she learned the truth: She was no more a genius than any of the other thousands of students attending. She was but a slightly large fish in an oh-so large pond, and in the end, she never did become that &quot;destined child&quot; which everyone assumed she would be.<br /> <br /> <b>Awakening:</b> After settling for a life as an educator, due to an inability to find work in anything else, Bridgitte pondered the life she had been given thus far over the years. The weight of expectations as a child had seemed like vapor, but when the truth of how great she truly was came out, they suddenly felt like an Everest on each shoulder. Had all of the adults around been wrong, to declare her to be someone with enough talent and intellect to make it far in the world? Yes... and no. The issue was the expectations themselves... it was that they weren't true. These almost-divinations that were performed on the younger her by parents and teachers were simply getting incorrect information, even if they had the right idea.<br /> <br /> And so it was, when she became the school principal, that she found herself in a fae glade, surrounded by soothsayers and horologians, all chained to the will of the Exarch known as the Prophet. The Prophet declared that yes, Bridgitte would be great, under his expectations. With his certainty, she would be a Seer that could finally live up to the great demands of the future set upon her in the past. Like a hobbled man removing his burden, Bridgitte let herself be steered by the Prophet's will, joining their Ministry and embarking to enforce the true future onto the rising generations.<br /> <br /> <b>Personality:</b> <i><u>As Ms. Timothy</u></i>, she serves as a &quot;realist,&quot; showing the truth of her student's futures to them to alleviate the pain of false greatness. Why bother deluding James with the promise of a Football career if he's not quick on his feet? Why hide the reality of Margaret's disability in regards to potential prospects? Better to crush that senseless optimism now, and spare them their future suffering. <u><i>As Mother Time,</i></u> she is this but on a far grander scale. Every day, some new idiot in society believes that they have what it takes to change the future &quot;for the better,&quot; or so they claim. But a certain future is a far kinder one. With no uncertainty, there is no risk of disappointment, only the fulfillment of what was always intended. Mother Time is meant to pass the torch to the New Year, the next generation, and she doesn't wish to deceive them. They will never be as great as they think they can be, <b><i>and that's just fine.</i></b>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26317-critian-caceorte","name":"Critian Caceorte","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-11T23:11:41-08:00","id":1530612,"title":"","content":"Great! Take a beat for posting your character description.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25357-lorekeeper\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar25357_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"25357\" data-vbnamecard=\"25357\">Lorekeeper</a> , <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27809-victorofnyke\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27809\" data-vbnamecard=\"27809\">VictorOfNyke</a> , <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28057-nickeldan\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28057\" data-vbnamecard=\"28057\">nickeldan</a> ?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-13T04:10:30-08:00","id":1530731,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b>Primark</b></span><br /> <b>Sympathetic Name: </b>David McDonald<br /> <b>Age: </b>35<br /> <b>Height:</b> 172cm (5'7'')<br /> <b>Weight:</b> 82kg (180 lbs)<br /> <b>Hair:</b> Dark Brown<br /> <b>Eyes:</b> Brown<br /> <b>Path: </b>Mastigos<br /> <b>Legacy:</b> None<br /> <b>Long-Term Nimbus: </b>A sense of inspiration, as though ideas stream in faster than before, hangs over Primark<br /> <b>Immediate Nimbus:</b> Greater problem-solving and faster application of thought (+1 Intelligence)<br /> <b>Signature Nimbus: </b>A sense of completion and accomplishment remains as Primark's magic lingers<br /> <b>Dedicated Tool:</b> An iron coin fastened to his neck with a strip of leather<br /> <b>Concept:</b> Company man playing the game of the corporate ladder<br /> <br /> <b>Background:</b> David McDonald grew up in London with a upper-middle class wealthy father and a stay-at-home mother, Jonathan and Anne McDonald. Jonathan and Anne divorced when David was 7, after marital unfaithfulness on his father's part, and David was largely living with his father after this event. He learned much of his life methods from his father, even aiming to follow in his footsteps, even bettering him. David grew his corporate portfolio over many years, and for the past few he has enjoyed the comforts of middle management within Winterhold Banking Services.<br /> <br /> <b>Awakening:</b> It was while working overtime that David experienced his Awakening. A few other members of his team were working late, and he felt they were, as a whole, falling behind and costing the company, and therefore himself, money. Pushing his team further into their work, David often took over from others at their machines, working quickly to keep up with the looming deadlines. As he continued, he felt his presence over his staff naturally urged them on, though to his team it was like a maddening inspiration had taken hold of him. The Dream became ever more real to David, until he came to its end as the team finished their task. An email later, to an address he now can't recall, and the ecstatic stress of his awakening subsided, his new world suddenly laid out before him. Not long after, he finds himself among Seers, within the ministry of Mammon, an organisation that caters to his exact desires; to climb the pyramid, and to play the games of power<br /> <br /> <b>Description and Personality: </b>David wears a suit at almost all times, black or navy blue, with a light blue or white shirt beneath. His shoes are either all-black trainers for comfort, or black or brown dress shoes. As Primark, he wears much of the same clothing with a large woollen coat over the top rather than a blazer, covering much of his Sympathetic identifiers. He is clean-shaven, with swept-up hair and a neatly kept facial care routine.<br /> <br /> Primark is little caring for the people around him, opting to see everyone as tools and obstacles, which he would expect any wise person to do the same of him. He harbours no resentment to any rival or enemy who uses such tools to get ahead, save for making sure those people are kept as rivals so that he may rise above them one day.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Consumer of lore, myth, history, tales and songs. Pronoun ambiguous. <br /> <i><b><span style=\"color:#9b111e\">This isn't gonna be easy, but the fact that you're even trying says a lot about you. You're braver than you think.</span></b></i> --RWBY V5C5","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25357-lorekeeper","name":"Lorekeeper","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25357_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"66"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-13T15:01:22-08:00","id":1530758,"title":"","content":"Wonderful! Take a beat for posting your character description.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-14T05:40:06-08:00","id":1530801,"title":"","content":"I added a document in the player's folder that describes your various social merits. Let me know if there is something I missed.<br /> <br /> Its interesting that <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28057-nickeldan\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28057\" data-vbnamecard=\"28057\">nickeldan</a> 's character has the highest resources, but <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26317-critian-caceorte\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"26317\" data-vbnamecard=\"26317\">Critian Caceorte</a> has the highest Seer status despite her modest resources. Could lead to interesting character interactions.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-14T06:10:14-08:00","id":1530807,"title":"","content":"Week 2 Check in.<br /> <br /> Still waiting on character descriptions from <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28057-nickeldan\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28057\" data-vbnamecard=\"28057\">nickeldan</a> and <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27809-victorofnyke\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27809\" data-vbnamecard=\"27809\">VictorOfNyke</a>. I'd like to hear from them before we start the first chapter of the story.<br /> <br /> How's everyone else doing?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-17T21:02:29-08:00","id":1531047,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-size:20px\"><b>Saulin</b></span><br /> Real name: Salil Amjad<br /> Age: 35<br /> Concept: Silver-spoon scion with central planning aspirations<br /> Path: Thyrsus<br /> Dedicated magical tool: Petrified acorn gilded in copper and worn on a chain around the neck.<br /> <br /> Salil comes from a wealthy family well-entrenched in the Jordanian business world who moved to the UK when Salil was 12. Naturally, he was groomed to follow in his father's footsteps and studied Business at Cambridge. He had been working at his father's company few a years when, one night, after getting high with some co-workers, he had a waking dream. He remembers walking down the sidewalk when the cement beneath his feet cracked and collapsed, dropping him into a subterranean cavern. Stunned, he looked up to see a host of strange creatures moving along the ceiling. They crawled, slithered, burrowed, and pulsated in and out of the living stone. As he watched in wonder, his perspective shifted and he was able to follow the creatures as they climbed through the earth into the world above. He saw them move in and out of buildings, vehicles, even people's heads. He eventually realized that the world he though he understood was inextricably and symbiotically intermixed with this alien ecosystem. It was thriving and beautiful and... chaotic. These creatures were not intelligent agents wisely directing the environment around them. Instead, they were senseless and primal beasts carelessly tromping through our world. As he watched in both wonder and dismay, he saw a red, slime-covered salamander crawl in and out of a man's body as the man, clearly drunk, violently assaulted a woman in an alley. Salil rushed over, wrestled the creature away, and pinned it to the ground. It snarled and spat at him, but he made quick work of it by pummeling it with his fists. Right before he passed out from the ordeal, he saw the creature's blood form his name on the street.<br /> <br /> Salil, or Saulin as he eventually chose to be called, was quickly picked up by Seers. While his parents were neither mages nor sleepwalkers, his father's business empire had been thoroughly infiltrated by agents of the Throne. Saulin believes the Spirit world to be a valuable resource if properly managed. Sleepers, who have neither knowledge of nor defenses against such things, need to be protected and shepherded. Saulin, for the greater good, is happy to be that shepherd.<br /> <br /> &quot;We\u2019re making a better world. All of them, better worlds.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28057-nickeldan","name":"nickeldan","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-18T10:36:30-08:00","id":1531062,"title":"","content":"Great! Take a beat for posting your character description.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-18T12:57:05-08:00","id":1531068,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-size:20px\"><b>Berith</b></span><br /> Sympathetic Name: Thomas Haytham<br /> Age: 28 years of age<br /> Concept: Politician, controlling the now with a hand on the past and and eye to the future.<br /> Path: Moros<br /> Dedicated tool: A Silver Ring that doubles as a soul stone.<br /> Long-Term Nimbus: Feelings of stagnation, the air becomes stiller, and things seem more and more unchanging before seeming minutely new<br /> Hair: Ear-length black and wavy<br /> Eye-color: Dull Green<br /> Height: 180 cm<br /> Weight: About 12 stone, 77kg<br /> <br /> Background: Born as Thomas Haytham, Thomas scraped through shitty job through shitty job, bowing to politicians above him as he interned, managed, and seemed to hit dead ends. As a sleeper, Thomas was hitting a dead end. He lacked the resources, lacked the connections, and lacked the momentum behind him. As a Mage, he finally had a shot and quickly climbed the ladder, meeting the Guardians and bring indiscreet with his seeming defection to the Guardians, carrying a soul stone of his mentor with him to that of the Iron Pyramid under the Ministry of Mammon. Now, Thomas stands with at least his own meager backing of political power in their local borough council, able to shape the community and its resources with time.<br /> <br /> Awakening<br /> He woke up to the same day, twenty five times. At first, he thought he was simply in a rut. A bad case of Deja vu. The same questions, similar tasks, dutifully following the commands of his superiors. The second time he lived that day, it was an oddity. Maybe he was slipping. The second, the third, when he started to be able to quote back what his boss wanted? It was becoming clear. For the next three weeks he repeated the day, finding each day a little bit more success when he weighed his choices against his past failures. He was provided a perspective never possessed before. That the old Thomas would relive the same, fruitless cycle if he did not take the momentum of his life by the reins from there. The past was behind him, the future was forked ahead of him, and some futures can become pasts to make a new present. An experience culminating to awakening and the death of an identity so that a new one might form. <br /> <br /> Personality<br /> As Berith, he's a mildly stoic, and seemingly kind man who takes dutiful guardianship over his allies and own. As Thomas Haytham, he is a polite politician who tries to portray themselves as &quot;guiding hand&quot; of his local constituents. .","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27809-victorofnyke","name":"VictorOfNyke","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"26"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-18T19:01:14-08:00","id":1531081,"title":"","content":"Fantastic. Take a beat.<br /> <br /> So I think that means everyone is here so everyone take a beat for week 2 check in. <br /> <br /> Plot hooks to come!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-19T16:17:14-08:00","id":1531148,"title":"","content":"I created an In-Character thread for scene descriptions and character interactions.<br /> <br /> The storytelling goal for Chapter 1 is uniting the party.<br /> <br /> Primark ( <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25357-lorekeeper\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar25357_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"25357\" data-vbnamecard=\"25357\">Lorekeeper</a> ) is given a command by the Meisters of Winterhold to obtain dominion over Walworth Estate, a public housing community in Southwark Borough of London. This command is a <b>condition. </b>Every time Primark makes a substantial advancement towards this goal, such as recruiting a community planner ( <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28057-nickeldan\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28057\" data-vbnamecard=\"28057\">nickeldan</a> ) or Borough council member ( <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27809-victorofnyke\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27809\" data-vbnamecard=\"27809\">VictorOfNyke</a> ), he earns an arcane beat. The condition is resolved when the ministry gains control of the Estate, and further instructions are given.<br /> <br /> Mother Time ( <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26317-critian-caceorte\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"26317\" data-vbnamecard=\"26317\">Critian Caceorte</a> ) has a prelacy from the Horologian ministry, so she has a <b>persistent condition</b> of Exarchal command that serves as a secondary obsession. All commands from the Prophet must be resolved before she can pursue her personal obsession (maximizing her brain to the breaking point?). The Prophet commands that Mother Time to help further the ends of the ministry of Mammon in gaining control of the Walworth Estate. The estate is near the school she currently is headmistress of, and many of her students live there. The school building was converted from an old office building and is starting to be badly worn down. Perhaps the school needs a new building?<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-19T16:21:22-08:00","id":1531149,"title":"","content":"In addition, Mekhaine ( <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a> ) has a contract from the Panopticon to track sleeper internet searches related to magic or the supernatural in the London area. How does Mekhaine go about this? INT + Computer? Do you use an tool or artifact?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-19T16:23:10-08:00","id":1531150,"title":"","content":"Let me know if there is a scene related to any of these story hooks that you want to roll play. Or feel free to describe what you think your character would be doing on New Years Eve at midnight in the IC thread.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-19T17:58:35-08:00","id":1531155,"title":"","content":"Probably Int + Computer, using some data mining, which he parses through to validate what sounds promising, then retrains the algorithm based on feedback. Its encrypted with a one time pad (effectively unbreakable by mundane means), the key is the entirety of the text of <i>Neuromancer</i>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-19T19:02:45-08:00","id":1531165,"title":"","content":"The street finds its own uses for things.<br /> <br /> Ok. Give me Int + Comp.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-19T19:22:24-08:00","id":1531167,"title":"","content":"Roger that<br /> <br /> Int (3) + Computers (3):<br /> <br /> <b>10</b>, <b>8</b>, 6, 5, 3, 2, 3 = 2 successes","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-19T21:24:18-08:00","id":1531174,"title":"","content":"Your data search turns up several promising leads. Two in particular stand out to you. One is from an employee computer in the Spire searching for &quot;How big do rats normally get?&quot;. This same employiee log-on also searched for news articles on &quot;Stray dogs in Walworth&quot;. <br /> <br /> The second came from a student computer in the school library of Thatcher Academy for &quot;Is it normal to see radio waves in the air?&quot; and &quot;What do weird daydreams mean? Can boredom make you crazy?&quot;<br /> <br /> What does Mekhaine do with this information?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-20T05:54:05-08:00","id":1531188,"title":"","content":"Panopticon is a customer, happy customers are returning customers. So he will log the encrypted data, report it and offer to see if there are contractors which can follow up for them (other Seers in the region, agents of the Throne, etc).<br /> <br /> He would also see if the Spire needs a security consultation. Opening day is looming, important guests at the ceremony, the website's security needs to be stress tested. So now is the time to make sure everything goes smoothly. Plus its a discrete way to keep an eye out if the Sleeper becomes Lucid.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-20T07:03:06-08:00","id":1531193,"title":"","content":"Your Panopticon contact (you don't know their name. Just an encrypted email address) thanks you for your service. As payment, they offer some information regarding your interest in magical technology, the name of a sleeper scientist working at a lab in Cambridge University, Robert Lanford, who's research may be of interest to you.<br /> <br /> You have a contact with the Spire's management company, Roland Property Group, who's shadow name is Saulin. Would you like to make an appointment?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-20T07:10:34-08:00","id":1531195,"title":"","content":"Speaking of festivities at the Spire. Saulin ( <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28057-nickeldan\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28057\" data-vbnamecard=\"28057\">nickeldan</a> ) has recently been informed that two members of the Jordanian royal family, Ayma and Tala, will be coming to stay for a visit to London while looking for schools for Tala, and to make their stay as comfortable as possible. While Tala is looking for schools, her older sister Ayma is rumored to be looking for a suitable husband.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-20T12:12:14-08:00","id":1531205,"title":"","content":"Mekhaine would like to make an appointment, in the name of Arkhitekton Digital Security (the company he currently works for).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-21T05:38:55-08:00","id":1531231,"title":"","content":"Week 3<br /> How's everyone doing?<br /> <br /> So far we have<ol class=\"decimal\"><li>Primark <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25357-lorekeeper\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar25357_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"25357\" data-vbnamecard=\"25357\">Lorekeeper</a> has been commanded by the <a href=\"http://data:image/jpeg;base64,\" target=\"_blank\">Meisters of Winterhold</a> to dominate the Walworth Estate, a public housing community in South London</li> <li>Mother Time <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26317-critian-caceorte\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"26317\" data-vbnamecard=\"26317\">Critian Caceorte</a> has been commanded by the <a href=\"https://cms.doctorwho.tv/sites/default/files/2022-03/Master%20V2%20-%201920x1080.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">Prophet</a> to seek out Primark and aide him in exchange for gaining a new building for her school</li> <li>Saulin <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28057-nickeldan\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28057\" data-vbnamecard=\"28057\">nickeldan</a> has received news that two sisters, members of the Jordanian royal family, are <a href=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/CGSFSD1WcAATBns.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">coming for a visit to London</a></li> <li>Mekhaine <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a> has acquired the information that there two sleepers, one an employee at the Spire, and the other a student at Mother Time's school, who are searching for information related to the invisible world. He also got a lead on a scientist in Cambridge who might be researching magical technology. Mekhaine has decided to try to find the employee at the Spire while meeting with Saulin to help expand his tech business.</li> </ol>These all seem like great jumping off points for some roll playing in the IC thread (I will give out beats for RP). Let me know if you need some clarification on anything.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27436,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","user":"CalvinSiler","date":". 02-21-2024, 08:42 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-21T15:44:32-08:00","id":1531255,"title":"","content":"What would the roll be to find out information regarding the Estate? Specifically financials, for the purpose of acquiring it?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude00","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26317-critian-caceorte","name":"Critian Caceorte","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-21T17:45:25-08:00","id":1531260,"title":"","content":"Int + Investigation. Are you looking for records online or do you go to a public records office?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-21T21:18:51-08:00","id":1531270,"title":"","content":"Public Records, Bridgitte is an old enough fuddy-duddy that she prefers to do this sort of thing by paper/in-person.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26317-critian-caceorte","name":"Critian Caceorte","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-21T22:23:23-08:00","id":1531274,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CalvinSiler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1530141-god-s-away-on-business-mta2e-seer-chronicle-occ?p=1531148#post1531148\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Primark is given a command by the Meisters of Winterhold to obtain dominion over Walworth Estate, a public housing community in Southwark Borough of London.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Primark's first order of business in this command is going to be investigating information that the Ministry holds of other Seers in the area, preferably of the same Ministry but others are acceptable. The aid of a Pylon would be ideal to achieving such a goal","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Consumer of lore, myth, history, tales and songs. Pronoun ambiguous. <br /> <i><b><span style=\"color:#9b111e\">This isn't gonna be easy, but the fact that you're even trying says a lot about you. You're braver than you think.</span></b></i> --RWBY V5C5","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25357-lorekeeper","name":"Lorekeeper","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25357_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"66"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-22T04:16:45-08:00","id":1531283,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26317-critian-caceorte\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"26317\" data-vbnamecard=\"26317\">Critian Caceorte</a> There are several offices that might contain the records you are looking for, and its hard to tell from the council website which one is correct. Do you want to research more, or do you want to use a Fate spell to help guide you?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-22T04:20:47-08:00","id":1531285,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25357-lorekeeper\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar25357_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"25357\" data-vbnamecard=\"25357\">Lorekeeper</a> WBS has an office in the Spire, and Primark knows that there is a condecoi pylon that manages the hotel in the Spire. There is also a low level Mammon Soldier in the Property management company for the Spire. You think you remember that he actually lives at the Spire. Must be extremely wealthy and well connected to pull that off.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-22T04:25:25-08:00","id":1531286,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a> You are able to make an appointment with Mr. Amjad's secretary for afternoon tea at the Periya Vellai Hotel in the Spire.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-22T18:14:09-08:00","id":1531326,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CalvinSiler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1530141-god-s-away-on-business-mta2e-seer-chronicle-occ?p=1531283#post1531283\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26317-critian-caceorte\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"26317\" data-vbnamecard=\"26317\">Critian Caceorte</a> There are several offices that might contain the records you are looking for, and its hard to tell from the council website which one is correct. Do you want to research more, or do you want to use a Fate spell to help guide you?</div> </div> </div> </div>I think I'll take the latter. Would Serendipity work to inform which Office would be a better choice to visit?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26317-critian-caceorte","name":"Critian Caceorte","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-23T03:29:29-08:00","id":1531342,"title":"","content":"Yup. Go ahead and roll and then put a description of how your character performs the ritual in the IC thread.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-23T13:45:39-08:00","id":1531379,"title":"","content":"Alright, using Serendipity (a Fate 1) spell to determine which Office should be visited. I have Gnosis 1 and Fate 1, so to boost my efforts I'm going to spend a point of Willpower (7/7 -&gt; 6/7 remaining) to add +3 to the roll. I will also use my Patron's Tools in the form of my pocket watch, using the symbology of the Prophet as a figure determining the time and place for events, which will add another +2 thanks to my Prelacy. Altogether, that means I will be rolling 7 dice total for my spell.<br /> <br /> As for Reach, I will be using the 1 Reach I have available to make it an instant spell.<br /> <br /> Now, for the dice roll:<br /> <br /> 7, 7, 6, 5, 3, 2, 1<br /> Result: 0 Successes<br /> <br /> Dangit. Would it be alright if I were to convert this into a Dramatic Failure? It might hamper my progress more, but it will at least mean that I get something out of the affair.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26317-critian-caceorte","name":"Critian Caceorte","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-23T14:16:27-08:00","id":1531384,"title":"","content":"Since you have Gnosis 1, so you can use 2 yantra. So if Calvin would allow it, perhaps you could roll the +2 from using High Speech ?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-23T17:05:39-08:00","id":1531391,"title":"","content":"Yup. Go ahead and use high speech if you want and re roll. Or you can take the beat for dramatic failure. Up to you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-23T18:51:18-08:00","id":1531399,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CalvinSiler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1530141-god-s-away-on-business-mta2e-seer-chronicle-occ?p=1531391#post1531391\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yup. Go ahead and use high speech if you want and re roll. Or you can take the beat for dramatic failure. Up to you.</div> </div> </div> </div>Alright, if we're rerolling, I'll do the same as above, just with the High Speech for the extra +2. That means 9 dice total, so here we go:<br /> <br /> <b>10, 10, </b>7, 7, 6, 4, 4, 3, 2<br /> <br /> Extra Rolls from 10s: 7, 2<br /> <br /> Alright, got a success! I'll go write-up the spell description in IC.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26317-critian-caceorte","name":"Critian Caceorte","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-23T19:47:53-08:00","id":1531403,"title":"","content":"Nice. I really like seeing how each mage character experiences magic.<br /> <br /> With two success and some funny business &quot;behind the Storyteller screen&quot; I'll say that you not only arrive at the right place, but maybe more importantly, the right TIME. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-23T21:16:40-08:00","id":1531409,"title":"","content":"I'd like to tap into my knowledge of Jordanian high society to get a little more information on the sisters. What are they interested in? Are they trust fund brats or people of substance? Would Int + Socialize be appropriate?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28057-nickeldan","name":"nickeldan","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-24T03:55:18-08:00","id":1531419,"title":"","content":"Sure. With Int + Socialize you can recall the most recent gossip about the sisters. Int + Occult would of course yield different information.<br /> <br /> Also you have that Tea Time meeting with some security consultant over in the IC thread. Apparently he's concerned with animal control or some such.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-28T07:50:40-08:00","id":1531685,"title":"","content":"Week 4<br /> 1 beat each for <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a>, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26317-critian-caceorte\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"26317\" data-vbnamecard=\"26317\">Critian Caceorte</a>, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25357-lorekeeper\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar25357_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"25357\" data-vbnamecard=\"25357\">Lorekeeper</a> , and <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28057-nickeldan\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28057\" data-vbnamecard=\"28057\">nickeldan</a> for checking in. 1 beat each for <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a> and <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26317-critian-caceorte\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"26317\" data-vbnamecard=\"26317\">Critian Caceorte</a> for posting in the IC thread. Haven't heard from <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27809-victorofnyke\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27809\" data-vbnamecard=\"27809\">VictorOfNyke</a> this week. Hope you are doing OK.<br /> <br /> Recap so far:<ol class=\"decimal\"><li>Primark ( <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25357-lorekeeper\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar25357_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"25357\" data-vbnamecard=\"25357\">Lorekeeper</a> ) has been commanded by the <a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/villains/images/6/6d/X-files-the-syndicate.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20140815180522\" target=\"_blank\">Meisters of Winterhold</a> to gain dominion over the Walworth estate for the ministry - this counts as a <b>condition, </b>any substantial progress earns an arcane beat and it resolves when Primark and his pylon have gained control over the neighborhood. He has an office in the Spire and knows that there is a Seer working for the owners of the skyscraper. He is also aware that Wellington Buisness School, another office space tenant at the Spire, which sponsors several high schools throughout the city, is connected to the Horologian Ministry somehow. Time to make some moves, network, and move up that pyra... I'm mean ladder.</li> <li>Mother Time (<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26317-critian-caceorte\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"26317\" data-vbnamecard=\"26317\">Critian Caceorte</a> ) has been commanded by the Prophet to aide Primark and the Ministry of Mammon in their quest to gain dominion over the Walworth estate, which will probably benefit Bridgette's school financially. This is a Command from the Exarch, and counts as a <b>persistent condition, </b>because of Mother Time's prelacy, with the same benefits as about, but the additional drawback that she must make progress in fulfilling the Prophet's will before perusing her own obsession (Enhancing her brain power to the breaking point!). To that end Mother Time has gone to the Borough Council's Housing Authority Archives to research the financial dealings of the Council (Scene in progress in the IC thread).</li> <li>Berith ( <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27809-victorofnyke\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27809\" data-vbnamecard=\"27809\">VictorOfNyke</a>) is a member of the Borough Council, and at the very least securing his vote on the motion to award a renovation contract would be helpful. Berith might also have pull with other members of the council or know who might be working against the Ministry of Mammon.</li> <li>Saulin ( <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28057-nickeldan\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28057\" data-vbnamecard=\"28057\">nickeldan</a> ) is a community developer for Roland Property Group, who could have a pretty competitive bid for the Walworth Estate renovation if a representative where to present a <b>Plan </b>( a type of equipment CoD pg. 100) to the Borough Council and gain a majority vote against other competing bids (if only there were a way to persuade key members to vote on the proposal! <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> So many of you chose high social attributes and skills. Expect a lot of social maneuvering and less physical combat </div></div> </div> </div> In addition, he has also been informed that two sisters who are members of the royal family of Jordan are coming to visit for the celebrations of the opening of the Spire to the public (hopefully the building is ready and there are no security threats).</li> <li>Mekhaine ( <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a> ) a hacker and security expert, is looking to drum up business ( a character <b>asperation</b> I believe) has scheduled a meeting in the hotel restaurant with Saulin (Scene in progress in the IC thread). He has the additional motivation of investigating a sleeper who has been using one of the employee computers to search for information on &quot;large rats&quot; and &quot;dogs' howling&quot; in the Walworth estate neighborhood. He also found that one of the students at Thatcher Academy ( Mother Time's school) is using the school library computer to research &quot;seeing radio signals&quot; and &quot;strange daydreams&quot;). In exchange for passing this information on to the Panopticon Ministry, Mekhaine has also gained information about a researcher at Cambridge University who might be working on magical technology.</li> </ol><br /> So...<ul><li>Waiting on Mother Time to go ahead with her research at the archive.</li> <li>Waiting on Saulin to meet with Mekhaine</li> <li><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28057-nickeldan\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28057\" data-vbnamecard=\"28057\">nickeldan</a> asked if Saulin could do a social or occult research roll on the royal sisters. Go ahead!</li> <li><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25357-lorekeeper\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar25357_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"25357\" data-vbnamecard=\"25357\">Lorekeeper</a> and <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27809-victorofnyke\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27809\" data-vbnamecard=\"27809\">VictorOfNyke</a> - Jump on in, the story needs you!</li> <li>Let me know if you have an idea for the story, or need more information or clarification. My door is open.</li> </ul>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27436,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","user":"CalvinSiler","date":". 02-28-2024, 10:53 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-06T11:08:41-08:00","id":1532091,"title":"","content":"Week 5<br /> No new activity.<br /> Let me know if you need anything to move forward. Just a reminder, I'm not expecting you to write a novel. You just have to tell me and the other players what your character does.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-11T23:35:31-07:00","id":1532422,"title":"","content":"Trish has three dots in both resolve and composure so she has three doors for the purposes of social maneuvering.<br /> <br /> If you want to pesuade her to help you do research in the archives you would first need to create a first impression. The better Briggett's first impression is the less time it will to open the doors to persuading Trish to help you.<br /> <br /> If Bridgett is successful in persuading Trish to help her the each time the attempt to investigate in the archives the ST will roll for Trish and all successes will be added to <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26317-critian-caceorte\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"26317\" data-vbnamecard=\"26317\">Critian Caceorte</a> dice pool as bonus die. Trish has a research pool of Int 3 + Academics 2<br /> <br /> It looks like Ms. Timothy's highest social skill is intimidate. You could attempt to play on Trish's youth and presumtive respect for elders. She is 22, so about half Briggett's age. Otherwise you could try socialize or subterfuge. Empathy would be usefull for attempting to figure out what Trish's goals and aspirations are.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-12T00:05:05-07:00","id":1532424,"title":"","content":"Alternatively you could attempt to intimidate Trish with your superior academic skill.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-12T21:51:24-07:00","id":1532478,"title":"","content":"Yeah, let's go with Intimidate to get her into compliance. Combined with Charisma, for full force of personality.<br /> <br /> So, Charisma 3 + Intimidation 3. Might as well use another point of Willpower to add 3, to make sure I succeed, since I've got plenty (6/7 -&gt; 5/7). Not a student, so my specialty doesn't apply, meaning that it's a total of 6 dice to roll.<br /> <br /> <b>9, 8, </b>7, 6, 3, 3, 2, 1<br /> <br /> That's 2 successes, so thankfully it should work. Any suggestions for writing in IC, or just go to town?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26317-critian-caceorte","name":"Critian Caceorte","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-13T03:47:48-07:00","id":1532487,"title":"","content":"Great! So Trish has Composure 3 + Empathy 2 + Striking Looks 2<br /> <b>8</b>, 7,7,5,5,2,2<br /> <br /> So Bridgette has one more success than Trish. So I am going to say that she is Leveraged. She will comply with any immediate request and for each hour you are in the archives you can attempt to open one of her doors. Once all three of her doors are opened, she will assist you in your research by adding her dice pool to your own.<br /> <br /> Because you have already used intimidation, you must use some other skill to open doors. Sensing motivations, goals, and character asperations are all ways of opening doors. Or just doing something helpful for the character. As a reminder, you do have 2 dots in Mind and 1 dot in Fate, so magical means are also available to you.<br /> <br /> Trish has the Sympathetic merit (you feel sorry for her), so because you have leveraged her with Intimidation, she reduces your doors by two should she need to use social maneuvering with you at some point in the future.<br /> <br /> I'd say go to town. I'm a &quot;Yes, And&quot; kind of ST. <br /> <br /> To help you visualize the situation - based on her appearance and last name, Bridgette might be able to guess that Trish is Japanese. It is unusual for her to have an English first name. She is tall, about 5'8&quot; (173 CM) and weighs about 110 lb. (50 kg). She has Striking Looks 2, so interpret what that means for your character, but most people would perceive her as very beautiful and charismatic. She is 21, soon to be 22 years old, and is dressed in fashionable business professional clothes (maybe to appear older). She is dressed warmly, and has not removed her outer coat even though she is indoors, maybe indicating that she is cold. Bridgette notices that she is wearing a pendant of an arrow inside a round target.<br /> <br /> She speaks English fluently, in an accent that seems halfway between American and British (a &quot;transatlantic&quot; accent&quot;) that is reminiscent of an old Hollywood actress (think Audrey Hepburn or Grace Kelly). She speaks somewhat slowly, as if she is consciously trying to &quot;get it right&quot; (Bridgett should appreciate that since her virtue is Precision). Her vocabulary indicates that she has a fair amount of education, but she sometimes stumbles over words that sound differently being read than being pronounced out loud.<br /> <br /> Have fun!<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-14T10:11:33-07:00","id":1532580,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lorekeeper</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1530141-god-s-away-on-business-mta2e-seer-chronicle-occ?p=1531274#post1531274\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Primark's first order of business in this command is going to be investigating information that the Ministry holds of other Seers in the area, preferably of the same Ministry but others are acceptable. The aid of a Pylon would be ideal to achieving such a goal</div> </div> </div> </div>Hey just following up on this again. Did you want to role play a scene of Primark doing research, or did you want to make a dice roll and see what information comes up?<br /> <br /> Just looking for a way to help your character move forward.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-14T15:22:55-07:00","id":1532615,"title":"","content":"Week 6<br /> 1 beat each for <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26317-critian-caceorte\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"26317\" data-vbnamecard=\"26317\">Critian Caceorte</a> , <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a> , <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27809-victorofnyke\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27809\" data-vbnamecard=\"27809\">VictorOfNyke</a> , and <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28057-nickeldan\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28057\" data-vbnamecard=\"28057\">nickeldan</a> for reaching out to me by private message. 1 beat for <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26317-critian-caceorte\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"26317\" data-vbnamecard=\"26317\">Critian Caceorte</a> for posting on the forum.<br /> <br /> If I'm not mistaken <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a> has now earned 5 beats, and therefore has an XP to spend. They could buy a skill specialty, a rote, or one dot in a merit. Or save up for even greater gains.<br /> <br /> This week I will award double beats for any player that posts in the In-Character Forum, pursues an asperation or obsession, or engages in dialog with another PC! Two beats for the price of one!<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-14T20:40:40-07:00","id":1532633,"title":"","content":"Salil shows up for tea about ten minutes early. He'll actually drink tea as, though not possessing any firm religious convictions (apart from serving the Exarchs), he abstains from alcohol.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28057-nickeldan","name":"nickeldan","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-14T23:13:01-07:00","id":1532638,"title":"","content":"Alright, slowly spinning my gears. I think first order of business is looking into the proposed projects in the local borough , especially in the interest of trying to bring some unity here. Figuring out who the supporters are, the goal, and what my fellow council members think of the matter would be a good start.<br /> <br /> I <i>think</i> a fruitful start might be a little bit of divination to find the right direction to start.<br /> <br /> Divination<br /> Potency: 1<br /> Reaches: Instant, +1 reach option for specific questions<br /> Yantra: Shadowname +3<br /> For a Pool of: 3 Time, 1 Gnosis, 3 Shadowname as Berith is known to tell of the past, present, and future truthfully=7 and no Paradox.<br /> <br /> Our question: Who, or what, would be our most efficient vector to find useful information.<br /> <br /> <b>9</b>, 7, 4, 4, 2, 1, 1= <b>1 success,</b> which would be all we need.<br /> <br /> Edit: Will get into the descriptions proper tomorrow as it is rather late for me. Apologies for my absence up to now.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27809,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27809-victorofnyke","user":"VictorOfNyke","date":". 03-15-2024, 02:17 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27809-victorofnyke","name":"VictorOfNyke","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"26"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-15T05:28:39-07:00","id":1532644,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>VictorOfNyke</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1530141-god-s-away-on-business-mta2e-seer-chronicle-occ?p=1532638#post1532638\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Divination<br /> Potency: 1<br /> Reaches: Instant, +1 reach option for specific questions<br /> Yantra: Shadowname +3<br /> For a Pool of: 3 Time, 1 Gnosis, 3 Shadowname as Berith is known to tell of the past, present, and future truthfully=7 and no Paradox.<br /> <br /> Our question: Who, or what, would be our most efficient vector to find useful information.<br /> <br /> [</div> </div> </div> </div>I hate to be nit-picking, but I guess its my job. Divination can answer questions about what will <i>most likely</i> happen in the future. It can not tell you generally what information is useful to you or how to find it. That's more in the domain of Fate. <br /> <br /> The example from the book is &quot;Will Anna get married?&quot; and the &quot;specific information&quot; reach answer could be something like &quot;Anna will marry an old friend named Jason two years from now.&quot;<br /> <br /> Can Berith think of an event in the future that they wish to know about? Maybe something like, &quot;Who will oppose my plans at the next council meeting?&quot;, or &quot;Will anyone support this proposal?&quot;<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-15T05:40:39-07:00","id":1532645,"title":"","content":"Or maybe &quot;Who will help me find this information?&quot; Maybe that is what you are trying to go for. But you got to be a little bit more specific about which &quot;useful information&quot; you are wanting to know the future of. Is there a specific project that you want to know about?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-15T06:49:41-07:00","id":1532647,"title":"","content":"You could also ask more questions, <i>Divination</i> is Potency primary, so you can get 3. Instant use, advanced duration and specific answers. Which means you could save questions for later.<br /> <br /> You could also add conjunctional Death to know how things are most likely to end. So you could ask &quot;Where will my search for useful information take me ?&quot;. Think of it like what the Singers in Silence do, if nothing changes, the person whose keening they hear will die. Similarly, unless there is a wrench in the works, your search would end up at the location of the answer.<br /> <br /> I will use my XP to buy the first dot of <i>Trained Observer</i>, which is helpful for our general security and is part of the Legacy requirements.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 03-15-2024, 12:03 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-15T10:31:30-07:00","id":1532657,"title":"","content":"How will this investigation &quot;die&quot;? I hadn't thought of that before. Interesting.<br /> <br /> Though famously, knowing the future often causes as many problems as it solves. The plots of lots of legends and fairy tales, and the <i>Dune</i> books depend on that point.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-15T14:52:43-07:00","id":1532666,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CalvinSiler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1530141-god-s-away-on-business-mta2e-seer-chronicle-occ?p=1532644#post1532644\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I hate to be nit-picking, but I guess its my job. Divination can answer questions about what will <i>most likely</i> happen in the future. It can not tell you generally what information is useful to you or how to find it. That's more in the domain of Fate.<br /> <br /> The example from the book is &quot;Will Anna get married?&quot; and the &quot;specific information&quot; reach answer could be something like &quot;Anna will marry an old friend named Jason two years from now.&quot;<br /> <br /> Can Berith think of an event in the future that they wish to know about? Maybe something like, &quot;Who will oppose my plans at the next council meeting?&quot;, or &quot;Will anyone support this proposal?&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Hey, no, nitpicking is appreciated. I haven't played with Time much and that will help my parse it faster.<br /> <br /> Regarding advanced duration, I do have the free reach for it if it's fine we tack that on with the potency I neglected. I also like the idea on conjunctional death, which could be handy later.<br /> <br /> So, a probably more appropriate question to start with: &quot;Who might I speak to, about local projects, that would have information useful to the Ministry?&quot; Followed up with, and stealing this from Kaiser, &quot;where will this search for useful information take me?&quot; In the ending sense. Banking the last potency.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27809-victorofnyke","name":"VictorOfNyke","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"26"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-15T15:24:56-07:00","id":1532669,"title":"","content":"So you are essentially using divination as a time saving measure. Interesting. It does have a sort of Scott Pilgrim &quot;I put soy in this cup, but I thought real hard about putting it in the other cup&quot; feel. But whatever.<br /> <br /> Go ahead and put a description of Berith's working in the IC thread and the Prophet will provide your answer!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-16T22:28:57-07:00","id":1532755,"title":"","content":"Up and Up!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27809-victorofnyke","name":"VictorOfNyke","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"26"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-16T23:43:10-07:00","id":1532758,"title":"","content":"Great! <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27809-victorofnyke\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27809\" data-vbnamecard=\"27809\">VictorOfNyke</a> Go ahead and take two beats for posting in the IC thread. Anyone else?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"