my occur.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Oops, just a tad bit of the Dyslexic.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27809-victorofnyke","name":"VictorOfNyke","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"26"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-20T04:17:29-07:00","id":1532897,"title":"","content":"2 beats for <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26317-critian-caceorte\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"26317\" data-vbnamecard=\"26317\">Critian Caceorte</a> for posting in the IC thread.<br /> <br /> This is exciting. We have two pairs of PCs in two locations. Hopefully we can get some good teamwork going.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-20T04:56:58-07:00","id":1532899,"title":"","content":"Week 7<br /> 1 beat each for <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a>, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28057-nickeldan\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28057\" data-vbnamecard=\"28057\">nickeldan</a> , <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26317-critian-caceorte\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"26317\" data-vbnamecard=\"26317\">Critian Caceorte</a> , and <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27809-victorofnyke\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27809\" data-vbnamecard=\"27809\">VictorOfNyke</a> for posting this week.<br /> <br /> Brief Recap:<br /> Alexis and Salil are meeting for afternoon tea at the Spire to discuss plans for the building's security. Salil has been informed that two sisters from the Jordanian royal family are going to be visiting for the hotel's grand opening in a few weeks, on the Lunar New Year (2016 was the year of the Fire Monkey. February 4th, two days after the American holiday of Groundhog Day, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27809-victorofnyke\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27809\" data-vbnamecard=\"27809\">VictorOfNyke</a><img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />) <br /> <br /> Salil knows from social gossip that the older sister is interested in fashion design and finding a husband, and that the younger sister is looking for an University to attend. She would like to study millitary aviation at Sandhurst, but her family disapproves. Saulin knows from his study of the occult that some lines of the Jordanian royal family manifest Proximi gifts every few generations.<br /> <br /> Salil is a community planner for the Roland Property Group, which has a proposal to renovate the Walworth Council Estate - a matter that will be considered at the next council meeting.<br /> <br /> Mekhaine has been informed through his research on the behalf of the Panopticon that a sleeper working at the Spire has been searching on the internet for information on &quot;large rats&quot; and &quot;stray dogs howling&quot; in the Walworth Council Estate. He also found a student looking for information on &quot;seeing radio signals&quot; and &quot;strange daydreams&quot;. As payment for his work, his Panopticon contact provided him with the name of a researcher at Oxford University who might be working on magical technology.<br /> <br /> Meanwhile, over at the Southwark Borough Council Housing Authority Archives, Bridgitte has begun research on the Walworth Council Estate with the help of an University student and journalist intern, Trish Takehashi, who is following a lead about complaints about strange &quot;pests&quot; at Walworth Council Estate. The Archives were just about to close up for the evening, when Thomas Haythem, Southwark Borough Council member and secret member of the ministry of Mammon shows up, guided by a prophecy of the future. Both Mother Time and Berith have begun to suspect that there is more to Trish Takehashi than meets the eye.<br /> <br /> Lots of fun stuff going on. I will be interested to see what you all come up with.<br /> <br /> This week I will continue to offer double beats for Player Character interaction. Let's get some teamwork going!<br /> <br /> Several of you are also close to making &quot;significant progress&quot; on aspirations and obsessions. Keep it up!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-23T15:09:22-07:00","id":1533047,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27809-victorofnyke\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27809\" data-vbnamecard=\"27809\">VictorOfNyke</a><br /> <br /> With Active Mage Sight in the Arcana of Matter, Death, and Time, mechanically you are able to perceive that Trish is wearing expensive and well-made clothing that was chosen for its high fashion value and aesthetic qualities (high availability rating, grants a social bonus to the wearer). Some of it is new, and some of it is old, perhaps purchased in a vintage shop. Her shoes seem to have been purchased recently here in London, but most of her other clothes seem to have been purchased in another country - Hard to say exactly where without the Space Arcanum or a craft skill specialty. Her haircut, nails, and perfume scent are also expensive and carefully chosen. You get the sense that she has greater than average resources, but not based on her own income, which is negligible. Wealthy allies perhaps? She also seems to have a non-magical, mundane sense for the value of material objects that mirrors your own exalted Stygian powers (she has the Taste merit).<br /> <br /> In addition you get the hard to define sense that entropy and decay do not interact with Trish in a normal way, but without further scrutiny it's hard to say exactly how.<br /> <br /> Her relationship to Death is slightly disturbing to Berith, but also fills him with that ravening hunger that all mages feel when they encounter a potent mystery. She possesses a human soul. It is not shaped by a watchtower or the blessed light of the Exarchs' grace. It is not damaged, torn, or scared like Berith has heard rumors of, but it does posses some kind of supernatural power. Or rather it might be more accurate, with the aid of the Queen of Number's domain, to say that it is possessed by some kind of supernatural power. Someone or something <i>owns</i> Trish's soul. <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> Berith is reminded of the words of prophecy &quot;Servant of the Fox Rider&quot; </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Again, Berith perceives that Death does not interact with Trish in a normal way, but it would require further scrutiny to know exactly how.<br /> <br /> With Time, Berith is able to perceive that Trish has an average ability to move quickly and gracefully and an above average emotional composure that allow her to perceive danger, prepare herself, and act quickly and decisively (Initiative Mod 5). <br /> <br /> Berith is further unnerved, and enticed, by the perception that Trish has experienced some kind of temporal warping, though it is not because she has traveled from the future or the distant past. Combined with Death, Berith gets the sense that Doom and the Inevitable End are not quite as inevitable for her as they are for most people. Again, it is all very mysterious and unclear. Berith does get the sense that the clearest path towards uncovering the Truth lies through the realm of Arcadia. Perhaps the witch can help.<br /> <br /> Mechanically, Trish is an Opacity 5 mystery, so it would take some time to fully reveal the Truth of the unseen powers that are at work in her.<br /> <br /> Speaking of the witch, Berith does perceive her obviously. And he senses that she has been personally touched by the loving hand of her Exarch and granted a second glimpse of the realms above through the eyes of the god-king's own soul - a prelate of the Prophet! He is filled with that peculiar mixture of fear and envy that all seers feel when encountering a will worker of higher order status than themselves.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-23T15:19:38-07:00","id":1533048,"title":"","content":"Feel free to interpret this information in a way more personal to your character, and let me know if you have any questions, or think that I missed something that Active Mage Sight would reveal.<br /> <br /> Also, I want to complement you on your roll playing. You really convey the sense of what it is like to be a Seer, and their unique perspective on the world. It ties in well with the themes for the Chronicle.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-23T15:55:47-07:00","id":1533049,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CalvinSiler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1530141-god-s-away-on-business-mta2e-seer-chronicle-occ?p=1533048#post1533048\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also, I want to complement you on your roll playing. You really convey the sense of what it is like to be a Seer, and their unique perspective on the world. It ties in well with the themes for the Chronicle.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Thank you, I appreciate the feedback. I know a fair bit less about the structure and culture of the Seers than I do of the orders, SL being my favorite. So I'm hoping I'm at least <i>convincing</i>.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27809-victorofnyke","name":"VictorOfNyke","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"26"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-23T16:03:49-07:00","id":1533051,"title":"","content":"I'll delay any further posts until <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26317-critian-caceorte\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"26317\" data-vbnamecard=\"26317\">Critian Caceorte</a> has a chance to reply. Least to say, I'm excited.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27809-victorofnyke","name":"VictorOfNyke","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"26"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-23T17:11:04-07:00","id":1533052,"title":"","content":"I think I mentioned this before with <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26317-critian-caceorte\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"26317\" data-vbnamecard=\"26317\">Critian Caceorte</a> but Trish is dressed warmly as if she is unused to the English climate.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-23T17:30:15-07:00","id":1533053,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27809-victorofnyke\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27809\" data-vbnamecard=\"27809\">VictorOfNyke</a><br /> I rolled a Manipulation + Socialize for Trish to make a good impression on Thomas.<br /> <br /> If you wish to contest the roll, give me a Composure + Socialize or Empathy.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-23T17:42:36-07:00","id":1533054,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar27436_1.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27436\" data-vbnamecard=\"27436\">CalvinSiler</a><br /> <br /> Composure +Socialize<br /> <br /> results: <b>9, 8, </b>7, 1, 1, 2 <b>success</b>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27809-victorofnyke","name":"VictorOfNyke","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"26"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-23T19:04:36-07:00","id":1533058,"title":"","content":"Trish got an exceptional success (I did this with physical dice. It was a sight to behold)<br /> <br /> Thomas receives the Swooned condition. You are charmed or bedazled by this character (Roll play that however you want. I'm just stating what the CoD description and mechanics are.)<br /> <br /> Thomas suffers a -2 die penalty on any action to bring harm to Trish. Trish gains a +2 on any attempt to socially manipulate Thomas. The condition resolves when Thomas takes an action that puts himself in harm's way to help Trish.<br /> <br /> Take a beat for your trouble.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-23T21:12:54-07:00","id":1533061,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>VictorOfNyke</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1530141-god-s-away-on-business-mta2e-seer-chronicle-occ?p=1533051#post1533051\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'll delay any further posts until <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26317-critian-caceorte\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"26317\" data-vbnamecard=\"26317\">Critian Caceorte</a> has a chance to reply. Least to say, I'm excited.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yup. Let's let <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26317-critian-caceorte\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"26317\" data-vbnamecard=\"26317\">Critian Caceorte</a> jump in here. If it wasn't clear before Bridgett and Trish have been researching for about an hour when Thomas arrives, so Bridgett can try to open another door to Trish. An active mage sight reading would count towards that. Also you can do a research roll on your own if you want.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-23T21:20:22-07:00","id":1533062,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28057-nickeldan\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28057\" data-vbnamecard=\"28057\">nickeldan</a> take two beats for dialoging with another player character.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-27T13:36:34-07:00","id":1533272,"title":"","content":"Week 8<br /> 1 beat each for <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27809-victorofnyke\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27809\" data-vbnamecard=\"27809\">VictorOfNyke</a> , <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28057-nickeldan\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28057\" data-vbnamecard=\"28057\">nickeldan</a> , <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26317-critian-caceorte\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"26317\" data-vbnamecard=\"26317\">Critian Caceorte</a> , and <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a> for posting or checking in by private message.<br /> <br /> So we have the two scenes going. Mother Time ( <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26317-critian-caceorte\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"26317\" data-vbnamecard=\"26317\">Critian Caceorte</a> ) and Berith ( <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27809-victorofnyke\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27809\" data-vbnamecard=\"27809\">VictorOfNyke</a> ) are researching the Borough Council and the Walford Council Estate in the Housing Authority archive with the help of a &quot;mysterious&quot; newspaper intern.<br /> <br /> Meanwhile, Saulin ( <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28057-nickeldan\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28057\" data-vbnamecard=\"28057\">nickeldan</a> ) and Mekhaine ( <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a> ) are planning a business deal for the security of the Spire building. <br /> <br /> This week I will offer double beats for any player who makes significant progress on one of their asperations or obsession.<br /> <br /> Have fun!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-27T14:09:40-07:00","id":1533275,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b>Mother Time</b></span><br /> <u>Asperations</u><ul><li>Crush foolish optimism</li> <li>Remove all opposing voices in her school</li> <li>Satisfy parental concerns before they waste time</li> </ul><br /> <u>Obsessions</u><ul><li>Command of the Prophet: Aide the Ministry of Mammon in their plan to gain dominion over the Walford Estate (Mechanically this counts as an obsession. You get an arcane beat every time you make progress on this because of your prelacy.</li> <li>Optimize her own brain to its breaking point</li> </ul><br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b>Mekhaine</b></span><br /> <u>Asperations</u><ul><li>Find the truth behind the missing neural link (brain optimizing ?) security system project.</li> <li>Set up his own business</li> <li>Develop cutting edge magical technologies</li> </ul><br /> <u>Obsession</u><ul><li>Magical Technology</li> </ul><br /> <b><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Berith</span></b><br /> <u>Asperations</u><ul><li>Long Term: Further his powerbase/connections</li> <li>Short Term: Get into an interesting situation</li> <li>Short Term: Uncover a secret</li> </ul><br /> <u>Obsession</u><ul><li>TBD</li> </ul><br /> <b><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Saulin</span></b><br /> Maybe they are written down somewhere. I can't find them. Sorry. Let us know!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-27T16:36:14-07:00","id":1533289,"title":"","content":"Mother Time will be using her Active Mage Sight to analyze the situation in front of her. -1 Mana to add Mind to the Sight (Fate/Mind/Time).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26317-critian-caceorte","name":"Critian Caceorte","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-27T18:29:13-07:00","id":1533290,"title":"","content":"Duplicate Post","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27436,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","user":"CalvinSiler","date":". 04-01-2024, 02:21 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-27T18:29:13-07:00","id":1533291,"title":"","content":"With Active Mage Sight Mother Time perceives that some extremely powerful magical effect surrounds the young woman. It is an aura that almost resembles the nimbus of a potent mage, but it is not a Mage aura.<br /> <br /> With Mind Mother Time perceives that Trish has a normal human mind with above average intelligence and resolve, (three dots each) and exceptional wits (four dots). She posses an exceptional emotional presence, ability to manipulate others, and composure. Further magical spells of knowing might reveal her thoughts, emotions, and moral character. It now seems extremely lucky that Bridgitte was able to so easily intimidate her.<br /> <br /> Time, combined with Fate, reveals that the pattern of time has been rewoven on several occasions in the past to change the fate of the subject.<br /> <br /> The strength of power flowing through the threads of Fate growing and twisting around the young woman is almost overwhelming to Mother Time. She has never seen anything like this before, except in the whirling Moirae that dance around the throne of the blessed prophet and his sister Ruin that she has briefly glimpsed in her dreams. The woman's aura seems to be like tidal waves of dramatically shifting Fate, or changing seasons of good and ill fortune.<br /> <br /> The young Japanese woman seems to posses a powerful destiny, though its exact nature and corresponding Bane are not readily apparent.<br /> <br /> Is this woman some sort of blasphemous abomination, or is meeting this &quot;creature&quot; some sort of sign from the Prophet? Should Mother Time follow her to receive guidance of the Exarch's will or should she be destroyed as soon as possible?<br /> <br /> The truly odd thing is that Mother Time does not sense any wards or veils, or mental resistance of any kind. Does this woman even realize what she is? Is she an unwitting tool of some more powerful entity?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27436,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","user":"CalvinSiler","date":". 03-27-2024, 09:40 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-27T18:38:00-07:00","id":1533292,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26317-critian-caceorte\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"26317\" data-vbnamecard=\"26317\">Critian Caceorte</a> this information, along with any additional Mind Knowing spells, count towards opening a door for Social Maneuvering, reducing them from three to two. After you open all of Trish's doors she will assist you in researching the financial records of the Walford Estate.<br /> <br /> As a reminder, Berith arrives about an hour after Trish first pinged your mage sense with her comment about the Archives closing soon without the presence of a borough council member.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-03T07:13:06-07:00","id":1533513,"title":"","content":"Week 9<br /> 1 beat each to <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a> and <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26317-critian-caceorte\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"26317\" data-vbnamecard=\"26317\">Critian Caceorte</a> for posting. 2 beats to <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a> for making substantial progress towards the aspiration of &quot;Setting up his own business&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-09T12:55:07-07:00","id":1533896,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27809-victorofnyke\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27809\" data-vbnamecard=\"27809\">VictorOfNyke</a> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26317-critian-caceorte\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"26317\" data-vbnamecard=\"26317\">Critian Caceorte</a> Did you want to do some research in the library, or how did you want to move forward in your scene?<br /> <br /> Research is Int + Academic usually, but I could be persuaded to do Int + Politics since you are looking at public records. Since both of you are government employees I'd be willing to give you a +1 equipment bonus for using the government archives.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-09T17:05:13-07:00","id":1533911,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28057-nickeldan\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28057\" data-vbnamecard=\"28057\">nickeldan</a><br /> <br /> Just to clarify, an employee at the Spire that lives in Walford Estates was using an employee computer at the Spire to search for &quot;large rats&quot; and &quot;Stray dogs&quot;. The Spire Hotel has a policy of hireing locals, many of whom are lower class and low income. Walford Estates is a public housing community for low income residents. <br /> <br /> As servants of Mammon, both Mekhaine and Saulin would be aware that if Walford is owned by the government and controlled by the Borough Council then the Hegemony is probably involved some how. Mammon and the Hegemony...do not always get along. <br /> <br /> Thatcher Academy is a Free School - similar to Charter Schools in the US. It receives government funding (Hegemony) but is mannaged by a private corporation - Wellington Business College , offices located in the Spire (Mammon).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-09T17:22:16-07:00","id":1533913,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28057-nickeldan\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28057\" data-vbnamecard=\"28057\">nickeldan</a><br /> You could give me an Int + Occult plus your Spirit Ecology skill specialty to see if &quot;large rats&quot; and &quot;stray dogs&quot; brings anything to mind.<br /> <br /> You also have politics 3 plus &quot;red tape&quot; skill specialty and 2 dot of Allies in City Government.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-09T17:36:33-07:00","id":1533915,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a><br /> <br /> I should have done this earlier. Give me an Int + Empathy for the information you received from your Panopticon contact.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-09T20:42:11-07:00","id":1533929,"title":"","content":"Int + Occult:<br /> 1, 8, 10, 3<br /> 10 re-rolled to 5<br /> 2 successes","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28057-nickeldan","name":"nickeldan","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-09T21:43:38-07:00","id":1533932,"title":"","content":"Roger that:<br /> <br /> Int (3) + Empathy (3):<br /> <br /> <b>8</b>, <b>8</b>, 6, 4, 3, 3 = <b>2 successes</b><br /> <br /> Would this result have retroactively affected what was said to Saulin ?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-10T00:10:03-07:00","id":1533937,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28057-nickeldan\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28057\" data-vbnamecard=\"28057\">nickeldan</a><br /> With two success you recall that large rats may be an indication that there is a weakening of the gauntlet in an area. You could seek the advise of a more experienced Thyrsus, research in an occult library, or go check it yourself, perhaps with the help of this surveillance expert. You get the sense that he has some status among the local tetrarchy, where as you are new to the city.<br /> <br /> &quot;Stray dogs howling in the night&quot; could mean any number number of things. You are aware that sometimes preditory animal spirits, especially wolves, will sometimes make a particular area their hunting ground. But again you would need to gather more information on the mystery.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27436,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","user":"CalvinSiler","date":". 04-10-2024, 09:27 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-10T00:17:09-07:00","id":1533939,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a><br /> <br /> With two successes it occurs to you that it is strange that your Panopticon contact would provide you with information that has the potential for upsetting the balance of power between the Hegemony and Mammon. Maybe there is a hidden agenda.<br /> <br /> If you feel the need to retcon anything Mekhaine said to Saulin, go ahead.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-10T11:34:28-07:00","id":1533987,"title":"","content":"Just made a quick edit based on the lore clarifications about Walford Estate. I also added the possibility of the animals being a Barghest, just in case they are Awakening as a Moros.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-10T12:33:51-07:00","id":1533991,"title":"","content":"Yes. If only you knew a Moros Mage ( <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27809-victorofnyke\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27809\" data-vbnamecard=\"27809\">VictorOfNyke</a> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />)<br /> <br /> On Walworth Estate in general, I confess that I've never lived in the UK, so I'm sort of basing my idea of what Walworth is like on British television shows like Eastenders and Shamless UK, and the movie Attack the Block (My basic idea for this chapter is based on the IRL <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Heygate_Estate\" target=\"_blank\">Heygate estate</a>, which was <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/artanddesign/gallery/2013/may/09/derelict-heygate-estate-south-london\" target=\"_blank\">demolished in 2014</a>, and <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aylesbury_Estate\" target=\"_blank\">Aylesbury Estate</a>, which is still in the process of demolition and renovation). Combination of flats buildings and row houses with common areas. There is a tube station, a corner shop, and a pub near by, as well as a Church and a Mosque.<br /> <br /> <br /> <a href=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=1505\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" ><img title=\"image.png\" data-tempid=\"temp_1505_1712777466951_22\" width=\"237\" height=\"157\" data-align=\"none\" loading=\"lazy\" border=\"0\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=1505&amp;type=medium\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=1505\" data-thumb-url=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=1505&amp;type=thumb\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"image.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment thumbnail js-need-data-att-update js-lightbox-participant\" itemprop=\"image\"/></a>Walworth in the foreground, the Spire in the background.\u200b","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-10T13:08:59-07:00","id":1533993,"title":"","content":"The image was not loaded successfully.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-11T09:32:11-07:00","id":1534027,"title":"","content":"Week 10<br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a> and <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28057-nickeldan\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28057\" data-vbnamecard=\"28057\">nickeldan</a> , take 2 beats each for posting in the forum and RP in the ICC.<br /> <br /> I'm not sure if you all have been keeping up with XP on your own, but I added everything up and this is what I got.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a> 9 beats (You spent 5 on a merit dot back in Week 5), so 1 almost 2 XP<br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26317-critian-caceorte\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"26317\" data-vbnamecard=\"26317\">Critian Caceorte</a> 11 beats, so 2 XP and 1 beat<br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27809-victorofnyke\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27809\" data-vbnamecard=\"27809\">VictorOfNyke</a> 8 beats, 1 almost 2 XP<br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28057-nickeldan\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28057\" data-vbnamecard=\"28057\">nickeldan</a> 10 beats, 2 XP exactly<br /> <br /> If I got my math wrong, or you want to make a case for beats, let me know.<br /> <br /> I'm going to go ahead and give <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar27258_4.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27258\" data-vbnamecard=\"27258\">Cauthon</a> 2 XP so they can keep up with the rest of the party.<br /> <br /> This week lets do double points for casting a spell and following an obsession. Hopefully we can get some arcane beats on the board. It is Mage: The Awakening after all.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-11T09:34:30-07:00","id":1534028,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar27258_4.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27258\" data-vbnamecard=\"27258\">Cauthon</a><br /> <br /> If you feel like you have a finalized character go ahead and post a description in this thread.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-11T10:26:31-07:00","id":1534032,"title":"","content":"The story so far:<ul><li>Mekhaine and Saulin are continuing their meeting at the Spire. After exchanging pleasantries and sizing each other up, Mekhaine shared the information with Saulin that an employee at the Spire who lives in the Walworth Estates has been using one of the employee computers to search about &quot;How large do rats normally get&quot; and &quot;Has anyone else heard stray dogs howling at night&quot;.</li> <li>Mekhaine is also aware that a student at the Thatcher Academy in Walworth is researching &quot;Is it possible to see radio waves&quot; and &quot;I've been having strange day dreams&quot; using the school computer possibly indicating that the student has become lucid and will awaken soon. If only there was a sympathetic school therapist there at Academy to help the young person to find their &quot;path&quot; ( <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar27258_4.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27258\" data-vbnamecard=\"27258\">Cauthon</a> ?)</li> <li>As a Thyrsus with a specialty in &quot;Spirit Ecology&quot;, Saulin knows that this may indicate that the sleeper has become aware of some unusual spiritual activity. He would need to conduct more research, interview the employee, or visit Walworth to find more information.</li> <li>This could be valuable data for his plan to bid for the contract to renovate the Walworth Estates. The vote by the Boroughs Council is in a few weeks, and he needs some kind of edge to get ahead of other competitors.</li> <li>With his high level connections, Saulin probably knows the President of the Wellington School of Business, which sponsors the Thatcher Academy.</li> <li>Hearing about Saulin's plans to renovate (demolish!) the Walworth Estates for the Ministry of Mammon sparks a suspicion in Mekhaine that perhaps his Panopticon contact is trying to cause trouble between Mammon and the Ministry of the Hegemon, which currently controls the Estate.</li> </ul>meanwhile<ul><li>Mother Time went to the Housing Authority records archive to research the financial records of the Walworth Estate. The Prophet's Ochemata visited her in her dreams and commanded her to help the Ministry of Mammon to acquire the Walworth Estate. As a prelate of the Prophet, this command carries the weight of an obsession for Mother TIme.</li> <li>While there she met a young journalist, Trish Takehashi, who is researching the maintenance and pest control records for the Walworth Estate because a woman came into the newspaper she works for complaining about rats. Her editor told her to ignore the woman, but Trish wants to help her and get the scoop on any corruption within the Borough Council's management of the Estate.</li> <li>Trish tells Bridgette that the archives will be closing soon, and that they will have to leave unless a Borough Council member is present. Trish expressing this wish triggers Mother Time's unseen sense, and with Active Mage Sight she discovers that Trish has some sort of mysterious power related to Fate. With her knowledge of Mind, Mother Time gets the sense that Trish is not in direct control of this power however, and may not even be aware that she has any supernatural ability.</li> <li>Berith, seeking the will of the Chancellor by peering into the future, learns that his intention to research the Walworth Estate will lead him to the Housing Authority records archive where he will discover information about some corrupt individuals.</li> <li>Berith knows that this information may help him to convince the other Borough Council members to vote to in favor of a renovation project for the Walworth Estates which would place it in the dominion of the Ministry of Mammon. Therefore, instead of letting time take its natural course, he goes directly to the Archives.</li> <li>At the Archives, Berith wishes himself luck and this triggers his unseen sense. He sees Trish through the window, and she smiles and waves at him.</li> <li>When he enters Trish reveals that when she saw him in the window, she hoped that he would come inside. Thomas is quite taken by Trish's charm and striking looks (+2), and becomes inclined to help her if he can.</li> <li>Using Active Mage Sight, Berith also becomes aware that Trish has some sort of mysterious supernatural power that affects her relationship with Death and Time in some way. And that she is also quite posh, for whatever that's worth (OOC the ST keeps hearing the song &quot;Common People&quot; by Pulp in his head whenever he posts for Trish).</li> </ul>Sorry if this seems like overkill on the recap. I'm just trying to make sure <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar27258_4.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27258\" data-vbnamecard=\"27258\">Cauthon</a> is up to speed OOC. Let me know if you think I left anything out, or you have questions.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27436,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","user":"CalvinSiler","date":". 04-11-2024, 01:32 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-11T12:53:26-07:00","id":1534039,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CalvinSiler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1530141-god-s-away-on-business-mta2e-seer-chronicle-occ?p=1534027#post1534027\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Week 10<br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a> and <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28057-nickeldan\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28057\" data-vbnamecard=\"28057\">nickeldan</a> , take 2 beats each for posting in the forum and RP in the ICC.<br /> <br /> I'm not sure if you all have been keeping up with XP on your own, but I added everything up and this is what I got.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a> 9 beats (You spent 5 on a merit dot back in Week 5), so 1 almost 2 XP<br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26317-critian-caceorte\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"26317\" data-vbnamecard=\"26317\">Critian Caceorte</a> 11 beats, so 2 XP and 1 beat<br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27809-victorofnyke\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27809\" data-vbnamecard=\"27809\">VictorOfNyke</a> 8 beats, 1 almost 2 XP<br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28057-nickeldan\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28057\" data-vbnamecard=\"28057\">nickeldan</a> 10 beats, 2 XP exactly<br /> <br /> If I got my math wrong, or you want to make a case for beats, let me know.<br /> <br /> I'm going to go ahead and give <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar27258_4.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27258\" data-vbnamecard=\"27258\">Cauthon</a> 2 XP so they can keep up with the rest of the party.<br /> <br /> This week lets do double points for casting a spell and following an obsession. Hopefully we can get some arcane beats on the board. It is Mage: The Awakening after all.</div> </div> </div> </div>I thought I had that number of beats, but I went through the messages to double check and it seems to be more than what I thought. Does this calculation look correct or did I add any source more than once ?<br /> <br /> <b>Staring point:</b> 5 bears by start of week 6<br /> <b>Week 6:</b> 2 beats from posting IC and 2 from talking to a PC (9 total)<br /> <b>Week 7:</b> 1 for start of week (10 total)<br /> <b>Week 8:</b> 1 beat for start of week (11 total)<br /> <b>Week 9: </b>1 beat for start of week, 2 for progress towards an aspiration (14 total)<br /> <b>Week 10:</b> 2 beats for RP (16 total)<br /> <br /> <b>Total: </b>3 XP and one beat<br /> <b>Utilized:</b> 1 XP spent on first level of Trained Observer.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-11T13:07:52-07:00","id":1534040,"title":"","content":"You are probably correct. I think I forgot to add the two beats for posting in the IC in Week 6.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-11T13:15:45-07:00","id":1534041,"title":"","content":"Got it, then I think I will then use the other two XP to get the last two dots of<i> Trained Observer.</i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-11T13:29:41-07:00","id":1534045,"title":"","content":"Sounds Good!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-11T16:20:07-07:00","id":1534061,"title":"","content":"<b>Kusha</b><br /> <b>True Name</b>: Jack Bron<br /> <b>Age</b>: 30<br /> <b>Height</b>: 6'2&quot;<br /> <b>Weight</b>: 150 lbs<br /> <b>Hair</b>: Bald (intentionally, natural hair is dark brown)<br /> <b>Eyes</b>: Green<br /> <b>Path</b>: Mastigos<br /> <b>Legacy</b>: None (Currently, aiming for Perfected Adept)<br /> <b>Long-Term Nimbus</b>: Intrusive thoughts occasionally well up when Kusha is near, pertaining to risks or paranoia. &quot;I'm awfully close to the road, and traffic is moving too quickly... what if a driver slips?!&quot;, &quot;Was that footsteps? Am I being followed? Is that guy coming in the opposite direction planning on mugging me?&quot;<br /> <b>Immediate Nimbus: </b>Shadows loom in every corner, movement draws the eye yet nothing is there, sourceless sound tinkle at the edge of hearing (-1 Composure)<br /> <b>Signature Nimbus:</b> A faint disconnect of the sense of self - am I the body that physically interacts with the world? Or the mind that processes those inputs? Is there a difference at all?<br /> <br /> <b>Dedicated Tool</b>: Siderite-Lunargent-Hermium fountain pen, presented by his first mentor as an initiation gift<br /> <br /> <b>Background</b>: Jack Bron buried himself in academia for almost a decade, graduating from Manchester University with a Doctorate in Clinical Psychology. The Manchester native was immediately shuffled into the Royal Army Medical Corps, who footed the bill for his degree, and spent several years cycling between deployments. Returning from his most recent deployment, Jack Bron tendered his resignation for reasons he refused to elaborate on (see: Awakening). Shortly thereafter, he moved to London, and began looking for a job as a therapist or councilor.<br /> <br /> <b>Awakening</b>: One day, while out for a jog, a man approached Jack Bron, and instructed him to get into the man's car, and sit quietly until told otherwise. Jack found himself compelled to obey, and was soon strapped to a table beneath the man's house. Lo, such is the horror that a Mind Mage can achieve with just a few words, disregard for free will redoubled by Rapture. The Following three days were a blur, as a nondescript figure calling itself &quot;Mr. Fish&quot; drowned and revived Jack for the Rapt's amusement. On the third morning, the third time Jack's consciousness found itself forcibly stitched back into his body, he Awoke screaming.<br /> <br /> The local Consillium raided the building within the hour, though they were unable to apprehend Mr. Fish. That the Rapt was a relatively respected and influential member of the Mysterium resulted in a great deal of embarrassment, and Jack suspects from the timing of the raid that the Consillium had been aware of the experiments for some time.<br /> <br /> After a brief induction into the Arrow -who had several members who he had met as a Sleeper and were willing to vouch for him- &quot;Kusha&quot; decided to escape the bad memories of Manchester and move south. The Manchester Consillium was only too happy to give him a letter of introduction and quietly sweep their embarrassment under the rug.<br /> <br /> <b>Personality</b>: Soft-spoken and somewhat distant, Kusha is significantly less intimidating once you get past him looming over you. Originally rather blas\u00e9 and sedentary, his experience with Mr. Fish has left him watchful and slightly obsessed with remaining beneath notice.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":27258,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","user":"Cauthon","date":". 04-11-2024, 07:28 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-11T16:57:51-07:00","id":1534065,"title":"","content":"I wonder if he has an Imposing Nimbus that inflicts Paranoia. His focus reassuring you that he is on to something and you should listen.<br /> <br /> It must be terrifying to one day attempt to use the sympathetic link to Know where Mr Fish is, so you could try to be anywhere else, only for building Stress to make him nearly impossible to find.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 04-11-2024, 08:14 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-11T17:42:41-07:00","id":1534068,"title":"","content":"I didn't take the merit, but it could be a decent investment down the line","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-11T19:01:17-07:00","id":1534071,"title":"","content":"I guess we are not keeping Kusha's Arrow oath a secret OOC. Should lead to some fun sneaking around IC.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-13T13:17:02-07:00","id":1534149,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27809-victorofnyke\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27809\" data-vbnamecard=\"27809\">VictorOfNyke</a> or <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26317-critian-caceorte\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"26317\" data-vbnamecard=\"26317\">Critian Caceorte</a>, you're both currently at the library, correct? Kusha is about to walk in, and I was wondering if either of you would mind mistaking him for a newly Awakened Mage ripe for recruitment? I don't know what Arcana you have, but a Moros would be able to use <u>Soul Marks</u>, and I'll cast a spell or two to give them a reason to do so<br /> <br /> Seems like the easiest way to get him involved","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-13T16:40:52-07:00","id":1534169,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar27258_4.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27258\" data-vbnamecard=\"27258\">Cauthon</a><br /> <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> When you left Manchester, your old caucus linked you up with a circle in London that patrol threats to the city related to Time and Fate. Its a mixture of Arrow and Guardians and they operate out of a Sanctum in the Royal Observatory Museum in Greenwich. Hooke is the circle's leader. After hearing your story he sets you up with a job as a therapist/councilor at a community center that specializes in mental health in Walworth. We can RP this in a flashback scene. </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> also<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> <br /> <b>Trish Takehashi<br /> Character Concept</b>: Japanese Lois Lane<br /> <b>Age: </b>22<br /> <b>Height: </b>5'8&quot;<br /> <b>Weight: </b>110 lb.<br /> <b>Hair: </b>Wavy Black<br /> <b>Eyes: </b>Dark Brown<br /> <b>Virtue: </b>Kindness<br /> <b>Vice: </b>Reckless<br /> <b>Attributes: </b>Exceptional Social, Above Average Mental, Average Physical<br /> <b>Skills</b>: Academics, Investigation, Athletics, Brawl (Akido) , Drive (Horseback ridding), Larceny, Weapons (Kendo), Animal Ken, Empathy, Expression (Journalism), Persuasion, Streetwise, Subterfuge<br /> <b>Merits:</b> Professional Training (Journalism), Encyclopedic Knowledge, Multilingual (Japanese, English, Spanish, Navajo), Allies, Contacts, Resources, Taste, Striking Looks.<br /> <br /> <b>Background</b><br /> Trish was born and raised in Osaka, Japan. Her father is in the Air Defense Force and her mother is a white American woman from Texas who moved to Japan to work as movie actress. Her mother stared in several Japanese science-fiction films in the early eighties that retain somewhat of cult following, including <i>The War in Space</i> in which she played the Princess from Earth. When Trish was 15 she was in an accident where a building collapsed during an earthquake. She doesn't like to talk about it, but something happened to her while she was trapped in the rubble that changed her and her life in dramatic ways. She was involved in some sort of Exam cheating scandal in high school that nearly destroyed her academic carrier, but she was able to recover and graduate with honors. She then spent a gap year in West Texas with her mother's family who own a ranch, and made some &quot;interesting friends&quot;, and went missing for several days, during a period where there was increased UFO sightings reported in the area. Trish returned to Japan to attend TODAI, again graduating with honors, and tried her best to not have any more &quot;adventures&quot;. After graduating, she decided, against her father's advice, to do post-graduate work at Oxford and a newspaper internship at a respected paper in London. So far she has avoided getting into any trouble, but those who know her best suspect that won't last long. She brought her cat, Michi, to keep her company.<br /> <br /> <b>Personality</b><br /> Between being raised in Osaka and her eccentric American mother, Trish is outgoing, friendly, sometimes impulsive, and has a somewhat sly sense of humor, though she can be reserved around authority figures, especially if she feels like she is &quot;In Trouble&quot;. When she was young she was somewhat bullied for being <i>gaijin </i>and something of a beanpole by Japanese standards, but she has started to shed her insecurities little by little. She is kind, especially to people she feels are being mistreated or left out and has a strong sense of loyalty to those she considers to be her friends. She does seem to almost define the phrase &quot;curiosity killed the cat&quot; sometimes, and often finds herself in the middle of bizarre circumstances by pursuing her passions to the point of stupidly brave recklessness.<br /> <br /> In addition to knowing her Mental Attributes (Int 3, Wits 4, Res 3) and Social Attributes (Prs 4, Man 4, Cmp 3, Striking Looks 2) and her many &quot;Jack of all trades, master of none&quot; skills, Kusha, with active mage sight, would be aware that Trish is HEALTHY. Not only does she not appear to have been sick recently, it appears that she has never been sick, or significantly injured, since she was 15. She also seems to be remarkably free from any genetic defects, and unless something terrible happens to her will probably live a very long life.<br /> <br /> Hooke was somewhat reluctant to give away too much information on Trish. He seemed to regard it as a &quot;training exercise&quot;, especially when he heard that Kush was interested in learning the Arcanum of Fate. The only advice he gave was to try not to stand too close to Trish if there is danger around - &quot;bullets, heavy objects, fire, car crashes, whatnot.&quot; </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-13T18:26:56-07:00","id":1534176,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27809-victorofnyke\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27809\" data-vbnamecard=\"27809\">VictorOfNyke</a> and <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26317-critian-caceorte\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"26317\" data-vbnamecard=\"26317\">Critian Caceorte</a> <br /> Just continue with what you were planning for the scene and <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar27258_4.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27258\" data-vbnamecard=\"27258\">Cauthon</a> will jump in when it seems appropriate. Kusha knows Trish from his work at a mental health clinic and he's giving Trish a ride.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-13T21:57:12-07:00","id":1534179,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CalvinSiler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1530141-god-s-away-on-business-mta2e-seer-chronicle-occ?p=1533896#post1533896\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27809-victorofnyke\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27809\" data-vbnamecard=\"27809\">VictorOfNyke</a> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26317-critian-caceorte\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"26317\" data-vbnamecard=\"26317\">Critian Caceorte</a> Did you want to do some research in the library, or how did you want to move forward in your scene?<br /> <br /> Research is Int + Academic usually, but I could be persuaded to do Int + Politics since you are looking at public records. Since both of you are government employees I'd be willing to give you a +1 equipment bonus for using the government archives.</div> </div> </div> </div>Lets get a roll for this. Int+Politics, Dice pool of four with a possible speciality (Politics) bureaucracy <br /> <br /> At base: <b>10</b>(5), <b>9</b>, 3, 1; <b>2 </b><b>successes</b><br /> +<br /> Possible Specialty die: 4, <b>0 successes </b>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27809-victorofnyke","name":"VictorOfNyke","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"26"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-13T23:19:06-07:00","id":1534183,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27809-victorofnyke\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27809\" data-vbnamecard=\"27809\">VictorOfNyke</a> <br /> I'll give <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26317-critian-caceorte\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"26317\" data-vbnamecard=\"26317\">Critian Caceorte</a> a chance to respond IC before I give you the results of your research success. And similar to Bridgitte, if you want Trish to add a bonus to your success, give me a social skill roll - your choice which one.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-14T23:10:00-07:00","id":1534227,"title":"","content":"With 4 hours of research Trish has had 10 total successes on her own research on building maintenance and pest control in Walford.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-14T23:51:38-07:00","id":1534229,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar27258_4.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27258\" data-vbnamecard=\"27258\">Cauthon</a><br /> Give me a recall roll to see if Kusha recognizes the other two names in the sign in book.<br /> <br /> Per your aspiration to find more information on Trish you could roll a Int+computer to see if you have ever [generic search engine turned into verb] her name.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27436,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","user":"CalvinSiler","date":". 04-15-2024, 03:00 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-15T03:46:58-07:00","id":1534238,"title":"","content":"Kusha Recall power GO - (Intelligence 3 + Composure 2) - 6,8,1,1,10 - 2 successes<br /> <br /> Kusha Google-fu GO - (Int 3 + Computers 1) -7,5,2,9 - 1 Success<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-15T04:28:34-07:00","id":1534242,"title":"","content":"You recognize both names. Ms. Timothy has quite the reputation amongst both teens and parents in the neighborhood. &quot;Stricktest Headmistress in England&quot;. Some with approval. &quot;Learn them kids good. Impose some real dicipline&quot;. Some with disapproval. Especially from suspended or expelled students. And of course government teachers are deeply distrustful of the privately managed Thatcher Academy. Siphoning off government funds from their schools.<br /> <br /> Heytham is a local Burrough Council member. There has been some talk about cutting Council funding to the Wellness centre. Make way for progress by trimming government waste. That sort of thing. You're not sure which side Heytham is on, but it might be worth finding out.<br /> <br /> And of course there is always the suspicion that lurking behind sleeper powerbases are the shadowy Seers.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27436,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","user":"CalvinSiler","date":". 04-15-2024, 10:23 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-15T04:53:50-07:00","id":1534243,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar27258_4.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27258\" data-vbnamecard=\"27258\">Cauthon</a><br /> <br /> Trish has a surprisingly low profile on social media. And there really wasn't that much to find. But after doing some digging you were able to find this<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> The Flaggerschmit Gazette August 19, 2012<br /> Visiting Girl saved by \u201cAlien Abductee\u201d<br /> <br /> Patricia Takehashi, age 18, daughter of local celebrity Margo Lynne Takehashi, who went missing three days ago claims that she was rescued from mysterious kidnappers by a local teen who claims to be Martin Wiley, a high school student who disappeared in the 1940's. Patricia declined to comment on the story, other than to say she is \u201cvery grateful to Martin. And to the Iron Ranger\u201d. The \u201cIron Ranger\u201d is a local legend about a cyborg who goes about like an old Western gunslinger.<br /> <br /> The teenager claiming to be Martin Wiley is a mute, but Takehashi's cousin, Elizabeth Maysle, daughter of Local rancher Robert \u201cBig Bob\u201d Maysle claims to be able to communicate with him through \u201cmindspeak\u201d.<br /> <br /> \u201cHe&quot;s very sweet, and misunderstood\u201d, says Elizabeth. She further explained that the teen boy was abducted by space aliens In the 1940's and taken in a flying saucer to a distant planet and transformed into an alien to tend the fungus gardens of the planet's ruler. He escaped when an inter-dimensional portal opened in the mountains near town. Elizabeth claims that she, Patricia, Martin, and the \u201cIron Ranger\u201d thwarted an<br /> attempt by an evil wizard to summon ancient alien gods to destroy the state of Texas.<br /> <br /> \u201cBess has watched too many of her aunt's movies,\u201d says Big Bob, referring to the numerous cult Japanese science fiction films starring Margo Lynne Takehashi, Patricia's mother. \u201cAnd she watches all those weird cartoons. She's what they call an Odd Taco over there in Japan!\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cI think the preferred term is Weebly, dear \u201c interjected Ann Maysle, Elizabeth's mother and town librarian. \u201cI think it's wonderful for young people to use their imaginations and learn about other cultures. Bess has been studying Japanese very hard since she heard her cousin was coming to visit this summer. They've been pen pals since they were little girls.\u201d<br /> <br /> Patricia claims that the \u201cevil wizard\u201d in her cousin's version of events is Dr. Andrew Boothe, the president of Danner College in nearby Misery, TX. The college claims that President Boothe is currently on sabbatical and that they could not disclose his whereabouts. \u201cHe was doing some sort of scientific experiment I think, but my cousin's claims that he is a soul stealing Litch may be exagerated,\u201d says Patricia. \u201cI think it's probable that the fungus spores in the cave where Martin keeps his flying saucer have mind-altering properties,\u201d she added, in defense of her cousin's wild claims.<br /> <br /> Local inventor and amateur astronaut Frank Acconda offered an alternative view point. \u201cIt's the damned government I tell you! They're always doing weird experiments up there in the mountains. And using our tax money!\u201d Mr. Acconda is a noted Anarco-capitalist activist who's previous claims to have worked on secret government projects and to be the original inventor of both the internet and mobile phones have never been substantiated.<br /> <br /> Whatever the truth may be, the Maysle family and the town of Flaggerschmit are grateful for the safe return of the two girls.<br /> <br /> Editor's note: Patricia worked as an unpaid intern at this newspaper over the summer.<br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Take a beat for pursuing your aspiration to find out why the Arrow is interested in Trish.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27436,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","user":"CalvinSiler","date":". 04-15-2024, 08:24 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-15T05:36:00-07:00","id":1534245,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> <br /> Let's do a little bit of retconning to help bring Kusha into the game. Let's say one of Mekhaine's jobs, he's not sure from whom, is to scrub the internet of any mention of Trish in connection with the supernatural. Mekhaine intentionally left the above article (go ahead and read Cauthon's spoiler) up, but in a hard to find spot. If anyone is looking for Trish and finds the article it pings Mekhaine. So Mekhaine is aware of Jack Bron but doesn't know about his mage identity yet.<br /> <br /> Mekhaine has not met Trish yet. It's just a job. But his friend Lara is a fan of Trish's mom's movies.<br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-15T05:39:46-07:00","id":1534246,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26317-critian-caceorte\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"26317\" data-vbnamecard=\"26317\">Critian Caceorte</a> and <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a> <br /> I think I made a ST mistake and I was wondering if you could help me out.<br /> <br /> Can we retcon and say that Mekhaine is aware that Ms. Timothy is Mother Time and that he informed her about the student in her school looking for information about magic before talking to Saulin?<br /> <br /> I think that will make some upcoming stuff flow better.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-15T08:28:48-07:00","id":1534250,"title":"","content":"Sure thing, my original plan was that we would setup an appointment to talk to her after the Spire meeting. In that case, perhaps it would be a good idea to make a post saying that one of spywares sends a secured message during the meeting. I imagine Mekhaine probably wrote some code so his tools go from Seer mode to Alexis mode, as part of the work to create the symbolic separation of the Shadow Name merit and probably data purging contingencies as part of the Untouchable one.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-schola