 status among the local tetrarchy, where as you are new to the city.<br /> <br /> &quot;Stray dogs howling in the night&quot; could mean any number number of things. You are aware that sometimes preditory animal spirits, especially wolves, will sometimes make a particular area their hunting ground. But again you would need to gather more information on the mystery.</div> </div> </div> </div>Also, just a reminder.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-18T04:17:26-07:00","id":1534391,"title":"","content":"Week 11<br /> 1 beat each to <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a>, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28057-nickeldan\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28057\" data-vbnamecard=\"28057\">nickeldan</a> , <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27809-victorofnyke\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27809\" data-vbnamecard=\"27809\">VictorOfNyke</a> , and <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar27258_4.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-use