path.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-18T21:05:51-07:00","id":1534433,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nickeldan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1531143-god-s-away-on-business-mtaw2e-seer-chronicle-ic?p=1534429#post1534429\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Salil arches a well-groomed eyebrow. &quot;Ghost rats, you say? Would you mind terribly if I tagged along? I'd like to see the commotion for myself.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div> The ST smiles behind his screen<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-19T09:03:19-07:00","id":1534442,"title":"","content":"I mostly just need to know Berith's current emotions, then I can progress","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-19T11:26:34-07:00","id":1534452,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28057-nickeldan\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28057\" data-vbnamecard=\"28057\">nickeldan</a> and <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar27258_4.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27258\" data-vbnamecard=\"27258\">Cauthon</a> <br /> How do you want to play <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a> s suggestion? If Saulin has met Jack through Trish then it's possible that he is aware of Jack's &quot;newly awakened&quot; status and has already begun to court Kusha to the Seers.<br /> <br /> Or.would you prefer that Jack and Salil be meeting for the first time when Jack walks Trish home this evening?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-19T12:12:25-07:00","id":1534454,"title":"","content":"Its possible that Saulin could have the leasing contract for Kusha's residence and the rumors of giant rats could provide an excuse to visit to &quot;inspect the situation and provide photos so the exterminators can make an estimate&quot;.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-19T12:28:06-07:00","id":1534455,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27809-victorofnyke\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27809\" data-vbnamecard=\"27809\">VictorOfNyke</a><br /> <br /> The results of the investigation so far may have an influence on Berith's emotions.<br /> <br /> Berith's divination counts as a clue. It was foretold that he would uncover information on the &quot;one who steals, the one who cheats, the one who kills, and the one who lies&quot;.<br /> <br /> I'm going to forgo the social maneuvering with Trish at this point and say that she shares her research with Thomas. Together they have uncovered the following clues.<br /> 1. There seems to be a mismatch between the amount of money being dispersed from the council fund for pest control and the invoices from the pest control company. Some of the money is &quot;missing&quot; (this clue contains an additional element and counts as a +2 to further investigation).<br /> 2. A report on the structural integrity of the basement of one of the flats buildings that was commissioned earlier last year has pages missing.<br /> 3. A report on crime in the neighborhood does not match some of the police reports that Trish has been able to uncover. Trish has asked around the newspaper she is interning for and there are rumors that some people have been asked to downplay a series of seemingly unrelated deaths and &quot;missing persons&quot; cases over the past few years. (This clue also contains an additional element and counts as a +2 to further investigation. Darn Trish and her exceptional successes! The ST brought this on himself and feels ashamed.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-19T12:49:26-07:00","id":1534456,"title":"","content":"Apologies for the delay, it's Inventory month so I'm burning at both ends. However, I am here now!<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar27258_4.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27258\" data-vbnamecard=\"27258\">Cauthon</a>, Berith's emotional state: Content, curious, and the sense of being ready to leap quickly come up. Like a growing excited/curious tension","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27809,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27809-victorofnyke","user":"VictorOfNyke","date":". 04-19-2024, 03:52 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27809-victorofnyke","name":"VictorOfNyke","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"26"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-19T12:57:35-07:00","id":1534458,"title":"","content":"Otherwise, I will add to the IC line either on my next 15 or when I leave for the day. Thanks for the patience<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27809-victorofnyke","name":"VictorOfNyke","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"26"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-19T16:00:45-07:00","id":1534465,"title":"","content":"Inventory is no fun. I'll probably be doing the same thing in a few months.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-19T17:56:52-07:00","id":1534470,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CalvinSiler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1530141-god-s-away-on-business-mta2e-seer-chronicle-occ?p=1533058#post1533058\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Thomas suffers a -2 die penalty on any action to bring harm to Trish. Trish gains a +2 on any attempt to socially manipulate Thomas. The condition resolves when Thomas takes an action that puts himself in harm's way to help Trish.</div> </div> </div> </div>Kusha would also be able to detect Thomas's mental condition.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-20T00:05:11-07:00","id":1534480,"title":"","content":"We'll follow through with that Soul Marks <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar27258_4.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27258\" data-vbnamecard=\"27258\">Cauthon</a> suggested. I don't know his resolve, but I think we'll keep potency low because the spell has a dual method in rooting others out.<br /> <br /> Death 1, Soul Marks<br /> potency 2<br /> reaches: 2/2 Instant,sensory <br /> paradox: None<br /> Yantra: Soul Stone Ring, +3 path yantra (symbolically a coin, tied closely to souls given what it carries)<br /> pool: 2 Death, 1 Gnosis, 3 Yantra=7.<br /> <br /> Roll: 10(3), 7, 6, 6, 4, 3, 2 = 1 success<br /> <br /> If not withstood: The question would be if Kusha is awakened.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27809-victorofnyke","name":"VictorOfNyke","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"26"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-21T05:10:10-07:00","id":1534519,"title":"","content":"(For fairness' sake, Kusha's Resolve is 4. I know one of your Resistance stats, now you know one of mine. In the interest of story imma voluntarily fail the Withstand :P)<br /> <br /> Kusha is indeed Awakened","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-21T23:07:09-07:00","id":1534544,"title":"","content":"Belive it or not, your beloved ST also occasionally bends the rules for the sake of the story (gasp!)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-21T23:55:53-07:00","id":1534546,"title":"","content":"Speaking of story, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27809-victorofnyke\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27809\" data-vbnamecard=\"27809\">VictorOfNyke</a> was asking me about Seer order status privately, and I thought it might be useful for me to explain some of my thoughts to the whole group.<br /> <br /> If you have been frustrated up until now because you feel like I haven't been giving you that much to go on in terms of plot information and quest giving NPCs, that was deliberate. Unlike Penticle mages who love magic-splaining to their &quot;inferiors&quot; most Seers are pretty secretive. And your average low level Seer is pretty clueless about what the higher-ups are up to. This is in no small part because the main way to move up the Iron Pyramid is to ruin or terminate the careers of the mages immediately above and below you. Seers are even more paranoid than your average mage.<br /> <br /> Add on top of this that the various ministries do not get along with each other that well. Many Penticle mages think of the Seers as an all powerful monolith. The reality is that Seers spend a lot of their time infighting with other Seers. And that is one of the main reasons that they don't actually control the whole world and haven't eliminated the Penticle orders.<br /> <br /> All of this to say, one of the reasons I was so insistent that at least one of you have some Seer status at character creation was so that it would be easier to feed the party plot. <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26317-critian-caceorte\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"26317\" data-vbnamecard=\"26317\">Critian Caceorte</a> went with 3 dots and a prelacy, and Lorekeeper had 2.dots, so that's why they got the most explicit instructions at the beginning of the game. I think <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26317-critian-caceorte\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"26317\" data-vbnamecard=\"26317\">Critian Caceorte</a> did a great job of playing a mid level Seer. The way Mother Time sort of forced a perfect stranger she met in a library to &quot;serve&quot; her for a few hours, with calloused indifference to that stranger's feelings, was good RP. <br /> <br /> Unfortunately Mother Time is no longer with us, which means that ironically the character with the most information right now is the Arrow who is attempting to infiltrate the Seers. I'm fine with that. It's an interesting way to go with the story. But if you want your character to move up the Iron Pyramid via merit dots, I'm fine with that too.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-22T02:09:30-07:00","id":1534548,"title":"","content":"I think I mentioned this to <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a> at one point, but I really liked the Mr. &amp; Mrs. Smith series that came out on Amazon a few months back. It's worth checking out if you haven't seen it. I think it is definitely an inspiration for me as a Storyteller in terms of world building for how the Seers &quot;work&quot;. You get paid seven figures and get lots of other resources to go on seemly random missions. But if things go wrong they go really wrong really quickly.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-22T06:10:03-07:00","id":1534552,"title":"","content":"Yep, part of Mekhane's attempt to game the system is to be an information broker who is way too convenient to off. Even having a pylon with a semi-decent level of loyalty to each other is a major boon to a Seer.<br /> <br /> However, he is laboring on the assumption of always making the Seers appear to be a unified monolith. The parents might disagree and argue in secret, but they present a unified front.<br /> <br /> A small curiosity is that Mekhane does have a way of compelling obedience, but fitting his style as an info broker.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-23T07:07:26-07:00","id":1534585,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar27258_4.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27258\" data-vbnamecard=\"27258\">Cauthon</a><br /> <br /> Joanna Bheydia is the young woman that lives in Walworth that Trish is trying to help. She is a second generation Indian woman and lives with her grandmother. Like I said, we can roll play more of that backstory after we wrap up this chapter.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27436,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","user":"CalvinSiler","date":". 04-23-2024, 02:26 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-23T07:12:28-07:00","id":1534590,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27809-victorofnyke\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27809\" data-vbnamecard=\"27809\">VictorOfNyke</a> and <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28057-nickeldan\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28057\" data-vbnamecard=\"28057\">nickeldan</a> <br /> If one of you decides to use XP on Seer order status, I'm going to go ahead and assume that since you belong to the same ministry in the same area of the city that you are at least aware of each other's existence. I leave it up to you all to decide if you have any shared backstory. Retcon away!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-23T07:45:13-07:00","id":1534592,"title":"","content":"I'm not going to make anyone make a science roll for the weather (though I did think about it). Its January 10th, 2016 in Game Time. It been in the 40s F most of the day, there were wind gusts and rain in the early afternoon, but the night time sky is clear. Sunset was at 4:15. Tonight is the New Moon.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-23T07:52:42-07:00","id":1534593,"title":"","content":"The Internet claims it is about a 10-15 minute walk from the Southwark Housing Authority Archives to the Spire.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-24T11:49:37-07:00","id":1534653,"title":"","content":"Week 12<br /> 1 beat each to <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28057-nickeldan\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28057\" data-vbnamecard=\"28057\">nickeldan</a> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27809-victorofnyke\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27809\" data-vbnamecard=\"27809\">VictorOfNyke</a> and <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar27258_4.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27258\" data-vbnamecard=\"27258\">Cauthon</a> for posting.<br /> <br /> Looking forward to seeing what comes of the two halves of the party getting together. Maybe you all will blow something up or poke a hole in the universe. Anything can happen with a bunch of Mages running around the city.<br /> <br /> Chapter Two is coming so let me know if you want to change aspirations or Obsessions around now that you've gotten to know your characters and the setting a little bit better.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-24T20:57:59-07:00","id":1534680,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CalvinSiler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1530141-god-s-away-on-business-mta2e-seer-chronicle-occ?p=1534653#post1534653\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Week 12<br /> 1 beat each to <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28057-nickeldan\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28057\" data-vbnamecard=\"28057\">nickeldan</a> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27809-victorofnyke\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27809\" data-vbnamecard=\"27809\">VictorOfNyke</a> and <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar27258_4.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27258\" data-vbnamecard=\"27258\">Cauthon</a> for posting.<br /> <br /> Looking forward to seeing what comes of the two halves of the party getting together. Maybe you all will blow something up or poke a hole in the universe. Anything can happen with a bunch of Mages running around the city.<br /> <br /> Chapter Two is coming so let me know if you want to change aspirations or Obsessions around now that you've gotten to know your characters and the setting a little bit better.</div> </div> </div> </div>While possibly not a long term choice, understanding the nature of our &quot;fox-ridder&quot; 's Mystery is sidling its way up to Obsession territory to me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27809-victorofnyke","name":"VictorOfNyke","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"26"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-25T06:04:11-07:00","id":1534688,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>VictorOfNyke</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1531143-god-s-away-on-business-mtaw2e-seer-chronicle-ic?p=1534678#post1534678\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Thomas was slowly putting up red-twine between the mage Jack and oddity-maybe fox-ridder Trish in his head. It was hard to say if it was the charm, or the looming Mystery over her head... but he had certainly been lead to an interesting figure. He'd have to weather at that Mystery sooner rather than later. It was certain to nag him.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ok. Since you used the magic word &quot;interesting&quot; I will count your short term asperation fulfilled. Take a beat. I suppose even though you were just reading documents in a library, with Trish and two mages there it counts as interesting. Also you &quot;uncovered a secret&quot; or several. So that asperation is fulfilled. Take a beat.<br /> <br /> I will provisionally put down &quot;Trish and fox-ridders&quot; as an obsession since you didn't have one picked out yet. That could go in several directions that are not solely limited to Trish herself, and is appropriate to a mage interested in Time and &quot;Judgement&quot;.<br /> <br /> The &quot;red threads&quot; idea is interesting. I think Kusha is the only character that has Space.<br /> <br /> On to the Spire!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-25T10:25:54-07:00","id":1534700,"title":"","content":"Has Space at 1 dot! I can see &amp; know, but rarely do anything <i>about</i>! :P<br /> <br /> Rolling to cast <u>Alter Mental Pattern</u> on myself, projecting an air of naive confidence.<br /> <br /> <u>Alter Mental Patter</u><u>n</u> - Reach to Instant Casting, Advanced Duration, and 1 for Exceeding Spell Control; total 3<br /> Casting pool - Mind 3, Gnosis 1, Path Tool 1 (Dedicated Tool), -2 for one Duration jump; total 3, +9-again from Tool's Amalgam<br /> <br /> 4,10,5,9,2 - 2 successes<br /> <br /> Paradox Risk - 1, -2 from Dedicated Tool, Chance Die<br /> <br /> When he gets a chance (ideally when out of Thomas's sight for a moment), Kusha is also going throw a <u>Mental Shield</u> up under the AMP. He's a paranoid bugger around Mages he doesn't know, given his first encounter was to be mind-controlled<br /> <br /> <u>Mental Shield</u> - Reach to Instant Casting, Advanced Duration, and 2 for Exceeding Spell Control; total 4<br /> Casting pool - Mind 3, Gnosis 1, Shadow Name 2, Path Tool 1 (Dedicated Tool), -2 for one Duration jump; total 5, +9-again from Tool's Amalgam<br /> <br /> 9,1,1,6,6, 7 - 1 success<br /> <br /> Paradox Risk - 2, -2 from Dedicated Tool, Chance Die<br /> <br /> If I take Paradox, I'll be Containing it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":27258,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","user":"Cauthon","date":".  Spacing 04-25-2024, 01:37 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-25T11:00:50-07:00","id":1534704,"title":"","content":"Mekhaine has Space as well, considering that he already has a plan, this is going to be interesting.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-25T12:20:47-07:00","id":1534712,"title":"","content":"[4] and [1] no paradox.<br /> <br /> Mr. Singh flares his nimbus, which reminds Kusha of his journey to the Tower of the Iron Gauntlet, through the gates of Pandemonium and his sense of smell is filled with the scent of Iron and sulfur along with pungent spices and very cold mountain air. Berith also senses the nimbus, and it reminds him of his own shadow name, one of the demons of the Inferno. - 2 to any social rolls while near Mr. Singh for the remainder of the scene.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-25T12:33:57-07:00","id":1534716,"title":"","content":"I layered <u>Alter Mental Pattern</u> over <u>Mental Shield</u>, how do you want to do the two Clashes of Will? Only check for MS if he penetrates AMP?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"