keldan</a> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27809-victorofnyke\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27809\" data-vbnamecard=\"27809\">VictorOfNyke</a> and <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar27258_4.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27258\" data-vbnamecard=\"27258\">Cauthon</a> together at last. All four PCs in the same room!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-27T19:47:46-07:00","id":1534830,"title":"","content":"Since he recognized the name Takehashi, Mekhane is going to cast <i>Supernal Veil</i>, with Reach assigned to instant use and advanced duration:<br /> <br /> Gnosis (1) + Prime (2) + Shadow Name (3) + Dedicated Tool (1) = 7 dice<br /> <br /> <b>10</b>, <b>8</b>, 7, 6, 4, 4, 3, 2, 2 = 2 successes<br /> <br /> 1 Paradox dice, mitigated by both Dedicated Tools to nothing.<br /> <br /> Utilizing a willpower point so that it can be active for an hour without taxing his spell control. <br /> <br /> One question before I post his actions in the IC thread: does he have any clue who Berith is ?<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-27T20:06:26-07:00","id":1534831,"title":"","content":"You could roll a wits + composure to see if you recall him from the news. If <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27809-victorofnyke\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27809\" data-vbnamecard=\"27809\">VictorOfNyke</a> decides to purchase Seer status, it would increase the chances that you would recognize him in that context.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-27T20:10:00-07:00","id":1534833,"title":"","content":"Victor, Salil has three dots in Politics with a specialty in Red Tape. He also has two dots of Allies in city government. It would make sense if our characters have met before at social events and fundraisers. What do you think?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28057-nickeldan","name":"nickeldan","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-27T20:12:10-07:00","id":1534834,"title":"","content":"I think it is probable that Salil and Thomas recognize one another from rubbing shoulders in city political events. How deep the relationship is is up to you two.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-27T20:12:43-07:00","id":1534835,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cauthon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1531143-god-s-away-on-business-mtaw2e-seer-chronicle-ic?p=1534829#post1534829\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Even before Awakening, this would not be somewhere he frequented, and these were not the kind of people he normally rubbed shoulders with.</div> </div> </div> </div> I like this detail. Class status is very important in British society, and it's something to think about while playing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-27T20:13:53-07:00","id":1534837,"title":"","content":"Calvin, I'll buy one dot of Seer status.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28057-nickeldan","name":"nickeldan","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-27T20:20:45-07:00","id":1534839,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nickeldan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1530141-god-s-away-on-business-mta2e-seer-chronicle-occ?p=1534837#post1534837\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Calvin, I'll buy one dot of Seer status.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think I'll make that a double, Calvin. <br /> <br /> Baking the other experience for now","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27809-victorofnyke","name":"VictorOfNyke","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"26"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-27T21:24:11-07:00","id":1534841,"title":"","content":"Ok. With 2 dots in Seer status both Mekhaine and Saulin are likely to know Berith as a low level Mammon Seer. He is likely to be in contact with superiors up the pyramid.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-27T21:39:29-07:00","id":1534842,"title":"","content":"Trish rolls Wits (4) + (3) Empathy to gage Jack's mood.<br /> <br /> <b>9,9,8,</b>1,5,1,5<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27436,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","user":"CalvinSiler","date":". 04-28-2024, 07:49 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-27T22:03:43-07:00","id":1534843,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27809-victorofnyke\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27809\" data-vbnamecard=\"27809\">VictorOfNyke</a><br /> A little bit of retconning<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> You receive occasional messages from a Mammon Architect of the Future named Wren. You have never met Wren face to face as far as you know. They usually send an unwilling servant controlled by a Profane Urim. Typically in public places when there is likely to be little surveillance and a large number of sleepers around. Wren has been hinting for several months now that the upcoming council meeting is important and that Thomas should try to gather as many votes as possible for Roland Property Group's development proposal for Walworth Estates, a proposal that is likely to be opposed by Hegemon Ministry sympathizers. Wren has not informed you of what the Pentacle's response might be, or if there will be any other opposition.<br /> <br /> Berith also has an artifact (I'll let you decide what is appropriate for your symbolism) that will alert the Ministry that you are in physical danger. Berith has never used this artifact, so he is not entirely sure what it will do. Hopefully some sort of help will arrive. </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-27T22:10:55-07:00","id":1534844,"title":"","content":"Blast from the past, from Week 4, back in February, when Lorekeeper's character was still part of the game.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CalvinSiler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1530141-god-s-away-on-business-mta2e-seer-chronicle-occ?p=1531685#post1531685\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Berith is a member of the Borough Council, and at the very least securing his vote on the motion to award a renovation contract would be helpful. Berith might also have pull with other members of the council or know who might be working against the Ministry of Mammon.<br /> <br /> Saulin is a community developer for Roland Property Group, who could have a pretty competitive bid for the Walworth Estate renovation if a representative where to present a <b>Plan </b>( a type of equipment CoD pg. 100) to the Borough Council and gain a majority vote against other competing bids (if only there were a way to persuade key members to vote on the proposal!)</div> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-27T22:19:30-07:00","id":1534848,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28057-nickeldan\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28057\" data-vbnamecard=\"28057\">nickeldan</a> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> I think maybe we talked about this, but I can't find it on the forum. You had a vivid prophetic dream indicating that the Queen of Numbers would like you to gain control of the Walworth Estate. You saw the old, decaying Brutalist architecture, covered in graffiti and grime, burning, and a new modern luxury neighborhood emerging from the ashes like a phoenix. </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-28T14:25:24-07:00","id":1534862,"title":"","content":"I hope I got Trish's last name correct, I wasn't sure if it was Takehashi or Takahashi.<br /> <br /> Sorry for the more verbose post, but I wanted to convey a bit how Mekhane perceives his magic. I believe that, while his reflexive Prime Sight triggers PMS, I think <i>Supernal Veil </i>should hide it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-28T15:37:22-07:00","id":1534864,"title":"","content":"I'm pretty sure Mage Sight doesn't trigger PMS - <u>Supernal Vision</u> would, just like Kusha's <u>Mental Shield</u> likely is<br /> <br /> Don't you need to target a spell directly (or combined-cast it, to cover even the act of casting it) to cloak it with <u>Supernal Veil</u>? I intend to pick up enough Prime to cast it, so I have a vested interest in the answer :P","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-28T15:44:55-07:00","id":1534865,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cauthon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1530141-god-s-away-on-business-mta2e-seer-chronicle-occ?p=1534864#post1534864\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm pretty sure Mage Sight doesn't trigger PMS - <u>Supernal Vision</u> would, just like Kusha's <u>Mental Shield</u> likely is<br /> <br /> Don't you need to target a spell directly (or combined-cast it, to cover even the act of casting it) to cloak it with <u>Supernal Veil</u>? I intend to pick up enough Prime to cast it, so I have a vested interest in the answer :P</div> </div> </div> </div>I need to find where, but I believe DaveB said Mage Sight pings it, because Peripheral Mage Sight detects any active supernatural ability, unless they are concealment specialized ones. My understanding is that <i>Supernal Veil</i> needs to be cast over either the target of the spell or on the spell itself (so probably a combined cast or two casts in case of a rote) in order to hide it. Since I plan to use an Unveiling on Mekhane, I thought this would be a good setup.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 04-28-2024, 06:47 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-28T15:48:49-07:00","id":1534866,"title":"","content":"<s>I think SV cast on yourself only hides that <i>you</i> are Supernal, but Calvin is obviously the final say on that. No objections if I'm wrong, it'll save me dice</s><br /> SV would still cover Mage Sight, nvm","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":27258,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","user":"Cauthon","date":". 04-28-2024, 06:53 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-28T19:28:49-07:00","id":1534872,"title":"","content":"It's like a sniper fight. Light reflecting off your gun Sight can give away your location to another sniper. Active and Focused Mage Sight explicitly fill the area with &quot;energy&quot; (Prime I assume) and can be enhanced by expending Mana. I assume that PMS has a similar but less detectable &quot;energy&quot;.<br /> <br /> I could see the argument for the others side too though. Photons can only affect the movement of other photons if they aquire an electric charge. By analogy Mage sight is not &quot;charged&quot; with Prime unless the Mage expends mental concentration or Mana. The &quot;lens&quot; of the Arcanum being used is effectively a minor imago that is expressed through Prima Materia.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-28T21:19:43-07:00","id":1534880,"title":"","content":"Did Mekhaine cast Supernal Vision?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-28T21:46:13-07:00","id":1534882,"title":"","content":"Currently he cast <i>Supernal Veil</i> over two turns (first for Shadow name, second for his Dedicated tool), <i>Supernal Vision</i> is his next move.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-29T04:16:52-07:00","id":1534888,"title":"","content":"Ok. I was confused because it seemed like the IC post indicated he already had. <br /> <br /> So the casting of SV would ping other mages PMS but the effect of the spell would obscure further investigation (similar to if you cast invisibility on yourself while surrounded by other people. They would notice that you disappeared, but your subsequent movements would be undetectable). With three other mages present at the table, plus Trish, plus other Seers near by - it is a <i>Condecoi</i> hostel after all - no one is able to trace the casting to you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-29T07:52:18-07:00","id":1534896,"title":"","content":"I think I understand, but would like to confirm. <i>Supernal Veil</i> would hide the spells cast on Mekhane and the fact he is Awakened, but hiding the cast of the Imago itself would require a combined spell. Would that be correct ?<br /> <br /> Which means thar Kusha will feel another ping. If he looks at the Nimbus, its one that came from nowhere. So could be someone was alerted after the mental scan and is now casting on him at sensory range, maybe through the cameras or, more worrying, sympathetically. It could also mean the councilman Heytham brought him here to be scanned and he is surrounded.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-29T08:45:04-07:00","id":1534902,"title":"","content":"Plus, I'm pretty sure my <u>Mental Shield</u> is already pinging everyone. Kusha often forgets the fact that active spells that aren't Veiling ping people just by existing","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-29T10:15:20-07:00","id":1534909,"title":"","content":"Well, its not so much that the Veiling itself is &quot;visible&quot;, its that the sudden absence of &quot;visible&quot; supernal energy from that direction would ping PMS. Now there are lots of other Awakened in the room, so with only PMS its possible, in fact probable, that they wouldn't know that it was Kusha that cast the veiling. There's lots of &quot;ambient&quot; prime in the room. Like a noisy public place. If someone talking in a normal tone of voice stopped talking, you wouldn't be able to tell who stopped talking, it would just get a little bit quieter in the room.<br /> <br /> As to whether Jack or any other characters takes spell casting as a sign of aggression, that's a choice that each PC has to make. I'm just the ST.<br /> <br /> The only thing I would add is that if you walk up to a <i>Haunted House</i>, you probably expect there to be ghosts inside (cue Mario 64 Ghost House music). If a mage walks up to a <i>Giant Iron Pyramid</i> leaking supernal energy like crazy, unless they really are newly awakened, they probably expect Seers to be inside.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-29T10:28:27-07:00","id":1534910,"title":"","content":"IC the others don't know that Kushs is an Arrow. OOC <i>Magic is Challenge! </i>Maybe it was Kusha's plan to be surrounded the whole time!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-30T06:08:30-07:00","id":1534939,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>KaiserAfini</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1530141-god-s-away-on-business-mta2e-seer-chronicle-occ?p=1534862#post1534862\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I hope I got Trish's last name correct, I wasn't sure if it was Takehashi or Takahashi.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think Takahashi is the more common transliteration in Japan, but maybe <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar27258_4.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27258\" data-vbnamecard=\"27258\">Cauthon</a> would know better than I since I think he used to live there. I apologize if my spelling has been inconsistent durning the Chronicle.<br /> <br /> It is &quot;Ms.&quot; rather than &quot;Mrs.&quot; in English, though many of her relatives doubtless wish it were otherwise.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-30T07:12:04-07:00","id":1534944,"title":"","content":"They're both surnames, thought Takahashi is the more common one iirc. Ta-ke-ha-shi and Ta-ka-ha-shi would each have different meanings (though depending on the Kanji used, so would two Takahashis. Japanese is weird)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-30T09:01:18-07:00","id":1534948,"title":"","content":"Yep, my best guess is that it could be composed of Takai, the kanji for &quot;tall/high/expensive&quot;, as well as the Hashi for &quot;bridge&quot;. So her surname would mean &quot;tall bridge&quot; or &quot;high bridge&quot;, which could have all sorts of connotations, such as referring to the Takamagahara or the bridge to cross the Sanzu River. But there are multiple combinations of kanjis that can result in the same sounding name, so I could be very off the mark.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 04-30-2024, 12:03 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-30T10:25:31-07:00","id":1534952,"title":"","content":"Yes. Fun Trivia facts: Trish began as a pesky, trouble making PC in another chronicle and she has become a favorite NPC of <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28057-nickeldan\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28057\" data-vbnamecard=\"28057\">nickeldan</a>. If I recall, &quot;tall and expensive&quot; and &quot;high bridge&quot; (implying high social standing and a traditional Japanese feminine beauty standard) was the original meaning as a kind of joke on some of her character traits, as well as being a common surname. The chronicle she first appeared in took place in London in 2016, so I felt obliged to included her as part of <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28057-nickeldan\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28057\" data-vbnamecard=\"28057\">nickeldan</a> and I's head canon.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-30T10:28:59-07:00","id":1534954,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar27258_4.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27258\" data-vbnamecard=\"27258\">Cauthon</a>, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27809-victorofnyke\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27809\" data-vbnamecard=\"27809\">VictorOfNyke</a>. <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28057-nickeldan\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28057\" data-vbnamecard=\"28057\">nickeldan</a> <br /> <br /> Did anyone want to cast something or do anything else before <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a> casts <i>Supernal Vision</i>?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-30T11:48:42-07:00","id":1534957,"title":"","content":"Nothing on my end","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-30T15:20:51-07:00","id":1534965,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a><br /> <br /> I think probably go ahead. If <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27809-victorofnyke\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27809\" data-vbnamecard=\"27809\">VictorOfNyke</a> and <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28057-nickeldan\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28057\" data-vbnamecard=\"28057\">nickeldan</a> want to jump in they can.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-30T16:32:39-07:00","id":1534971,"title":"","content":"Roger than, Mekhane is casting <i>Supernal Vision</i>, with Reach allocated to instant use and being able to identify non-Supernal beings.<br /> <br /> Gnosis (1) + Prime (2) + Shadow Name (3) + Willpower (3) - extend duration to two turns (-2) = 7 dice<br /> <br /> <b>9</b>, <b>8</b>, 6, 5, 4, 2, 2 = 2 successes.<br /> <br /> Since its an Unveiling, it will take one turn per target, with Kusha being examined first.<br /> <br /> Since he is a mage and the spell's Potency is 2, his questions are:<br /> <br /> 1- What is his Path / The Supernal Realm he is most closely aligned with ?<br /> 2- What is his Gnosis ?<br /> <br /> In Trish's case, since the spell will automatically give an idea on what she is, her questions are:<br /> <br /> 1- What is The Supernal Realm her powers are most closely aligned with ? <br /> 2- How adept is she at using her abilities ? (So maybe the most advanced ability she has)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-30T18:54:58-07:00","id":1534973,"title":"","content":"Mekhaine perceives that Jack is awakened along the Mastigos path with a gnosis of 1.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-30T19:11:11-07:00","id":1534976,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a><br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> Trish has an aura that seems aligned with Arcadia, though some of the effects of her power could look like paradox. To use Mekhaine's symbolism it's like lines of code overwriting each other causing glitches and bugs. The most powerful effect of her power would be similar to what a adept of Fate could achieve (thus the 5 opacity of her mystery). Mekhaine senses that Trish, like the Rapt, has no control over this magic, and may not even be fully aware of it. She also has something like a Fault that causes her to act in certain ways under stress.<br /> <br /> In addition, Trish has an ability to see through the Lie similar to a sleepwalker and her presence does not introduce quiescence into the spell casting environment. There is an additional component to this ability, but it would require additional scrutiny to perceive its full extent </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27436,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","user":"CalvinSiler","date":". 05-01-2024, 12:05 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-30T21:08:07-07:00","id":1534981,"title":"","content":"Go ahead and take an Arcane beat. And if you choose to share this information with other PC it counts towards reducing the opacity of the mystery for them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-02T07:48:35-07:00","id":1535067,"title":"","content":"Week 12<br /> <br /> 1 beat each to <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a> , <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28057-nickeldan\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28057\" data-vbnamecard=\"28057\">nickeldan</a> , <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27809-victorofnyke\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27809\" data-vbnamecard=\"27809\">VictorOfNyke</a> , and <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar27258_4.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27258\" data-vbnamecard=\"27258\">Cauthon</a> for posting. 1 arcane beat for <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a> for making a breakthrough in a new mystery.<br /> <br /> Thanks for your patience with the &quot;cutscenes&quot;. Maybe I got carried away with trying to move the story along. To recap<ul><li>Mekhaine and Saulin have been discussing plans to do surveillance work in the Walworth Estates to gather information for Saulin's plan to take control of the estate from the Hegemon for the Ministry of Mammon and create the new and glorious residential development like the one he saw in his exarchal vision.</li> <li>Mother Time had to leave the Archive on some urgent business (Again, sorry to see you go <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26317-critian-caceorte\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"26317\" data-vbnamecard=\"26317\">Critian Caceorte</a>. You are welcome to come back)</li> <li>Trish and Thomas wrapped up their research and found some important evidence that seems to indicate some corruption in the current government administration of Walworth Estates.<ul><li>There seems to be a mismatch between the amount of money being dispersed from the council fund for pest control and the invoices from the pest control company. Some of the money is &quot;missing&quot;.</li> <li>A report on the structural integrity of the basement of one of the flats buildings that was commissioned earlier last year has pages missing.</li> <li>A report on crime in the neighborhood does not match some of the police reports that Trish has been able to uncover. Trish has asked around the newspaper she is interning for and there are rumors that some people have been asked to downplay a series of seemingly unrelated deaths and &quot;missing persons&quot; cases over the past few years.</li> </ul></li> <li>Jack arrived at the Archive to pick Trish up and walk her home. Kusha cast a mental shield and altered mental projection on himself, and he and Berith sized each other up. Kusha is trying to create the impression that he is a newly awakened and order-less mage as a way of potentially infiltrating the Ministry of Mammon.</li> <li>Trish invites Thomas to come with her and Jack, and the three set off towards the Spire, where Trish is flat sitting for some Jordanian princesses who are soon to arrive in London for the grand opening of the Hotel at the Spire. Both Kusha and Berith are somewhat taken aback at the flagrant Tyrannical symbolism of the building.</li> <li>Kusha has a brief moment of panic when the concierge of the Hotel, Mr. Singh attempts to mentally scan him, but Trish seems to be able to distract him and fast talk their way into the building. Mr. Singh seems to except Berith's presence without any additional scrutiny - probably indicating Berith's secured status within the Ministry.</li> <li>The three enter the luxurious 5 star restaurant of the Hotel, and Trish greats the bartender and sommelier, and asks about Joanna, a waitress who lives in Walworth Estates who first alerted Trish to the problems with &quot;rats and stray dogs howling&quot;. The nighttime city skyline of London is visible through the panoramic window of the restaurant, as well as the eerie dark glow of the new Moon.</li> <li>They make their way to Saulii and Alexis' table and Trish greets them. Saulil seems to know Thomas from City political events (maybe he is an important donor?). Jack is uncomfortable in such an upper class, big money environment, and indulges his vice of introversion (I don't know if <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar27258_4.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27258\" data-vbnamecard=\"27258\">Cauthon</a> spent any willpower, but if so, take a willpower).</li> <li>Mekhaine casts Supernal Veiling on himself with an extended duration, and uses Supernal Vision to scan Jack and Trish. He discovers that Jack is a newly awakened Mastigos, and contemplates using Connections to learn his sympathetic connections to other order mages. Trish reveals herself to be a mystery, having some unknown supernatural power of a potent kind.</li> <li>Trish briefly fills Saulil in on what she and Thomas have been up to, and then wanders off to find Joanna, leaving Thomas and Jack to discuss the matter in more detail with the two business partners.</li> </ul>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-09T14:12:29-07:00","id":1535369,"title":"","content":"Week 13<br /> 1 beat each for <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a>, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28057-nickeldan\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28057\" data-vbnamecard=\"28057\">nickeldan</a> , <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27809-victorofnyke\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27809\" data-vbnamecard=\"27809\">VictorOfNyke</a> , and <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar27258_4.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27258\" data-vbnamecard=\"27258\">Cauthon</a> for posting. Some really great player interaction and RP, so everyone take an extra beat for that.<br /> <br /> I think we are going to keep going with the current scene till everyone feels like they have what they need in terms of information and planning. Pylon formation.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-09T14:26:24-07:00","id":1535372,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CalvinSiler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1530141-god-s-away-on-business-mta2e-seer-chronicle-occ?p=1534455#post1534455\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> A report on crime in the neighborhood does not match some of the police reports that Trish has been able to uncover. Trish has asked around the newspaper she is interning for and there are rumors that some people have been asked to downplay a series of seemingly unrelated deaths and &quot;missing persons&quot; cases over the past few years. (This clue also contains an additional element and counts as a +2 to further investigation.</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CalvinSiler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1531143-god-s-away-on-business-mtaw2e-seer-chronicle-ic?p=1535061#post1535061\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;This is my friend, Jack Bron. He's a very important part of the Walworth community. He's the head of the Mental Health Clinic there.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a> , <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28057-nickeldan\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28057\" data-vbnamecard=\"28057\">nickeldan</a> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27809-victorofnyke\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27809\" data-vbnamecard=\"27809\">VictorOfNyke</a> <br /> <br /> You remember from a news story that the former head of the Mental Health Clinic disappeared under mysterious circumstances.<br /> \u200b","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":