order-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> The former head of the Health Clinic was a Silver Ladder mage, Angitia, who was brutally murdered. You were assigned by the Arrow in part to replace her. If anyone, ahem, casts <i>Correspondence</i> on you, it is likely that she will appear as one of your sympathetic connections. You are aware that there is an 11Q investigating her death. Like most 11Q, he is supper annoying </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Roll Medicine (with Psychology Skill Specialty) six times and tell me how many successes you get. And then give me an Occult roll.</div> </div> </div> </div>Medicine and Occult with... what Attributes?<br /> <br /> For the emotional connotations - Trish is &quot;duty&quot;, and Cottle is &quot;paranoia mixed with sadness&quot;.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-15T10:57:26-07:00","id":1535653,"title":"","content":"Oh. Sorry. Wits or Manipulation for Medicine (whichever you feel like better simulates therapy), and Int for Occult. Since we decided not do the flashback scene, I'm Basically turning Jack and Joanna's interactions over the past six months into an extended action. The more successes the more up Jack is on what's going on with her and the &quot;rats and stray dogs&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27436,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","user":"CalvinSiler","date":". 05-15-2024, 02:33 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-15T12:39:46-07:00","id":1535664,"title":"","content":"I just posted the <i>Correspondence</i> cast in the IC thread, which ended up triplicating the post, one of them being automatically flagged for mod approval, I am very confused.<br /> <br /> In the meantime, here is a visual of what the Imago looks like, the microchip shaped like an optimized House of Wisdom:<br /> <br /> <img width=\"200\" height=\"200\" data-align=\"none\" data-size=\"full\" loading=\"lazy\" border=\"0\" src=\"https://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/rounderhouse-gold-proposal/AmapiRam.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"https://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/rounderhouse-gold-proposal/AmapiRam.jpg\" data-thumb-url=\"https://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/rounderhouse-gold-proposal/AmapiRam.jpg\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"\" class=\"bbcode-attachment thumbnail js-lightbox bbcode-attachment--lightbox\" itemprop=\"image\"/>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br 