-flavored as the House of Wisdom built as Infrastructure, and then repurposed by the rote creator into a microchip style Imago, inspired by the one in <i>Return of the Joker</i>. It manifests atop the amygdala of the subject because its the main processing center for emotions, so its where the technology would scan for sympathetic connections. The writing lookup references mudra is a way to link the rote skill of investigation, since you are making a query of the library. <br /> <br /> I have some good news, my IC post has been rescued from the temporal anomaly.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-17T03:38:29-07:00","id":1535761,"title":"","content":"Week 14<br /> 1 beat each to <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a>, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar27258_4.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27258\" data-vbnamecard=\"27258\">Cauthon</a> , and <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28057-nickeldan\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28057\" data-vbnamecard=\"28057\">nickeldan</a> for posting","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-17T04:14:40-07:00","id":1535763,"title":"","content":"As always, check my math, but I think we are sitting at beat totals of<br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a> 11 beats<br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28057-nickeldan\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28057\" data-vbnamecard=\"28057\">nickeldan</a> 11 beats<br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27809-victorofnyke\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27809\" data-vbnamecard=\"27809\">VictorOfNyke</a> 10 beats, 1 arcane beat<br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar27258_4.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27258\" data-vbnamecard=\"27258\">Cauthon</a> 9 beats, 1 arcane beat","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-17T06:27:51-07:00","id":1535767,"title":"","content":"Looking at my character sheet and considering the 2XP for Trained Observer, plus the recent beat, I have 12 beats so far. In arcane beats, I have 1 from learning more about Trish and one from the week 12 post for making headway into a new Mystery, although now I wonder if they aren't the same. I just added the recent beat from week 14, so the character sheet is now up to date.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-17T07:43:52-07:00","id":1535770,"title":"","content":"It seems to me like the main issues in the current scene are:<br /> 1. Whether to include Kusha in the Pylon's plans<br /> 2. <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar27258_4.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27258\" data-vbnamecard=\"27258\">Cauthon</a> determining how much Kusha knows about what's going with the possible supernatural occurrences in Walworth (psychology and occult extended action). <br /> 3. How to act on the information about government corruption that Trish and Thomas uncovered.<br /> 4. Plan for the upcoming Borough Council vote on the Roland Property Group's proposal to demolish and renovate the Walworth Estate.<br /> <br /> In addition to the &quot;Rats and Stray Dogs&quot; mystery, there is the mystery of Trish's supernatural powers. Saulin is also preparing for the arrival of members of the Jordanian royal family for the grand opening of the Spire. Kusha is pursuing the mystery of Mr. Fish. and Mekhaine is pursuing a potentially related mystery of his own awakening and &quot;Magical Technology&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-17T11:41:35-07:00","id":1535782,"title":"","content":"Manipulation + Medicine rolls (3+3+1, 9-Again)<br /> 8,1,8,3,2, 9,8,5 (4 Successes)<br /> 7,10,10,7,3, 8,8,5,8 (5 successes)<br /> 9,6,5,5,4, 9,3,9,1,7 (3 successes)<br /> 10,5,10,5,5, 8,2,7,5 (3 successes)<br /> 4,10,9,2,10, 4,8,9,3,9, 5,1 (6 successes)<br /> 8,5,6,9,10, 7,7,5,2 (3 successes)<br /> <br /> Intelligence + Occult roll (3 + 3)<br /> 4,2,2,6,4, 1 (0 successes)<br /> <br /> Well, that was a run.<br /> <br /> Side note, I'm mildly amused that Jack's literal dislike of dogs ( the scar really is just from a dog he was minding) got taken as double-speak","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":27258,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","user":"Cauthon","date":". 05-17-2024, 02:44 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-17T16:07:40-07:00","id":1535807,"title":"","content":"OK!<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar27258_4.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27258\" data-vbnamecard=\"27258\">Cauthon</a> (Spoilers for other PC)<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> Your Arrow cabal does not know who killed Angitia. There have been several deaths and unsolved disappearances of Pentacle mages in London over the past few years. The Hierarch, Civitas, claims that getting to the bottom of things is a top priority, but nothing has been resolved yet, which makes many mages in the city nervous and paranoid. Hooke is convinced it must be the Seers, while Hailey has his own theories about celestial beings (&quot;Wandering Angels&quot; is his exact phrase) from beyond the stars. Trish's claim, veiled of course in the obscurity of a small town sleeper newspaper from the colonies (Yes Hailey refers to the United States as the &quot;colonies&quot; - unironically), is of much interest to both Hooke and Hailey, and they have been secretly paying a panopticon agent to scrub the internet of any mention of Trish other than the article you found. Your reports that Trish appears to have some sort of mysterious power that triggers your PMS has only increased their interest in the matter. Angitia's death, which is tragic of course, seems to Hooke to be an opportunity. They had you burry the body so that you would develop a strong sympathetic connection. A GoV named Donne helped you. He doesn't say much, but he smokes cigarettes like a chimney and has a thousand yard stare that is unsettling. Hooke and Donne seem to think this will help in someway if there is an investigation of Emma's death. The over all impression that Kusha has of London is that Pentacle Mages are even more old fashioned, stuck in the past, unwilling to change, and obsessed with in-fighting and their own petty squabbles than they were in Manchester. And he is still upset about how things turned out in Manchester. Kusha has done a little bit of digging into Angitia's background and she seems like she was an unusually wise and good mage who genuinely cared about helping the sleepers of her community. Peele, the 11Q, pops in now in then to ask annoying questions and go through Emma's files. He doesn't seem like much of a people person. </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-17T16:48:32-07:00","id":1535809,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar27258_4.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27258\" data-vbnamecard=\"27258\">Cauthon</a>. And some of this might be relevant to <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar4967_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"4967\" data-vbnamecard=\"4967\">lbeaumanior</a> as well.<br /> <br /> 1. (4 successes) Joanna, or &quot;Jo&quot;, is a 19 year old British Indian woman (She is able to speak some Hindi and Punjab with other Indian Immigrants but mostly speaks in a thick <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Multicultural_London_English\" target=\"_blank\">Multicultural London English</a> accent). She is small and petite, a little under 5 feet (152 cm) weighing about 100 lb. (45 kg), with dark eyes and long black hair which she usually keeps in a single braid in the back. She typically wears baggy cargo pants, military style boots with thick soles that add a little bit to her height, and loose fitting hoodies. Her favorite is a faded red one that says something about donating blood. Jack first met her when a young Japanese woman named Trish Takahashi brought her into the clinic about six months ago in June. While Jo didn't seem that different from most of the other clients in the clinic, Trish seemed like she had walked in from another world (Presence 4 + Striking Looks 2 + Taste [Fashion] + Resources) Trish was interning at a large, well known London newspaper and Jo had come into the office in near hysterics claiming that she was constantly being followed by large rats and that she couldn't sleep at night because of the sound of howling dogs. Trish promised Jo to look into the animal control situation in Walworth Estates, but also thought that Jo might need some professional mental health care.<br /> <br /> p.s. I know that <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar27258_4.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27258\" data-vbnamecard=\"27258\">Cauthon</a> cares what characters sound like. Trish sounds like Audrey Hepburn from like Roman Holiday or Breakfast at Tiffany's most of the time, but if you get enough alcohol into her, or she is tired enough, she starts slipping into a weird mix of Texas and Osaka-ben. She also seems to be functionally conversational in an improbable number of languages besides Japanese and English. Joanna has a pronounced MLE accent which is different from cockney. It overemphasizes &quot;h&quot; sounds and typically morphs the &quot;Th&quot; into a &quot;T&quot; or a &quot;D&quot; sound. &quot;Wat da <i><b>H</b></i>ell is tis ting?&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-17T16:52:22-07:00","id":1535810,"title":"","content":"2. (5 successes. Exceptional. Informed Condition) Jo grew up in a relatively stable single parent home in Southall, North-West London, did well in academics and sport, practicing gymnastics and ballet, until her mother died when she was 12. She was sent to live with her grandmother, a longtime resident of the Walworth estates.<br /> <br /> After moving to South London, Joanna became increasingly anti-social. As a teen she became increasingly prone to violent emotional reactions and anger. She typically pushes people away emotionally, is constantly testing boundaries and deliberately setting other people off to get a rise out of them. Her senior year of school she was expelled for starting a fight with another student. Her relationship with her grandmother is strained, and she frequently spends time living on the streets with other homeless people rather than her grandmother\u2019s flat. When Jack first met Jo she was malnourished and underweight and not in good health. She has had some problems with substance abuse in the past, but is currently sober. She has frequent headaches and migraines, stomach throbs and cramps, frequent nose bleeds, and on occasion spontaneous menstruation.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-17T17:22:14-07:00","id":1535813,"title":"","content":"3. (3 Successes) Jack feels like he has been able to help Jo some, despite the fact that she can be quite disruptive in group therapy sessions and frequently refers to Jack as an \u201cImperialist Pig\u201d in reference to his military service.<br /> <br /> 4. (3 Successes) One of his most successful ideas is to channel Jo\u2019s energies towards exercise. He started a running therapy group, and Jo has made remarkable progress towards getting back into shape in the past few months. She has even used her former gymnastics training to get into Parkour. But this has had the unfortunate downside of her getting into trouble with the police on a few occasions, and Jack and Trish have had to bail her out. She has become more physically athletic then when Jack first met her, gaining muscle mass and also increased dexterity and stamina. It\u2019s almost like she took a small dose of some kind of \u201csuper soldier serum\u201d.<br /> <br /> 5. (6 Successes. Exceptional. 1 Arcane Beat. No success on Occult roll) After careful observation of the mundane and magical varieties, Kusha has determined that Jo\u2019s headaches and bleeding are in some way related to the presence of certain kinds of rats and spiders, but he has not yet determined why this is. Perhaps a Thyrsus mage like Saulin ( <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28057-nickeldan\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28057\" data-vbnamecard=\"28057\">nickeldan</a> ) could help.<br /> <br /> 6. (3 Successes) Despite a probable ASPD (Anti-Social Personality Disorder, sometimes called &quot;psychopathy&quot;) diagnosis, and a strong feeling that Jo spends a good deal of her time thinking about how to murder people in hard to detect ways, Jack strongly believes that Jo wants and needs relationships, and he feels like he and Trish have become touchstones for her. Trish also helped Jo get a job as a waitress at the Spire Hotel restaurant and bar. She is the nervous and tense looking waitress that Mekhaine ( <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a> ) noticed earlier in the evening.<br /> <br /> Which brings us to tonight, January 10th, the night of the New Moon. Kusha has been sensing some kind of tension slowly building in Jo, and has a sense of foreboding about something setting her off. Hopefully Trish will be able to talk to her and see what's wrong. <br /> <br /> I know this is an info dump. Let me know if you have questions or need clarification on anything. I kind of planned on this all playing out over several scenes, so I guess just use your imagination (it is a RPG after all) that Jack has been slowly building all this up over the past six months and has become increasingly worried about Jo. And Trish's safety.<br /> <br /> \u200b<br /> \u200b<br /> \u200b","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-17T17:31:34-07:00","id":1535815,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar4967_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"4967\" data-vbnamecard=\"4967\">lbeaumanior</a> If you are going with your current character concept then you would have also observed that Joanna, in addition to becoming increasingly &quot;fit&quot;, has started saying things about being able to hear and smell things in the environment that you and your other &quot;brothers' can't. She also has started taking increasing risks, without any fear or sense of risk to her own safety. That geezer Dr. Jack says that this is a symptom of ASPD, whatever that is. All you know is that when she's jumping from roof to roof the way she has been, it kind of scares you. Maybe in a good way.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-17T17:54:12-07:00","id":1535821,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27809-victorofnyke\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27809\" data-vbnamecard=\"27809\">VictorOfNyke</a> and <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a> It is possible that you are familiar with Caerus' ( <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar4967_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"4967\" data-vbnamecard=\"4967\">lbeaumanior</a> 's character) gang (which includes Joanna) due to their penchant for running in with the Law. Maybe you have even used their skills (vandalism, theft, roughing people up, and general hooliganism) for Seer business in the past.\u200b","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-17T17:58:15-07:00","id":1535822,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-size:18px\"><b>Caerus</b></span><br /> <b>Name:</b> \u00c9douard Franceschi<br /> <b>Age:</b> 17<br /> <b>Height: </b>1.7m<br /> <b>Eyes:</b> Hazel<br /> <b>Hair:</b> Black<br /> <b>Path:</b> Acanthus<br /> <b>Legacy:</b> None (aiming for someting with Mind eventually)<br /> <b>Immediate Nimbus:</b> People become more centered (+1 Composure).<br /> <b>Signature Nimbus:</b> The moment of discovering something exciting and then losing interest.<br /> <b>Long Term Nimbus: </b>Everything seems aligned and preordened.<br /> <b>Dedicated Magical Tools:</b> Lunargent coin engraved with &quot;<i>Might Makes Right</i>&quot;.<br /> <b>Concept:</b> Ambitious youth.<br /> <br /> <b>Background</b><br /> This third generation French (Corsican), \u00c9douard is too smart and quick thinking for his own good. He wishes to &quot;leave the dump&quot; as he calls the neighborhood. He likes, really, REALLY likes Joanna and really, REALLY wants to get ahead in life. After awakening he was discovered by a Seer that only him seems able to remember (Tyche) that taught him a lot and initiated him in the Seers. To this impressionable youth she is what he aims to be: she was the strongest, best dressed, better looking, smartest and richest person he had ever met and she messed his wordview (in a good way), worked on his vocabulary, speech patterns, manner of dressing, on his magical training, and taught him that he is as special as he thinks himself to be, even his Shadow Name was picked by her. Tyche's dissapearance is a really big blow to him, he has a bit of a crush on her.<br /> <br /> He has a soft spot for his mum Elaine, and his cat &quot;Dr. Wiggles&quot;, and has no idea where his father Michel is currently, last time he heard anything he was in Scotland doing oil rig maintenance, but that was years ago and of course the man sends no money to speak of.<br /> <br /> <b>The Awakening</b><br /> He really doesn't know! There are gaps in his memory that scare him a lot, probably his old master playing Mind tricks with him.<br /> <br /> <b>Description and Personality</b><br /> People think him absolutely calm and tranquil, nothing further from the truth, he is just so lazy that even emotions take their time. He used to dress like the stereotypical chav, but since seeing what posh people actually get too, he is quietely trying to improve his wardrobe (hard to do with his frame and resources). Not an impossing figure by any means, he talks his way through most things, he is trying really hard to get fit recently. He has been looking for Tyche but no one even remember the times she went to the school with the &quot;special education&quot; programme.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4967,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","user":"lbeaumanior","date":". 05-21-2024, 09:28 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-19T18:32:53-07:00","id":1535955,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27809-victorofnyke\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27809\" data-vbnamecard=\"27809\">VictorOfNyke</a> Berith probably gave Caerus a burner mobile phone with his number. Having a street gang in your pocket is probably useful to a Borough Councilman.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar27258_4.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27258\" data-vbnamecard=\"27258\">Cauthon</a> You have probably met Caerus once or twice when he came looking for Jo at the clinic. He's the one who introduced her to parkour. They may have even been making videos for the internet because Caerus seems to think that Jo is destined for viral super stardom.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a> retconning a little bit here. Edouard is the high school student that you originally pinged. So he was looking for Tyche and Acanthus related searches rather than Obrimos &quot;seeing radio signals&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27436,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","user":"CalvinSiler","date":". 05-19-2024, 10:00 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-19T19:18:45-07:00","id":1535962,"title":"","content":"Caerus is worried for Joanna's and she seems more unhinged of late, he is worried what to do to regarding Tyche, and decides to roll the bones to see what the future has in store.<br /> <br /> He casts <i>Divination </i>upon himself to ask now what to do to help her now, with +1 Reach assigned to instant use, +1 Reach for more specific questions and answers.<br /> <br /> Gnosis (1) + Time (2) + Lunargent bonus (2) + High Speech (2) + Willpower (3) = 10 dice (with 9-again)<br /> <br /> 1, 2, 4, <b>10</b>, 3, <b>10</b>, 3, 6, <b>10</b>, 2, <b>10</b>, 7, 3, 6 = 4 successes (E)<br /> <br /> He asks:<ol class=\"decimal\"><li>Am I in danger today from something?</li> <li>Will I find Tyche?</li> </ol><br /> Since this was an Exceptional Success on a Praxis, he recovers the Willpower point and picks a Condition, Charmed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4967,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","user":"lbeaumanior","date":".  Fixed the questions. Removed extra questions. 05-19-2024, 10:59 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-19T19:41:09-07:00","id":1535963,"title":"","content":"With Time 2, I think you get two questions. Were you aiming to take a -4 to increase the Potency to 4 (6 dice to roll in that case) ?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-19T19:54:33-07:00","id":1535964,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>KaiserAfini</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1530141-god-s-away-on-business-mta2e-seer-chronicle-occ?p=1535963#post1535963\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">With Time 2, I think you get two questions. Were you aiming to take a -4 to increase the Potency to 4 (6 dice to roll in that case) ?</div> </div> </div> </div>Ooookay, I think I was doing it wrong all the time then.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar27436_1.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27436\" data-vbnamecard=\"27436\">CalvinSiler</a> if this is it, then the first 2 questions only. My bad.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-19T20:19:55-07:00","id":1535966,"title":"","content":"How does Caesus perceive the voice of divination? For example with Berith things get colder and he hears the voice of Death ( like in Discworld)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-19T21:12:40-07:00","id":1535968,"title":"","content":"Go ahead and put a description of the casting in the IC thread and I will respond with the answers.<br /> <br /> Put in something about where Caerus is around 9 PM. Are you in Walworth, or enjoying the nightlife along the riverfront? The weather is clear and cold but not too chilly. It's the New Moon and there are no stars visible because of the city lights.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-19T21:20:19-07:00","id":1535969,"title":"","content":"Are you going with the floppy Mohawk look and switchblade (like classical depictions of Caerus?)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-19T21:22:06-07:00","id":1535970,"title":"","content":"Maybe he perceives Fate as a flash of lightning and thunder (son of Zeus).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-19T21:38:17-07:00","id":1535972,"title":"","content":"But also like the flashing camera bulbs of paparazzi.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-20T06:11:33-07:00","id":1535984,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CalvinSiler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1530141-god-s-away-on-business-mta2e-seer-chronicle-occ?p=1535966#post1535966\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">How does Caesus perceive the voice of divination? For example with Berith things get colder and he hears the voice of Death ( like in Discworld)</div> </div> </div> </div>He hear his own voice overlapping with Tyche's, his father's, mother's and other people he does not recognize.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CalvinSiler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1530141-god-s-away-on-business-mta2e-seer-chronicle-occ?p=1535969#post1535969\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Are you going with the floppy Mohawk look and switchblade (like classical depictions of Caerus?)</div> </div> </div> </div>He was like that, but after meeting Tyche he is cleaning up his act. Clean shaved, short almost skin head haircut. He does not have formal clothes but he is trying to look, in his own words: &quot;Professional and adult&quot;; which is a bit of a funny image as this is a skinny teenager.<br /> <br /> <br /> I will add a bit of background for him on the intro post.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4967,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","user":"lbeaumanior","date":". 05-20-2024, 09:25 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-20T08:08:01-07:00","id":1535987,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a>can I ask about a subject that I dont have on hand?<br /> <br /> So if I cast related to X person, do they have to be on sensory range? Can I circumvent asking in the the plural?<br /> <br /> if &quot;Will Mum be in danger?&quot; is invalid with her not around, can I go with &quot;Will mum or I be in danger?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-20T08:49:13-07:00","id":1535989,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>lbeaumanior</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1530141-god-s-away-on-business-mta2e-seer-chronicle-occ?p=1535987#post1535987\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a>can I ask about a subject that I dont have on hand?<br /> <br /> So if I cast related to X person, do they have to be on sensory range? Can I circumvent asking in the the plural?<br /> <br /> if &quot;Will Mum be in danger?&quot; is invalid with her not around, can I go with &quot;Will mum or I be in danger?&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>I believe you need to have the target being examined by the spell, unless its something the character will likely know. An example is if the character is about to open the door to a room, they could ask if it will be trapped. If they are investigating a case, they can ask where the murderer will strike next. So I think those questions are valid because the character would know once they are in danger or in the aftermath of that danger.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-20T15:17:13-07:00","id":1536004,"title":"","content":"It's a Time spell, so you are not limited by Space. You could theoretically look up a name in a telephone book and say, &quot;Is Sarah Connor home right now?&quot; and receive a yes or no answer. &quot;Is this the Sarah Connor that I am looking for?&quot; is not related to time and the subject, so that would not be a valid question for Divination. &quot;Will I find the Sarah Connor I am looking for if I go to this address?&quot; is more likely to yield a useful answer (a loophole that Berith exploited earlier in this chronicle).<br /> <br /> The more specific the question, the more likely that the information will be useful to you. &quot;Will Mum be in danger?&quot; does not have a time specificity so the answer would take into account her entire lifespan, including whatever eventually kills her (like cancer forty years from now).<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-20T15:24:58-07:00","id":1536006,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>KaiserAfini</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1530141-god-s-away-on-business-mta2e-seer-chronicle-occ?p=1535989#post1535989\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I believe you need to have the target being examined by the spell, unless its something the character will likely know. An example is if the character is about to open the door to a room, they could ask if it will be trapped. If they are investigating a case, they can ask where the murderer will strike next. So I think those questions are valid because the character would know once they are in danger or in the aftermath of that danger.</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CalvinSiler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1530141-god-s-away-on-business-mta2e-seer-chronicle-occ?p=1536004#post1536004\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's a Time spell, so you are not limited by Space. You could theoretically look up a name in a telephone book and say, &quot;Is Sarah Connor home right now?&quot; and receive a yes or no answer. &quot;Is this the Sarah Connor that I am looking for?&quot; is not related to time and the subject, so that would not be a valid question for Divination. &quot;Will I find the Sarah Connor I am looking for if I go to this address?&quot; is more likely to yield a useful answer (a loophole that Berith exploited earlier in this chronicle).<br /> <br /> The more specific the question, the more likely that the information will be useful to you. &quot;Will Mum be in danger?&quot; does not have a time specificity so the answer would take into account her entire lifespan, including whatever eventually kills her (like cancer forty years from now).</div> </div> </div> </div>Got it. I did rephrase the question, so it makes sense.<br /> <br /> What does stop you from doing binary search on a topic then? Besides time of course.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-20T15:58:37-07:00","id":1536009,"title":"","content":"Nothing, theoretically. Given time, and enough resolve and stamina, a mage is the most powerful being in the phenomenal world. If you want to spend decades, or centuries, casting divination to find Atlantis, or a Dragon, be my guest. Admittedly staying in your room and never leaving would not make a very interesting story for the other players. And Caerus would eventually reach limits to his own knowledge and mental capacity (unless you augment those in some way). And of course there are always other mages and &quot;things&quot; that may want to stop you from pursuing your chosen obsession.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-20T16:24:48-07:00","id":1536011,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar27436_1.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27436\" data-vbnamecard=\"27436\">CalvinSiler</a><br /> Can I just describe the casting in sequence to avoid lenghtly steps?<br /> <br /> Like I want to cast Serendipity twice and Divination twice, but not make multiple sets of posts, can I?<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <i>Divination 1:</i><br /> +1 Reach assigned to instant use, +1 Reach for more specific questions and answers.<br /> <br /> Gnosis (1) + Time (2) + Lunargent bonus (2) + High Speech (2) + Willpower (3) - 4 (increase potence) = 6 dice (with 9-again)<br /> <br /> 5, <b>9</b>, <b>9</b>, <b>10</b>, 4, 1, <b>10</b>, <b>10</b>, 6, 5, 3 = 5 successes (E)<br /> <br /> <br /> He asks:<ol class=\"decimal\"><li>Can I save myself from today's danger?</li> <li>Can I save Jo from today's danger?</li> <li>Can I do anything to benefit from this danger?</li> <li>Will killing this &quot;Trish&quot; stop today's danger?</li> </ol>I want to take another condition: <b>Steadfast</b><i>.</i> And of course Willpower recovered.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <i>Divination 2:</i><br /> +1 Reach assigned to instant use, +1 Reach for more specific questions and answers.<br /> <br /> Gnosis (1) + Time (2) + Lunargent bonus (2) + High Speech (2) + Willpower (3) = 9 dice (with 9-again)<br /> <br /> <b>9</b>, <b>8</b>, 6, <b>8</b>, 2, 3, 2, <b>8</b>, 1, <b>9</b>, 1 = 5 successes (E)<br /> <br /> <br /> He asks:<ol class=\"decimal\"><li>Is this &quot;Trish&quot; my ticket to finding Tyche?</li> <li>Is the third woman this &quot;Trish&quot;?</li> </ol>Recover Willpower and go for the <b>Informed</b> Condition.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <i>Serendipity 1</i><i>:</i><br /> +1 Reach assigned to instant use, +1 Reach for any skill of same type, +1 Reach for Advanced Duration.<br /> <br /> Gnosis (1) + Fate (3) + Lunargent bonus (2)* + High Speech (2) + Willpower (3) - 2 (increase Duration to a day) = 9 dice (with 9-again)<br /> <br /> 2, 2, 4, <b>9</b>, 5, 7, 3, 7, <b>10</b>, 3, 3 = 2 successes<br /> <br /> Goal is for Caerus to survive today's danger while benefiting from this. What does the destiny tell me?<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <i>Serendipity 2</i><i>:</i><br /> +1 Reach assigned to instant use, +1 Reach for any skill of same type, +1 Reach for Advanced Duration, +1 Reach for spell control<br /> <br /> Gnosis (1) + Fate (3) + Lunargent bonus (2)* + High Speech (2) + Willpower (3) - 2 (increase Duration to a day) = 9 dice (with 9-again)<br /> <br /> 5, <b>8</b>, <b>10</b>, 4, <b>9</b>, 1, 1, 2, <b>8</b>, <b>9</b>, 5, 5 = 5 successes (E)<br /> <br /> Goal is for Caerus to help Jo. What does the destiny tell me?<br /> <br /> Recover Willpower and ask for the <b>Inspired </b>condition.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Paradox 1 chance die.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> I am using an online dice roller, you can check my results online (it seems amazing to have so many Ext. Succ. but av. 9 dice and 9-again is helping a lot).<br /> <br /> <br /> \u200b*I think Lunargent bonus helps with seeing other times, and since <i>Serendipity </i>described as<i> &quot;all the potential roads her destiny may follow to her desired destination\u200b&quot;</i> it should apply, correct me if I am wrong and I will reroll the <i>Serendipity </i>\u200bcastings.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4967,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","user":"lbeaumanior","date":". 05-22-2024, 12:38 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-20T18:39:15-07:00","id":1536021,"title":"","content":"Out of curiosity, what time of day is Caerus doing these castings? It's Sunday (probably a continuity error there with the archive being open, but oh well), so no school to worry about till tomorrow (assuming Edourd still goes to school).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-20T18:49:58-07:00","id":1536022,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CalvinSiler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1530141-god-s-away-on-business-mta2e-seer-chronicle-occ?p=1536021#post1536021\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Out of curiosity, what time of day is Caerus doing these castings? It's Sunday (probably a continuity error there with the archive being open, but oh well), so no school to worry about till tomorrow (assuming Edourd still goes to school).</div> </div> </div> </div>You guys define the date, I am just joining, I am asking the last question for the first divination to see if I can have an excuse to look for the other players.<br /> <br /> And while he does not go to school most of the time, he doesnt have bad grades, Tyche taught him how to gain the most with the least effort... He divines when he should make an appearance at school (mandatory examns and such) he divines the questions/answers. He is a truant, but a high achiever academically. WHY does he want to have high grades? He is thinking longer term now, he plans to sell himself as a &quot;rags-to-riches&quot; story, applying for a scholarship, or interships..Anything to get ahead in life, he wants to be posh.<br /> <br /> As far as I am aware of the UK system, you dont really need mandatory assistance (but it can held you back), as long as you cover the required coursework... And I think the teachers at the school are surprised that a &quot;Thug&quot; still wants to take exams and that he is doing so well academically, they have checked for fraud, taking exams on his own with direct teacher supervision sometimes, but with Time spells he alwys gets top marks.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Feel free to correct or contradict anything I just posted.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-21T00:05:33-07:00","id":1536039,"title":"","content":"So, I hate to be nit-picky, but divination can tell you &quot;your subject's most likely future&quot; (MtAw 2E Core, pg. 186). Normally this is a yes, no, or irrelevant answer but with the reach you can &quot;ask more specific questions and receive mostly accurate answers&quot;. <br /> <br /> &quot;Will Joanna (or anyone else) try to kill me in the future?&quot; is an answerable question for divination, but the answer is as vague as the question. &quot;Can Trish save me?&quot; Is not a time related question, and therefore does not fall under the practice of knowing Time.<br /> <br /> Your first casting of divination revealed the answer to the question &quot;Am I in danger from something today?&quot; By indicating that something shocking and presumably dangerous will happen to you, Joanna, and another woman who speaks a language you don't recognize.<br /> <br /> Your second question, &quot;Will I ever find Tyche?&quot; Was answered with the condition that you must help &quot;her handmaiden first&quot;. And then the forgotten note with Trish's phone number presented itself to you, perhaps indicating that Trish is the &quot;handmaiden&quot; of Tyche in some way, and that helping her will lead you to Tyche.<br /> <br /> Given that, do you want to change the wording of the questions? You can keep the die results.<br /> <br /> My only other quible is that Driven is a condition specifically gifted by the Judges of Duat to the Arisen (to the best of my understanding. I don't have my MtC book with me right now)<br /> <br /> MtA is about the personal horror of hubris and so the system mechanics tend to punish &quot;ambition&quot; rather than reward it. Equivalent conditions to Driven for a Mage might be Megelomanical or Rampant, but my guess is that those have effects that you don't want - or maybe you do. Up to you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-21T00:07:17-07:00","id":1536040,"title":"","content":"I'm fine with you role playing a montage of multiple spell castings, similar to scenes from Dr. Strange where he casts the same spell over and over.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-21T00:17:28-07:00","id":1536041,"title":"","content":"If the goal of the first casting of serendipity is &quot;to survive the foretold danger and benefit from it&quot; and the second is &quot;to help Jo&quot; those are clearly stated goals. And I can put a response in the IC.<br /> <br /> It may be that there is some overlap in what you want the four spells to tell you. But remember that part of the trick of being an Acanthus is wisely <i>interpreting</i> the results of your spells.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-21T00:35:32-07:00","id":1536042,"title":"","content":"I just don't want to end up giving you useless or misleading answers. Ive done that before and it ends up disrupting the story and frustrating everyone. Ask <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28057-nickeldan\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28057\" data-vbnamecard=\"28057\">nickeldan</a>!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-21T02:15:40-07:00","id":1536046,"title":"","content":"Since it's Sunday, and Edouard's vice is laziness, I'm going to say that he wakes up around 10 AM. Mum is making eggs and bacon after coming back from early Mass.<br /> <br /> So, OOC that gives Edouard 10 hours to &quot;catch up&quot; to the rest of the PC in terms of game time. Joanna would have begun her shift around noon. Trish started researching at the archives around 3. And Mekhaine and Saulin began their meeting around 4 or 5.<br /> <br /> I kind of like the Oceans 11/Leverage aspect of having the Acanthus go last and saying &quot;I've been plotting the whole day for this&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-21T02:17:26-07:00","id":1536047,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27809-victorofnyke\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27809\" data-vbnamecard=\"27809\">VictorOfNyke</a> and <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a> you all are doing great. Feel free to jump in <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar27258_4.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27258\" data-vbnamecard=\"27258\">Cauthon</a> and <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28057-nickeldan\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28057\" data-vbnamecard=\"28057\">nickeldan</a> .","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-21T07:25:35-07:00","id":1536056,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CalvinSiler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1530141-god-s-away-on-business-mta2e-seer-chronicle-occ?p=1536039#post1536039\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;Will Joanna (or anyone else) try to kill me in the future?&quot; is an answerable question for divination, but the answer is as vague as the question. &quot;Can Trish save me?&quot; Is not a time related question, and therefore does not fall under the practice of knowing Time.</div> </div> </div> </div>Got you.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CalvinSiler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1530141-god-s-away-on-business-mta2e-seer-chronicle-occ?p=1536039#post1536039\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Given that, do you want to change the wording of the questions? You can keep the die results.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes I will change them. Please review the post again. Here and in the IC thread.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CalvinSiler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1530141-god-s-away-on-business-mta2e-seer-chronicle-occ?p=1536039#post1536039\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My only other quible is that Driven is a condition specifically gifted by the Judges of Duat to the Arisen (to the best of my understanding. I don't have my MtC book with me right now)<br /> <br /> MtA is about the personal horror of hubris and so the system mechanics tend to punish &quot;ambition&quot; rather than reward it. Equivalent conditions to Driven for a Mage might be Megelomanical or Rampant, but my guess is that those have effects that you don't want - or maybe you do. Up to you.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think that the result is applicable, I had<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/1236140-ask-a-simple-question-get-a-simple-answer-mummy-edition?p=1525040#post1525040\"> asked on the ask a simple question mummy forum</a> about this, just one person answered, but it seems to be aligned to be used by several splats. Of course you are the ST, so I would change the condition for <b>Steadfast</b>.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CalvinSiler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1530141-god-s-away-on-business-mta2e-seer-chronicle-occ?p=1536041#post1536041\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If the goal of the first casting of serendipity is &quot;to survive the foretold danger and benefit from it&quot; and the second is &quot;to help Jo&quot; those are clearly stated goals. And I can put a response in the IC.<br /> <br /> It may be that there is some overlap in what you want the four spells to tell you. But remember that part of the trick of being an Acanthus is wisely <i>interpreting</i> the results of your spells.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Yeah, the Serendipity castings are good as they are, they do not depend on the Divination answers. I expected overlap, slightly different wording might give different answers, and in the difference Caerus would gain.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4967,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","user":"lbeaumanior","date":". 05-21-2024, 10:42 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-22T06:29:58-07:00","id":1536098,"title":"","content":"Just a reminder. From an OOC perspective, castings of Divination and Prophecy are <i>suggestions</i> of possible futures. You all have the free will to do whatever you want as players, and Time will adapt.<br /> <br /> &quot;Always in motion is the future&quot; - an Ancient Void Wizened Changeling.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-22T09:46:36-07:00","id":1536101,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar27436_1.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27436\" data-vbnamecard=\"27436\">CalvinSiler</a> <br /> I made a mistake, I got 1 paradox die a chance die since I am overreaching with Serendipity 2. I also fixed his coin description in the post, putting some text on it, this is both a path and an Order tool.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Caerus decides to shower, groom, get his best clothes, and cast a final spell before going to Jo's workplace:<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <i>Fools Rush In</i><br /> <br /> +1 Reach assigned to instant use, +1 Reach for Advanced Duration, +1 Reach for going above Gnosis, +1 Reach for an already existing spell already over Gnosis .<br /> <br /> Gnosis (1) + Fate (3) + High Speech (2) + Path Tool (1) - 2 (increase Duration to a day) = 5 dice (with 9-again)<br /> <br /> 5, 6, 1, <b>8</b>, 2 = 1 success.<br /> <br /> <br /> Another Paradox chance die since I am using my Dedicatd magic tool to cast. I am not sure if the Order tool bonus makes sense here or the Path (it is a coin, affecting the world AND he is trying to affect how he goes around).<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Once in the tower he plans to stay in the good graces of this Trish, while shadowing Jo the whole day. This place is both related to helping Jo AND finding Tyche, this is it.<br /> <br /> <br /> IF today danger is averted, tomorrow Monday he plans to go to the Doc's place (no way of finding them now on Sunday right?), and bring the Artful boys to clean the place of rats. He will probably have to spend a bit buying poison and the guys time, but it could help Jo.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> OCC I am sure the basement is full of Beshilu, but he does not know that and tomorrow he will cast the &quot;<i>am I in danger from somthing today?</i>&quot; maybe he casts spells before entering.<br /> <br /> I just dont want to be the guy that stops the game flow, but OF COURSE as an Acanthus trained by Tyche he should at least minimally check before doing anything.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-22T13:18:53-07:00","id":1536113,"title":"","content":"Serendipity<br /> [6] No paradox<br /> <br /> Fools rush in<br /> [7] No paradox<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28057-nickeldan\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28057\" data-vbnamecard=\"28057\">nickeldan</a> What was Saulin doing around 11 in the morning?<br /> <br /> &quot;No plan survives first contact with the enemy&quot; - Helmut von Moltke","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-22T15:47:45-07:00","id":1536120,"title":"","content":"The doorman should be aware of Jo's description, Caerus tries to ingraciate himself with the doorman, using Fast-Talk:<br /> <br /> Manipulation (3) + Persuasion (3) + Fast-Talk specialty (1) = 7 dice<br /> <br /> 2, 1, 1, 2, 1, 3, 4 = 0 successes.<br /> <br /> I choose to have a dramatic failure, for a regular beat.<br /> <br /> As I am almost certain the guy in the door will NEVER let Caerus pass, Caerus calls Jo to leave a voice message (she shouldnt be able to answer if she is working). <i>&quot;Love, I was at the front door of your building, guard doesn't like me too much. Gotta talk to you once you are done, I'll be around your Grans home, I will try to come back once your shift is done, do not go <u>anywhere</u> until I return. Very serious stuff, I need your help</i>&quot;.<br /> <br /> Caerus will ask Jo about Trish, since in the vision they were talking familiarly, and he needs an introduction. Caerus said he needs help because if he says she is in danger she will ask details.<br /> <br /> <br /> In the meanwhile, I will call the boys to join me at her Grans place, ask them to bring rat poison, rat traps, bags, cricket bats (anything to hit rats), gloves, and tools to break and enter (I should have tools though I am a thief and that is my Professional Training on Larceny).<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> You mentioned that I have 10 hours to catch up with the guys. Since I dont plan to wait 10 hours doing nothing around the building, I will go to the Gran house to check the place, beat as many rats as we can and bag them, put traps and poison and return here. I bring the Club because what are your minions for if not menial work?<br /> <br /> <br /> IF no issues I will break and enter the place to do all that and return, I will keep waiting around but out of sight of the guard.<br /> <br /> IF issues, I will play it by ear.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4967,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","user":"lbeaumanior","date":". 05-22-2024, 07:00 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-22T18:18:16-07:00","id":1536122,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CalvinSiler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1530141-god-s-away-on-business-mta2e-seer-chronicle-occ?p=1536113#post1536113\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Serendipity<br /> [6] No paradox<br /> <br /> <b>Fools rush in<br /> [7] No paradox</b><br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Fool Rush In should have been 2 paradox dice. 1 from the spell and another from:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Paradox Core book p.115</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">+1 Each Paradox roll after the first made for<br /> the same caster within the same scene.<br /> This bonus accumulates with each roll, so<br /> the third roll made for a mage within a<br /> scene has a +2 modifier.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-22T19:19:21-07:00","id":1536124,"title":"","content":"Oop. Sorry. Good catch.<br /> <br /> Did you want to contain the paradox or release it?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-22T19:24:27-07:00","id":1536126,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CalvinSiler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1530141-god-s-away-on-business-mta2e-seer-chronicle-occ?p=1536124#post1536124\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oop. Sorry. Good catch.<br /> <br /> Did you want to contain the paradox or release it?</div> </div> </div> </div>Release it. Let's see what happens.<br /> <br /> <br /> Also, are we using that a scene is close in time to an hour? Like the Page 113 of the core puts the advanced duration &quot;One scene/hour&quot; so, IF so that will colour my next set of decisions.<br /> <br /> If so, I cancel all spells on Caerus while going towards Jo's Gran place. I want to reset the paradox counter and be &quot;clean&quot; at her Grans.<br /> <br /> Caerus was rushing due to fear but since he has at least until Jo leaves the shift, he can more calmy decide what to do with his spells... He is loaded and paradox prone for no reason as of this moment.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4967,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","user":"lbeaumanior","date":". 05-22-2024, 10:30 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-22T19:51:49-07:00","id":1536128,"title":"","content":"OK. Well sorry about this.<br /> <br /> [<b>9,9</b>] so go ahead and reroll Fools rush in with a -2 to see if it succeeds, and then I'll use my 2 Reach.<br /> <br /> I tend to think of &quot;scenes&quot; as being locations, but I suppose if you stayed in a location long enough it would count as a new scene (Like with Saulin and Mekhaine. When Berith and Kusha showed up I counted that as a new scene). So for the purposes of casting I would say you are &quot;clean&quot; by the time you arrive at Gran's.<br /> <br /> To clarify, she lives in a flat on the fourth story. Jo thinks the rats that are making her sick are in the basement in an area that has been blocked off because of an investigation into its structural integrity.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-22T19:54:31-07:00","id":1536129,"title":"","content":"Not that I'm discouraging this line of action, but you do also have the option of calling Trish. Or Berith ( <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27809-victorofnyke\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27809\" data-vbnamecard=\"27809\">VictorOfNyke</a>) the Moros Councilman.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-22T19:59:01-07:00","id":1536131,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CalvinSiler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1530141-god-s-away-on-business-mta2e-seer-chronicle-occ?p=1536128#post1536128\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">OK. Well sorry about this.<br /> <br /> [<b>9,9</b>] so go ahead and reroll Fools rush in with a -2 to see if it succeeds, and then I'll use my 2 Reach.<br /> <br /> I tend to think of &quot;scenes&quot; as being locations, but I suppose if you stayed in a location long enough it would count as a new scene (Like with Saulin and Mekhaine. When Berith and Kusha showed up I counted that as a new scene). So for the purposes of casting I would say you are &quot;clean&quot; by the time you arrive at Gran's.<br /> <br /> To clarify, she lives in a flat on the fourth story. Jo thinks the rats that are making her sick are in the basement in an area that has been blocked off because of an investigation into its structural integrity.</div> </div> </div> </div>Gnosis (1) + Fate (3) + High Speech (2) + Order or Path Tool (1) - 2 (increase Duration to a day) -2 Paradox = 3 dice (with 9-again)<br /> <br /> 6, <b>10</b>, <b>8</b>, <b>8</b> = 3 successes<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4967,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","user":"lbeaumanior","date":". 05-22-2024, 11:12 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-22T20:05:10-07:00","id":1536132,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CalvinSiler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1530141-god-s-away-on-business-mta2e-seer-chronicle-occ?p=1536129#post1536129\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Not that I'm discouraging this line of action, but you do also have the option of calling Trish. Or Berith ( <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27809-victorofnyke\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27809\" data-vbnamecard=\"27809\">VictorOfNyke</a>) the Moros Councilman.</div> </div> </div> </div><i>&quot;Hello Madam, you don't know me but I would like to meet you. Why you ask? I had a magic vision of a posh lady that sounded just like you and I simply can not wait to meet you. How did I get this number? Oh well, my magic visions also come with random effects.&quot;</i><br /> <br /> Or if you wish I can try to do the<i> Fools Rush In</i> effect with the call.<br /> <br /> Actually, taht sounds good. Let me fail with the guard and try calling this lady by phone, since I have no idea what to say as a player, but let say that Fate guides his words:<br /> <br /> <br /> Manipulation (3) + Persuasion (3) + Fast-Talk specialty (1) = 7 dice<br /> <br /> 3, 2, 4, 5, 2, <b>9</b>, 7 = 1 success.<br /> <br /> If I succed in making Trish come pick me at the entrance, I will rub it the guards face. And not cancel any effects yet. I still need to get in this lady good graces.<br /> <br /> <br /> If I fail in convincing her, then as the posts above mentioned: cancel spells, go to Gran's, wait for the Gang.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4967,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","user":"lbeaumanior","date":". 05-22-2024, 11:13 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-22T20:22:57-07:00","id":1536134,"title":"","content":"OK. So Fools Rush In succeeds. I'm going to go with an Abyssal Backlash. So next time you cast a spell that incurs paradox, I will add a +2 to the pool.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-22T20:45:12-07:00","id":1536136,"title":"","content":"For the hell of it - would I have heard anything about disappearances around the Estate? And/or should I roll for recall (Intelligence+Composure or Relevant Skill)?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-22T20:56:12-07:00","id":1536138,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a> I think Mekhaine will quickly discover that the greatest security threat to the Spire is Trish living there. She will let any random stranger off the street into the building if it suits her.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-22T21:01:54-07:00","id":1536139,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar27258_4.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27258\" data-vbnamecard=\"27258\">Cauthon</a> Sure. Go for it. Vanilla Int + Comp is fine, or Politics or Socialize.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-22T21:14:49-07:00","id":1536140,"title":"","content":"Composure+Intelligence - 3+2<br /> 5,8,6,9,1 (2 successes)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-22T21:27:45-07:00","id":1536141,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar27258_4.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27258\" data-vbnamecard=\"27258\">Cauthon</a><br /> <br /> Unfortunately people disappearing is not that uncommon in London, especially in lower income communities and immigrant enclaves.<br /> <br /> 1. A young Kenyan immigrant and her boyfriend recently went missing. <br /> 2. A pregnant woman was living in a flat near by, but it looks like its vacant now, and no one seems to know where she has gone.<br /> <br /> Since Jack is the neighborhood Shrink, and the clinic has a pretty good reputation because of Emma, many people have no problem sharing their problems with Jack or gossiping about other people's problems.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-24T10:02:32-07:00","id":1536212,"title":"","content":"Week 15<br /> 1 beat each for <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a>, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar27258_4.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27258\" data-vbnamecard=\"27258\">Cauthon</a> , <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28057-nickeldan\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28057\" data-vbnamecard=\"28057\">nickeldan</a> , <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27809-victorofnyke\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27809\" data-vbnamecard=\"27809\">VictorOfNyke</a> and <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar4967_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"4967\" data-vbnamecard=\"4967\">lbeaumanior</a> for posting this week.<br /> <br /> I feel like my notes on PC Asperations and Obsessions are out of date. If you post with a reminder of your Asperations for your character and their obsession, I will award a beat. Plus a beat for any applicable Asperation fulfillments.<br /> <br /> So lots happened. to Recap:<ul><li>Kusha got a more established backstory.<ul><li>Shortly after the disappearance of beloved doctor and Health Clinic director Emma Cottle six months ago (June 2015) , Jack Bron, aka Kusha, arived from Manchester and took over directorship of the clinic.</li> <li>A Journalism Intern Trish Takahashi showed up at the clinic with another young woman, Joanna Bhediya and introduced her to Jack.</li> <li>Joanna seems to have significant mental health issues, was expelled from her school for fighting, has experienced some housing insecurity, and has some sort of strange disorder that causes her to have intense migraines and nose bleeds.</li> <li>Jack, who is long distant runner and is training for the London Marathon, started a running therapy group and invited Joanna to join. At first she was very out of shape and struggled because of her health issues, but over the next few months became a skilled runner and greatly improved her physical conditioning.</li> <li>Trish was able to get Joanna a job as a waitress at the Spire hotel restaurant</li> <li>From a mundane sleeper perspective, Joanna seems to exhibits signs of Anti-social Personality Disorder (Psychopath), but Jack suspects that something more is going on, because her physical symptoms seem to be tied to the presence of certain kinds of rats and spiders. He wasn't able to figure out an Occult connection, but it definitely warrants further research.</li> <li>Kusha has learned that there have been several other disappearances in the community other than Emma. When a Pentacle mage disappears, the Seers are always the first suspects of course. But can the Seers really be responsible for all of these missing persons?</li> </ul></li> <li>We added a new Player Character, Caerus ( <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar4967_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"4967\" data-vbnamecard=\"4967\">lbeaumanior</a>) , a 17 year old Corsican Immigrant who lives near Joanna in Walworth Estates<ul><li>When he awoke he received some kind of mentorship from someone named Tyche, who seems to have disappeared, and he has trouble remembering all the circumstances of his awakening</li> <li>He has had a crush on Joanna for years, but has finally been able to connect with her over her new found athletic ability and parkour training, and they have made some internet videos together.</li> <li>He leads a mystery cult/street gang, the Artful Club, and has performed services for Berith in the past, spying on and harassing political rivals.</li> <li>He has become worried about Joanna, and a recent round of divinations has revealed that she is going to be in some kind of danger the night of January 10th. Someone named Trish is involved, and he has gone to the Spire on the morning of to find Trish and figure out what is going on.</li> </ul></li> <li>Latter that evening, Saulin, Mekhaine, Berith, and Kusha meet to discuss their plans<ul><li>Berith shares the information that he and Trish were able to uncover about the corrupt management of the Walworth Estate.</li> <li>Mekhaine is concerned about the effect of Trish potentially publishing an article that could draw attention to the situation.</li> <li>Saulin thinks that this may be useful for convincing other council members to vote for his firm's proposal to demolish the current Estate buildings and build a 21st century community for a better city (or something like that. His Tyranic dream vision is open to interpretation <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> ) and wants to visit the Estate to gather information and perhaps find out more about the apparent rat infestation in the basement of one of the flat buildings because he suspects that it may have something to do with the spiritual ecology of the area.</li> </ul></li> </ul>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27436,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","user":"CalvinSiler","date":". 05-24-2024, 01:09 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-24T11:54:13-07:00","id":1536216,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CalvinSiler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1530141-god-s-away-on-business-mta2e-seer-chronicle-occ?p=1536212#post1536212\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Week 15<br /> 1 beat each for <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a>, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar27258_4.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27258\" data-vbnamecard=\"27258\">Cauthon</a> , <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28057-nickeldan\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28057\" data-vbnamecard=\"28057\">nickeldan</a> , <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27809-victorofnyke\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27809\" data-vbnamecard=\"27809\">VictorOfNyke</a> and <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar4967_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"4967\" data-vbnamecard=\"4967\">lbeaumanior</a> for posting this week.<br /> <br /> I feel like my notes on PC Asperations and Obsessions are out of date. If you post with a reminder of your Asperations for your character and their obsession, I will award a beat. Plus a beat for any applicable Asperation fulfillments.</div> </div> </div> </div>Caerus<br /> Obsessions: Anomalous Person (Joanna)<br /> Aspirations: Become stronger; Find Tyche; Make Joanna my girlfriend<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> I got in, I wish to speak to Trish ASAP, and feel her about Tyche... So I can start using active mage sight on her.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> I might to return later with full Exceptional Luck + Superlative Luck enhancements on my Focused mage sight rolls. I want to find Tyche, but I can not do it if I die tonight. So... Priorities.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-24T15:00:44-07:00","id":1536218,"title":"","content":"<b>Mekhane</b><br /> <b>Obsessions:</b> Magical Technology<br /> <b>Aspirations:</b> Find the truth behind the missing project, setup my own business, develop cutting edge magical technology<br /> <br /> I think all of them are in progress.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CalvinSiler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1530141-god-s-away-on-business-mta2e-seer-chronicle-occ?p=1536138#post1536138\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a> I think Mekhaine will quickly discover that the greatest security threat to the Spire is Trish living there. She will let any random stranger off the street into the building if it suits her.</div> </div> </div> </div>So she is both a reporter that makes information public and a security liability ?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=R610XnTVwIo\" data-code=\"R610XnTVwIo\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/R610XnTVwIo/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 05-24-2024, 06:15 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-24T23:56:16-07:00","id":1536234,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar4967_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"4967\" data-vbnamecard=\"4967\">lbeaumanior</a><br /> <br /> I imagine the MGMT song &quot;Time to Pretend&quot; playing as Caerus enters the Spire.<br /> <br /> Give me a Composure + Empathy or Socialize for meeting Trish for the first time +1 because you are already &quot;swooned&quot; by Joanna.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27436,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","user":"CalvinSiler","date":". 05-25-2024, 02:59 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-25T07:35:08-07:00","id":1536252,"title":"","content":"Composure (3) + Empathy (1) + Swooned (1) = 5 dice<br /> <br /> <b>10</b>, 3, 2, 6, 6, 1 = 1 success","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-25T07:43:27-07:00","id":1536253,"title":"","content":"Remember I have 2 rolls each where I can use any skills of the same category for the goal of <i>&quot;Survive today's danger while benefiting&quot;</i> and <i>&quot;Help Jo&quot; </i>\u200b<br /> <br /> And since I am under the<i> Fools Rush In</i> effect I am also able to &quot;act with perfect grace and timing&quot;, I shall not suffer untrained penalties during the sp ell\u2019s Duration. If entering an unfamiliar social situation, the subject\u2019s impression level also improves by one.\u200b","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-25T16:47:23-07:00","id":1536277,"title":"","content":"No Condition is imposed. What would you like to do? What is Caerus' goal?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-26T00:54:05-07:00","id":1536286,"title":"","content":"Survive today's danger, help Jo AND find out about Tyche. In that order. Prioritizing in that same sequence if he has to pick and choose goals.<br /> <br /> Caerus has slightly above average social skills but is not the world best diplomat. He is likely to ask bluntly &quot;Do you by any chance know a woman named Tyche?&quot; if he gets too excited.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4967,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","user":"lbeaumanior","date":". 05-26-2024, 04:05 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-26T04:23:36-07:00","id":1536289,"title":"","content":"OK. Well when you cast Serendipity with the goal of &quot;to survive the foretold danger and benefit from it&quot; (emphasis on <i>Benefit</i>) Fate told you that your best course of action was to come to the Spire and make contact with Trish. Serendipity caused you to remember that Tyche said an &quot;Iron Pyramid&quot; has something to do with the Seers and the Exarchs. And you are now inside a huge &quot;Iron Pyramid&quot;. Maybe this place is some sort of headquarters for Seers. When you cast Serendipity a second time with the goal of &quot;to help Jo&quot; Fate told you the best way to help Jo was to go in the direction of the basement of her Gran's flat building.<br /> <br /> Divination seemed to indicate that unless you change something Trish will likely be present in the future when something terrible happens to Jo which involves the sound of clothes ripping off and her bones dislocating and snapping out of joint and that you will be present there too, and that Jo will try to do something that you want her to &quot;stop&quot; because it is bad, and that the only way to completely avoid danger would be to avoid Jo and be somewhere else when Jo and Trish go somewhere after Jo gets off work tonight around 8 PM. You also know that if you and the Artfuls try to kill Trish, it probably won't work for some reason and she will survive.<br /> <br /> Divination also seemed to indicate that Jack, the psychologist from the clinic will be here at Jo's work when she gets off work, and that Trish knows some other guy named Saulil who's got loads of money to pay for Ubers and usually does what Trish says.<br /> <br /> Finally, Divination indicated that the best way to benefit from Jo's being in danger was to arrange for a situation in the future where two Seers you haven't met yet could use Jo for &quot;wet work&quot;, which you know from T.V is a sneaky way of saying assassination or murder for hire. And you know that in order for that to happen, you have to keep Jo from joining a &quot;pack&quot; and &quot;turn against her own kind&quot;, whatever that means.<br /> <br /> From your phone call you know that Trish is some sort of journalist who is working on a news story, and wants to help Jo, at least in part, because she thinks it will make a good news story, but that she doesn't want you to think that she is just doing this for selfish reasons but because she is &quot;worried about Jo&quot;.<br /> <br /> So it seems like some good first steps would be to find out how much Trish knows, whether she is a sleeper or a mage, and figure out how Jack and Saulil and other Seers are involved in all of this.<br /> <br /> <i>Fools Rush In</i> got you this far, but you got to do something or talk to Trish in order to get to the next step that Serendipity indicated would be the fortunate course of action for your goal.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-26T04:50:08-07:00","id":1536290,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>lbeaumanior</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1530141-god-s-away-on-business-mta2e-seer-chronicle-occ?p=1535822#post1535822\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">After awakening he was discovered by a Seer that only he seems able to remember (Tyche) that taught him a lot and initiated him in the Seers. To this impressionable youth she is what he aims to be: she was the strongest, best dressed, better looking, smartest and richest person he had ever met and she messed his worldview (in a good way), worked on his vocabulary, speech patterns, manner of dressing, on his magical training, and taught him that he is as special as he thinks himself to be, even his Shadow Name was picked by her. Tyche's disappearance is a really big blow to him, he has a bit of a crush on her.</div> </div> </div> </div>On the phone, Trish talked in a way that reminded you of Tyche, and now that you are here, looking at Trish...I mean you don't know where Tyche is, but Trish is now the &quot;Best dressed, best looking, smartest, richest person&quot; you currently know, and this whole place is messing with your worldview. and Tyche herself seemed to speak to you when you cast divination and indicate that Trish was her &quot;servant&quot; in some way and that helping her would eventually lead you back to Tyche.<br /> <br /> I changed my mind. I'm giving you the <b>Inspired</b> condition in relation to meeting Trish and being in the Spire for the first time. THIS is your TICKET to the TOP. No one can replace Jo in your heart, but you want Jo to have everything that Trish seems to have, and you want to be right there by her side. The only way for you and Jo is UP! (Cue &quot;The Only Way is Up&quot; song from the T.V. show The Only Way is Essex - sort of the British version of Laguna Beach, The Hills, Jersey Shore, etc.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27436,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","user":"CalvinSiler","date":". 05-26-2024, 07:58 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-26T20:32:16-07:00","id":1536327,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar27436_1.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27436\" data-vbnamecard=\"27436\">CalvinSiler</a><br /> I got then 2 instances of <b>Inspired</b>.<br /> <br /> Caerus goes to talk to Trish about Jo, about the potential he sees in her, a Rags-To-Riches that is just about be... And that the horrible living conditions could impede her so Jo needs Trish's aid to be known, to be an inspiration to other kids, the videos should help, almost certain that Trish knows someone that would be interested in sports videos in London Area? Something like the New Moon film production? Or anyone interested in a story like Jo's?<br /> <br /> Manipulation (3) + Subterfuge (3) + Half-Truths specialty (1) = 7 dice<br /> <br /> 3, 3, 9, 8, 10, 9, 5, 7 = 4 successes<br /> <br /> IF this skill roll was not Subterfuge I use the Serendipity effect to use a skill of the same type (Social) and the skill is Subterfuge.<br /> <br /> And I use the first <b>Inspired </b>condition to have an extraordinary success on trying to help Jo. So I recover 1 WP and I get an extraordinary success on 3 successes (I got four here).<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Since I solved a Ex Success Condition from Spell casting I get an ARcane Beat. I should be at my full WP track now.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Let me know if I have to modify something.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4967,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","user":"lbeaumanior","date":".  Fixed content. 05-27-2024, 01:56 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-27T12:03:22-07:00","id":1536375,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27809-victorofnyke\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27809\" data-vbnamecard=\"27809\">VictorOfNyke</a> and <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28057-nickeldan\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28057\" data-vbnamecard=\"28057\">nickeldan</a> Feel free to respond to <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar27258_4.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27258\" data-vbnamecard=\"27258\">Cauthon</a> . The timelines will merge eventually.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-27T14:15:15-07:00","id":1536383,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar27436_1.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27436\" data-vbnamecard=\"27436\">CalvinSiler</a><br /> Caerus dismisses the &quot;Help Jo&quot; <i>Serendipity</i>, he thinks he has achieved as much as he could with Trish.<br /> <br /> He accepts Trish offering of meeting these people, ASAP if feasible. But he is doing a mental note to cast something to findout if Trish was really making fun of him... Trish might be somewhat similar to Tyche, but she is NOT Tyche, he will accept lip from no one else, pretty or posh. If she was offending him, even as a slight joke, he will do something later.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Next step for Caerus, he wants to find out how to help Trish, and in doing so, getting closer to finding Tyche. IF this skill roll was not Subterfuge I use the Serendipity effect to use a skill of the same type (Social) and the skill is Subterfuge.<br /> <br /> Caerus should have spent 1 roll from each Serendipity (&quot;Help Jo&quot;, &quot;Survive will benefiting&quot;), and have 2 active spells: first <i>Serendipity </i>and <i>Fools Rush In</i><br /> <br /> Manipulation (3) + Subterfuge (3) + Half-Truths specialty (1) + Willpower expenditure (3) = 10 dice<br /> <br /> 2, 10, 3, 1, 1, 10, 6, 6, 2, 7, 8, 7 = 3 successes.<br /> <br /> Spending the other <b>Inspired </b>condition, and regaining the Willpower point, another extraordinary success. Since this is an non magical condition, I also get a regular beat for resolving this condition.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Current active Conditions from spell casting: Charmed, Informed, Steadfast<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> (How long do I need to focus to use Active Mage Sight?)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4967,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","user":"lbeaumanior","date":". 05-27-2024, 07:28 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-27T18:17:12-07:00","id":1536394,"title":"","content":"So far I've treated AMS as an instant action that is not immediately noticeable to non-mages. Which Arcana are you using?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-27T19:08:12-07:00","id":1536397,"title":"","content":"If I recall correctly, AMS is reflexive for Ruling Arcana, its why Mekhane could compress that and casting a spell into one turn.<br /> <br /> Looking at page 92 of the core book, that seems to be the case, being instant for all other Arcana. It imposes a -2 roll to any rolls unrelated to perceiving or using magic and, after [Gnosis] minutes, it requires a WP point to maintain it for the rest of the scene.<br /> <br /> In page 25 of <i>Signs of Sorcery</i>, it says the Peripheral Sight is pinged by any active, unconcealed supernatural effects. Since it cites active vampire Disciplines as being detected, I imagine that similar to Auspex, the Active Sight would ping it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-27T21:16:31-07:00","id":1536401,"title":"","content":"Yup. So did you want to use just Fate and Time, or go for Mind as well?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-27T21:18:04-07:00","id":1536402,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28057-nickeldan\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28057\" data-vbnamecard=\"28057\">nickeldan</a><br /> Looks like you will be doing double duty as Saulil is in two different scenes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-27T22:41:27-07:00","id":1536404,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>lbeaumanior</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1530141-god-s-aw