ed, Informed, Steadfast<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> (How long do I need to focus to use Active Mage Sight?)</div> </div> </div> </div><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar27436_1.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27436\" data-vbnamecard=\"27436\">CalvinSiler</a> <br /> I saw your reply in the IC thread. So did I not do this? Do I still have the <b>Inspired </b>condition? I just want to confirm because Caerus was using the AMS on Trish but no details what has he seen nor whether this sequence did apply.<br /> <br /> What I bolded Caerus did in any case.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4967,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","user":"lbeaumanior","date":". 05-28-2024, 01:45 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-27T23:29:18-07:00","id":1536408,"title":"","content":"Sorry for the confusion. I wanted to post something that would allow <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28057-nickeldan\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28057\" data-vbnamecard=\"28057\">nickeldan</a> to respond as soon as possible (he usually posts late at night).<br /> <br /> With Fate you sense that Trish has some powerful connection to Arcadia and Fate in particular. If we are going with the storm symbolism for Caerus (up to you. I just thought it was appropriate because of the 'son of Zeus' idea) then he perceives Trish as a catagory 5 hurricane of Fate. She does have some kind of potent Destiny and seems to have an Oath that she is fulfilling. Mechanically Trish is an Opacity 5 mystery. If you speak with any of the other PC and share what each of you has learned then it will reduce the opacity.<br /> <br /> With Time you sense some sort of sympathetic connection to the future and time displacement, but you are not sure what it is.<br /> <br /> With Mind you sense that Trish does have a human mind, and you get the sense that she has some kind of extrasensory perception and is not subject to quiessence.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-27T23:45:09-07:00","id":1536410,"title":"","content":"Feel free to post Caerus' point of view and reaction to this information in the IC. I try to just present mage sight as mechanically as possible in the OOC thread, and allow players to interpret it however they think their character would in the IC thread. Same for imagos, mudra, and ritual casting. I don't won't to steal roll playing opportunities away from players.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-28T10:08:30-07:00","id":1536439,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CalvinSiler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1530141-god-s-away-on-business-mta2e-seer-chronicle-occ?p=1536408#post1536408\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sorry for the confusion. I wanted to post something that would allow <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28057-nickeldan\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28057\" data-vbnamecard=\"28057\">nickeldan</a> to respond as soon as possible (he usually posts late at night).<br /> <br /> With Fate you sense that Trish has some powerful connection to Arcadia and Fate in particular. If we are going with the storm symbolism for Caerus (up to you. I just thought it was appropriate because of the 'son of Zeus' idea) then he perceives Trish as a catagory 5 hurricane of Fate. She does have some kind of potent Destiny and seems to have an Oath that she is fulfilling. Mechanically Trish is an Opacity 5 mystery. If you speak with any of the other PC and share what each of you has learned then it will reduce the opacity.<br /> <br /> With Time you sense some sort of sympathetic connection to the future and time displacement, but you are not sure what it is.<br /> <br /> With Mind you sense that Trish does have a human mind, and you get the sense that she has some kind of extrasensory perception and is not subject to quiessence.</div> </div> </div> </div>I keep the <b>Inspired </b>condition, no extra beat from it, full Willpower track.<br /> <br /> Current active Conditions from spell casting: Charmed, Informed, Steadfast<br /> <br /> 2 active spells: first <i>Serendipity </i>and <i>Fools Rush In</i><br /> <br /> I will user Fate and Time AMS on Trish.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-28T10:12:07-07:00","id":1536441,"title":"","content":"<i>Serendipity</i> doesn't need to remain active, once you know what to look for, you are good to go. It just provides you knowledge on how to get to a goal or what openings you will find to call on a skillset.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/