rfectly tailored to your skillset. No spell control needed, if you know, you know. So long as the person doesn't Disbelieve them, they just seem ominously wise or prophetic.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-28T12:15:49-07:00","id":1536453,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>KaiserAfini</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1530141-god-s-away-on-business-mta2e-seer-chronicle-occ?p=1536451#post1536451\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Not afaik, you just have the knowledge on how to leverage the opportunity. Its one of the reasons a master Acanthus can seem like an oracle, they can give very vague advice over the phone (Reach for instant use, remote viewing and specific skills) that just seems perfectly tailored to your skillset. No spell control needed, if you know, you know. So long as the person doesn't Disbelieve them, they just seem ominously wise or prophetic.</div> </div> </div> </div><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar27436_1.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27436\" data-vbnamecard=\"27436\">CalvinSiler</a> it is up to you the ruling.<br /> <br /> IF the spell needs to be kept running, Caerus keeps it running, otherwise he dismisses it. Let me know so I can edit the texts...<br /> <br /> I can do nothing about the incurred paradox, but such is the price of ignorance, although I would be funny metatextually time fixing by editing the posts and never getting the paradox rolls. Very Acanthus.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4967,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","user":"lbeaumanior","date":". 05-28-2024, 03:25 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-28T12:26:44-07:00","id":1536455,"title":"","content":"I was just about to post the same thing. Yup. Normally Serendipity is a knowing spell that simply indicates the direction that a mage should take based on their goal (Which is why the results might differ based on what the goal is) e.g &quot;I want to find a pizza shop&quot; Turn left at the next intersection, or &quot;I want to avoid pizza shops at all costs&quot; Turn right.<br /> <br /> (Again, Time Knowing cannot tell you what course of action will be most &quot;beneficial&quot;, it can only tell you what the most likely outcome of the current trajectory of events will be. Divination [Time Knowing] and Serendipity [Fate Knowing] are completely different spells with completely different effects!) e.g. &quot;Will I find a Pizza shop if I turn left&quot; Yes, or with the +1 Reach &quot;What will happen if I turn left?&quot; You will find a pizza shop.<br /> <br /> Since Caerus cast with the +1 Reach on Serendipity, he has been substituting subterfuge for other social skills. I think the idea is that he is involved in a complicated task (benefiting himself while avoiding danger) and Fate is providing additional support.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-28T12:33:03-07:00","id":1536456,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>KaiserAfini</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1530141-god-s-away-on-business-mta2e-seer-chronicle-occ?p=1536451#post1536451\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Not afaik, you just have the knowledge on how to leverage the opportunity. Its one of the reasons a master Acanthus can seem like an oracle, they can give very vague advice over the phone (Reach for instant use, remote viewing and specific skills) that just seems perfectly tailored to your skillset. No spell control needed, if you know, you know. So long as the person doesn't Disbelieve them, they just seem ominously wise or prophetic.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's probably a better interpretation of what the rules say, based on the practice being used.<br /> <br /> For example, you wanted Tyche to answer your question when you cast divination, and she said &quot;If you help Trish, you will find me eventually&quot; but was very vague about what &quot;Helping Trish&quot; and &quot;Find me eventually&quot; would entail. Tyche is presumably very good at seeming to be &quot;ominously wise or prophetic&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-28T12:40:06-07:00","id":1536457,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CalvinSiler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1530141-god-s-away-on-business-mta2e-seer-chronicle-occ?p=1536455#post1536455\