b 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-30T21:46:52-07:00","id":1536605,"title":"","content":"Saulin will flash Death sight on Caerus as he enters the office. He's scanning for signs of magehood.<br /> <br /> Also, I don't know how familiar Caerus is with High Speech but on the base of the bonsai tree the symbol for &quot;Freedom&quot; is inscribed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28057-nickeldan","name":"nickeldan","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-30T22:19:03-07:00","id":1536607,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nickeldan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1530141-god-s-away-on-business-mta2e-seer-chronicle-occ?p=1536605#post1536605\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Saulin will flash Death sight on Caerus as he enters the office. He's scanning for signs of magehood.<br /> <br /> Also, I don't know how familiar Caerus is with High Speech but on the base of the bonsai tree the symbol for &quot;Freedom&quot; is inscribed.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Perception roll<br /> Wits (3) + Composure (3) = 6 dice<br /> <br /> 9, 8, 4, 5, 4, 5 = 2 successes<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar27436_1.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27436\" data-vbnamecard=\"27436\">CalvinSiler</a> do I realize the Atlantean Symbols? Or anything of relevance?<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Caerus tries to cast <i>Know Nature</i> as a Rote on Saulin, +1 Reach instant casting, +1 Reach findout Aspirations and Obsessions, +1 Reach findout specific ratings of Social / Mental attributes, +1 Reach for sensory casting, +1 Reach for going above Gnosis<br /> <br /> Gnosis (1) + Mind (1) + Subterfuge (3) + Willpower (3) = 8 dice (9-again)<br /> <br /> 10, 2, 9, 8, 8, 8, 10, 7, 1, 9, 5, 4 = 7 successes<br /> <br /> As it is an exceptional success, recover the Willpower point and get a Condition, I wish for another instance of <b>Charmed</b>.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28057-nickeldan\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28057\" data-vbnamecard=\"28057\">nickeldan</a> feel free to dispel or counterspell me if you can. Caerus is chiding himself for not using this spell on Trish. He attributes it to her being stunning in the beauty and the Fate sense.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4967,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","user":"lbeaumanior","date":". 06-02-2024, 12:27 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-31T10:26:24-07:00","id":1536629,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar4967_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"4967\" data-vbnamecard=\"4967\">lbeaumanior</a><br /> <br /> I think because you have a dot in seer status you should also have High Speech. IC Tyche probably taught you the rudiments. The entire room pings your PMS. Are you wanting to use AMS on the The <span style=\"color:#2c3e50\">Bonsai</span>?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27436,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","user":"CalvinSiler","date":". 05-31-2024, 01:32 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-31T11:13:06-07:00","id":1536631,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CalvinSiler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1530141-god-s-away-on-business-mta2e-seer-chronicle-occ?p=1536629#post1536629\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar4967_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"4967\" data-vbnamecard=\"4967\">lbeaumanior</a><br /> <br /> I think because you have a dot in seer status you should also have High Speech. IC Tyche probably taught you the rudiments. The entire room pings your PMS. Are you wanting to use AMS on the The <span style=\"color:#2c3e50\">Bonsai</span>?</div> </div> </div> </div>I am using the MAge template so I have 1 Status dot, High Speech, 3 dots of Rotes and 1 dot of occult. If I should use something different please let me know to fix.<br /> <br /> <br /> Yes, AMS (Fate &amp; Time).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-06-01T19:53:28-07:00","id":1536686,"title":"","content":"You sense that <span style=\"color:#000066\">The Bonsai</span><span style=\"color:#2c3e50\"> has some profound resonance with Time, and that it has traveled through time at some point. You get a sickening feeling of <i>deja vu, </i>as if you have experienced this precise moment thousands of times. </span><span style=\"color:#000066\">The Bonsai </span>does not have a Destiny per se, but it does seem to have interacted with the powerful Destiny of someone/something else.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-06-01T20:17:43-07:00","id":1536687,"title":"","content":"Week 16<br /> Sorry for the delay.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a>, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28057-nickeldan\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28057\" data-vbnamecard=\"28057\">nickeldan</a> , <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar27258_4.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27258\" data-vbnamecard=\"27258\">Cauthon</a> and <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar4967_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"4967\" data-vbnamecard=\"4967\">lbeaumanior</a> take 1 beat each for posting. <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a> and <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar4967_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"4967\" data-vbnamecard=\"4967\">lbeaumanior</a> take a beat for posting your asperations and obsessions.<br /> <br /> The basic recap is that Caerus, after briefly considering going into the basement of Jo's Gran's flat building with some mundane rat traps and poison and a few of his sleeper mates, decided to head towards the Spire instead. After being denied entrance to the building, he called Trish and she agreed to meet with him. Caerus learned that Trish, while not awakened, has some sort of supernatural connection to Arcadia and the Arcanum of Fate. Trish sets him up with a &quot;job interview&quot; with Saulin, and the two meet in Saulin's office which contains a mysterious indoor plant.<br /> <br /> Later that evening Saulin and Kusha continue to discuss plans to investigate the &quot;rat infestation&quot; in Walworth Estates, while Trish is looking for Jo somewhere in the employee section of the restaurant. Presumably Saulin is holding Caerus as an ace up his sleeve and will reveal his involvement to the rest of the pylon in due course. <br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28057-nickeldan\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28057\" data-vbnamecard=\"28057\">nickeldan</a><br /> I think <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar4967_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"4967\" data-vbnamecard=\"4967\">lbeaumanior</a> is waiting for you to decide if you plan on contesting his Knowing Spells with dispelation or wards of any kind. <br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a> and <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27809-victorofnyke\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27809\" data-vbnamecard=\"27809\">VictorOfNyke</a> Do Mekhaine and Berith have any imput into the discussion of visiting the Walworth Estates?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-06-02T17:08:39-07:00","id":1536720,"title":"","content":"Since I have 2 XP, I think I will invest in <i>Keen Periphery </i><i>(Signs of Sorcery</i> page 26), letting Mekhane's Peripheral Sight reveal the Arcana related to the supernatural ping detected. <br /> <br /> But before posting a reply IC, how recognizable are Berith and Saulin ? If they go to the Estates in their business outfits, they will probably draw a lot of attention. Mekhane had prepared to adjust his look to business casual before departing, but if people would recognize them anyway, it might be better to play into it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-06-02T18:38:24-07:00","id":1536724,"title":"","content":"It depends on whether Saulin decides to take his helicopter or not. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> JK <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28057-nickeldan\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28057\" data-vbnamecard=\"28057\">nickeldan</a> . I would definitely make you spend your resources merit for a helicopter.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-06-03T17:29:00-07:00","id":1536771,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>lbeaumanior</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1530141-god-s-away-on-business-mta2e-seer-chronicle-occ?p=1536327#post1536327\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar27436_1.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27436\" data-vbnamecard=\"27436\">CalvinSiler</a><br /> I got then 2 instances of <b>Inspired</b>.<br /> <br /> Caerus goes to talk to Trish about Jo, about the potential he sees in her, a Rags-To-Riches that is just about be... And that the horrible living conditions could impede her so Jo needs Trish's aid to be known, to be an inspiration to other kids, the videos should help, almost certain that Trish knows someone that would be interested in sports videos in London Area? Something like the New Moon film production? Or anyone interested in a story like Jo's?<br /> <br /> Manipulation (3) + Subterfuge (3) + Half-Truths specialty (1) = 7 dice<br /> <br /> 3, 3, 9, 8, 10, 9, 5, 7 = 4 successes<br /> <br /> IF this skill roll was not Subterfuge I use the Serendipity effect to use a skill of the same type (Social) and the skill is Subterfuge.<br /> <br /> <b>And I use the first <b>Inspired </b>condition to have an extraordinary success on trying to help Jo. So I recover 1 WP and I get an extraordinary success on 3 successes (I got four here).</b><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Since I solved a Ex Success Condition from Spell casting I get an ARcane Beat. I should be at my full WP track now.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Let me know if I have to modify something.</div> </div> </div> </div><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar27436_1.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27436\" data-vbnamecard=\"27436\">CalvinSiler</a> since I got an extraordinary success with Trish, shouldn't I have impossed a condition on her?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-06-08T21:34:17-07:00","id":1537059,"title":"","content":"Saulin will not interfere with the Knowing spells.<br /> <br /> He will not take a helicopter. He's not that gaudy. He'll take a ride in the back seat of his town car just like every other Londoner. Also, just a white polo shirt and khakis.<br /> <br /> &quot;Tell me, does one still wear a white sweater jauntily tied around the neck to these things?&quot; - Niles Crane","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28057-nickeldan","name":"nickeldan","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-06-09T07:58:35-07:00","id":1537086,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nickeldan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1530141-god-s-away-on-business-mta2e-seer-chronicle-occ?p=1537059#post1537059\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Saulin will not interfere with the Knowing spells.<br /> <br /> He will not take a helicopter. He's not that gaudy. He'll take a ride in the back seat of his town car just like every other Londoner. Also, just a white polo shirt and khakis.<br /> <br /> &quot;Tell me, does one still wear a white sweater jauntily tied around the neck to these things?&quot; - Niles Crane</div> </div> </div> </div>Cool, what does Caerus learn about Saulin?<br /> <br /> Saulin Peripheral Magic sight must have pinged when I casted the rote.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> And Caerus tries to ingratiate himself with Saulin:<br /> <br /> Manipulation (3) + Persuasion (3) = 6 dice<br /> <br /> 5, 10, 2, 8, 10, 10, 10, 7, 10, 7, 9 = 7 successes (Ex)<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> He is under the effects of <i>Fools Rush In</i>, so &quot;If entering an unfamiliar social situation, the subject\u2019s impression level also improves by one.&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Hell, this is my best roll ever, based on the original dice amount. I am afraid the dice gods will punish me in the fight scenes... Regression towards the mean and all that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-06-13T07:00:43-07:00","id":1537303,"title":"","content":"Saulin's Mental Attributes are Int 2, Wts 2, Res 3; Social are Prs 3, Man 3, Cmp 3. <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28057-nickeldan\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28057\" data-vbnamecard=\"28057\">nickeldan</a> I'm not sure what Sa